l":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/0a0cb149c8778ce30870e08b2837b6c8c9972f90"}],"sha":"740cb022ce908c9ce79168f4a056cfb87843ee75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/740cb022ce908c9ce79168f4a056cfb87843ee75"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74085496?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KDwevedi","id":74085496,"login":"KDwevedi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDg1NDk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/0a0cb149c8778ce30870e08b2837b6c8c9972f90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T06:01:04Z","email":"74085496+KDwevedi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kanav Dwevedi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T06:01:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(topbar): centre user-initial avatar + repaint dropdown icons (#111)\n\nTwo of the three remaining UI bugs from CCRS#505:\n\n1. **User-initial avatar off-centre.** Vendor `.user-img-txt` ships\n   `padding: 10px 15px; border-radius: 50%`, producing an ellipse with\n   the letter resting at the text baseline rather than the optical\n   centre. Replace with a 36×36 flex box + centred line so the initial\n   sits dead-centre regardless of letter width.\n\n2. **Edit/Logout icons invisible in the topbar dropdown.** The existing\n   override at L1414 already tried to repaint vendor''s `.navbar svg\n   { fill: white }` rule for the dropdown menu, but it targeted\n   `.header-dropdown-options` (plural) — vendor emits\n   `.header-dropdown-option` (singular). The old selector never matched\n   so the white-on-white regression survived. Add the singular form +\n   `.header-dropdown-container` to cover every dropdown surface.\n\nLogin background image (the third item on #505) is still waiting on a\ndesign call from Gurjeet (asked on the issue thread). Left for a\nfollow-up so this PR can ship the two confirmed fixes immediately.\n\nRefs: egovernments/Citizen-Complaint-Resolution-System#505","tree":{"sha":"85ae8a55f23dd8f7f6f11790d36d9009ca220018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/85ae8a55f23dd8f7f6f11790d36d9009ca220018"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/0a0cb149c8778ce30870e08b2837b6c8c9972f90","verification":{"payload":"tree 85ae8a55f23dd8f7f6f11790d36d9009ca220018\nparent d34ea4d974e3956f90ed344142af90339819ffdd\nauthor Kanav Dwevedi <74085496+KDwevedi@users.noreply.github.com> 1778565664 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778565664 +0530\n\nfix(topbar): centre user-initial avatar + repaint dropdown icons (#111)\n\nTwo of the three remaining UI bugs from CCRS#505:\n\n1. **User-initial avatar off-centre.** Vendor `.user-img-txt` ships\n   `padding: 10px 15px; border-radius: 50%`, producing an ellipse with\n   the letter resting at the text baseline rather than the optical\n   centre. Replace with a 36×36 flex box + centred line so the initial\n   sits dead-centre regardless of letter width.\n\n2. **Edit/Logout icons invisible in the topbar dropdown.** The existing\n   override at L1414 already tried to repaint vendor''s `.navbar svg\n   { fill: white }` rule for the dropdown menu, but it targeted\n   `.header-dropdown-options` (plural) — vendor emits\n   `.header-dropdown-option` (singular). The old selector never matched\n   so the white-on-white regression survived. Add the singular form +\n   `.header-dropdown-container` to cover every dropdown surface.\n\nLogin background image (the third item on #505) is still waiting on a\ndesign call from Gurjeet (asked on the issue thread). Left for a\nfollow-up so this PR can ship the two confirmed fixes immediately.\n\nRefs: egovernments/Citizen-Complaint-Resolution-System#505","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqAsIgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAP/wQAEUGlET0evAXj5zlzaaOxYJA\nmaduThMrzKPXqpuwIghgbHvRMJUSN8TutjcfJ0shefcPmQz0QTujT5+XwBA44XQM\nkS/uqfLKhAvH62e7xkXDsimCagKX7U+dMF+ZxpByYJ+D8FVdf664gmDeycXjAKhI\nbyMZeU9d1xa/M5QFeForSwXJb461y5AGC+z9guxADdWpaS5pTyMRWN+d53Gniz1C\nJPBTBIFiVp+OcEJIc5ehvdQV2DWk7b3bLZsPXnoFagz7UjahsYR2iztqokvhol/m\nFYDBc8nF623ZAmEjXrnnJkHhZnvxrRRQ4PBWas8+NoP4w8JO0AlmFHYBnPth4FuD\nEJChHitt5wY+TDvpz9goGAnpCN7nNjpZbkWseQ4+Snfa9xiFMO0js2Joyr7TWn+p\nD4Yb5RLIyZKvD6lTzzqbfLi4Zvu/Jw6MctMjeeH8RQT4kYABMxKNpXtTjKWHTZtP\nSNBApqlzH4N+ELTCA6UD1jTKlXqtJAT1QOU1eaErY9Hn1RZ3aptq9iHl7/kQM+gq\nW+Z84RlftvPXjncvkARDCRTBeY2YUNWj0EJaEBI0w1XnQgDyej1nz6VmuGFDrtfR\n7y4kzWeHBH2tT69Bq4dqQf/QPK4Hd9dpxZVR0tNwAstmpJX9/wc+zqNbujAuyLo0\ny0MnbFgHXyy3dhBw+lYi\n=v24k\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-12T06:01:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/0a0cb149c8778ce30870e08b2837b6c8c9972f90","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKDBhMGNiMTQ5Yzg3NzhjZTMwODcwZTA4YjI4MzdiNmM4Yzk5NzJmOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/d34ea4d974e3956f90ed344142af90339819ffdd","sha":"d34ea4d974e3956f90ed344142af90339819ffdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/d34ea4d974e3956f90ed344142af90339819ffdd"}],"sha":"0a0cb149c8778ce30870e08b2837b6c8c9972f90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/0a0cb149c8778ce30870e08b2837b6c8c9972f90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74085496?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KDwevedi","id":74085496,"login":"KDwevedi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDg1NDk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/d34ea4d974e3956f90ed344142af90339819ffdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T06:01:03Z","email":"74085496+KDwevedi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kanav Dwevedi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T06:01:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(employee-landing): drop Workbench card (#110)\n\nEmployee landing on Nai Pepea showed three tiles — Complaints,\nConfigurator, Workbench. The Workbench tile is dead weight: workbench\nconfigs are managed from the separate /configurator/ app, and clicking\nthe tile in digit-ui dropped users into an empty shell.\n\nRemoved the module from enabledModules, dropped the import + init call,\nand folded the rationale into the existing HRMS-omitted comment.\n\nCloses egovernments/Citizen-Complaint-Resolution-System#560","tree":{"sha":"d43bf2838875774fa300495250ac19d119a60568","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/d43bf2838875774fa300495250ac19d119a60568"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/d34ea4d974e3956f90ed344142af90339819ffdd","verification":{"payload":"tree d43bf2838875774fa300495250ac19d119a60568\nparent 898f0ace2a6bbe1308999f996be3d09b83ea91a4\nauthor Kanav Dwevedi <74085496+KDwevedi@users.noreply.github.com> 1778565663 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778565663 +0530\n\nfix(employee-landing): drop Workbench card (#110)\n\nEmployee landing on Nai Pepea showed three tiles — Complaints,\nConfigurator, Workbench. The Workbench tile is dead weight: workbench\nconfigs are managed from the separate /configurator/ app, and clicking\nthe tile in digit-ui dropped users into an empty shell.\n\nRemoved the module from enabledModules, dropped the import + init call,\nand folded the rationale into the existing HRMS-omitted comment.\n\nCloses egovernments/Citizen-Complaint-Resolution-System#560","reason":"valid","si