YWY5MDMzOTgxOWZmZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/898f0ace2a6bbe1308999f996be3d09b83ea91a4","sha":"898f0ace2a6bbe1308999f996be3d09b83ea91a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/898f0ace2a6bbe1308999f996be3d09b83ea91a4"}],"sha":"d34ea4d974e3956f90ed344142af90339819ffdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/d34ea4d974e3956f90ed344142af90339819ffdd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74085496?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KDwevedi","id":74085496,"login":"KDwevedi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDg1NDk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KDwevedi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/898f0ace2a6bbe1308999f996be3d09b83ea91a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T05:47:06Z","email":"74085496+KDwevedi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kanav Dwevedi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T05:47:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(citizen-profile): render mobile read-only when egov-user is the writer (#109)\n\n`/user/profile/_update` calls `User.nullifySensitiveFields()` server-side\nwhich sets `mobileNumber = null` before the DB write — the legacy\negov-user path silently drops any mobile change the citizen typed\nbecause the mobile IS the login handle and there is no OTP-verify\nguard on the partial-update path. The editable `<input>` on the v2\ncitizen profile was therefore promising a behavior the backend\nprohibits.\n\nThe Individual-service write path (`/individual/v1/_update`,\ngated on globalConfigs.INDIVIDUAL_SERVICE_CONTEXT_PATH) does accept\nmobile changes legitimately, so keep the input editable there. On\ndeployments where Individual is not wired (e.g. naipepea), render the\nfield read-only: keep the value visible (it''s still useful as a\nreminder of the registered number), drop the required `*`, dim the\ntext, suppress the onChange, and surface a help line explaining why.","tree":{"sha":"9eadc833883046f2f7a9272dc59168c8b5fcb11d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/9eadc833883046f2f7a9272dc59168c8b5fcb11d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/898f0ace2a6bbe1308999f996be3d09b83ea91a4","verification":{"payload":"tree 9eadc833883046f2f7a9272dc59168c8b5fcb11d\nparent 5fc655c9a3ade0a67c7e8cdb9f3e1eafe49e9394\nauthor Kanav Dwevedi <74085496+KDwevedi@users.noreply.github.com> 1778564826 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778564826 +0530\n\nfix(citizen-profile): render mobile read-only when egov-user is the writer (#109)\n\n`/user/profile/_update` calls `User.nullifySensitiveFields()` server-side\nwhich sets `mobileNumber = null` before the DB write — the legacy\negov-user path silently drops any mobile change the citizen typed\nbecause the mobile IS the login handle and there is no OTP-verify\nguard on the partial-update path. The editable `<input>` on the v2\ncitizen profile was therefore promising a behavior the backend\nprohibits.\n\nThe Individual-service write path (`/individual/v1/_update`,\ngated on globalConfigs.INDIVIDUAL_SERVICE_CONTEXT_PATH) does accept\nmobile changes legitimately, so keep the input editable there. On\ndeployments where Individual is not wired (e.g. naipepea), render the\nfield read-only: keep the value visible (it''s still useful as a\nreminder of the registered number), drop the required `*`, dim the\ntext, suppress the onChange, and surface a help line explaining why.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqAr7bCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1zkQACYtbIQCsg0KXb2T2cyh/Ksb\nZ3LM6BE6Cwhj049ZBnO8V+nyh9G45RWx8ED86wc3It4z3aLlBO0xQIGoqOek9qua\nZg0DhKmth6hTw4x0Sq+MeQmvZcZl8G3C05P9RfHJlUnNBDM6giQuY/r3ZGhWx+4g\nxzeR1yJjRWuwRa6mLf5r6JAsmL1R4YsY27aJm3LrQWkSGt478KmLq2pJZbPe09qn\n/R7iU00HWqggm15Kv1qAYtqmUAniXhRavjRvr6IUCkJMMpkMbDyEJIVFytz49HMO\nYhdPPdL7kti3FlHkMwXaU/EphisIwyDBmKpM0nzGxgVCjRbYjJC+whZrTi2WDyxC\nS2HMSa9Yq40oC7rHUSAxsgQIaWp1s649KF1EWeFWCXfEBdCTUkoO8QvCHOThEdVz\nd5kTmZr9GlKUf452kiHvW6fgFo+v0a5ZLewA565JDCucIwB48mQ/yY2JCC22d98x\nwT8KHkLyFLsfVtRKBIWnO9FhW7hoPSMf426vm6lGPkqOq4/3EYHBqnQNhZyf3jzF\nXy2RKbcZW2f53pksCVsjSFdVJIAgIysc703fo1I1GUZbM6DvVvro8dyT13Qkaj7q\nq78OeMjXydYzougSWgTHsLv2ghIV+1RMtXmkJcaihA6DCV3uut0owwhE9D/EdW/+\ntJic0wheS7tym4r7EGhz\n=AgiI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-12T05:47:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo