iZTI1MjIxNjlhZDYyYzQ1MjUyNzZiYjJkMWRkZjZkNGVhODY3YzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/6c4849b8092639f6260b235ee1bf2ab4a0c2370d","sha":"6c4849b8092639f6260b235ee1bf2ab4a0c2370d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/6c4849b8092639f6260b235ee1bf2ab4a0c2370d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/be04b70590781cb3b982d7919f499d41e739fef4","sha":"be04b70590781cb3b982d7919f499d41e739fef4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/be04b70590781cb3b982d7919f499d41e739fef4"}],"sha":"6be2522169ad62c4525276bb2d1ddf6d4ea867c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/6be2522169ad62c4525276bb2d1ddf6d4ea867c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/be04b70590781cb3b982d7919f499d41e739fef4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T09:50:21Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T09:50:21Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): citizen profile photo modal — replace unstyled drawer\n\nTester flagged the camera-icon click on /citizen/user/profile as\n\"brokenish UI\" — the legacy UploadDrawer renders a 1459×152 white\nslab pinned to viewport bottom with no padding, no max-width, two\nunstyled icon-button columns, a darkened overlay whose `zIndex` is\ncommented out (so the overlay paints below page content and never\ndarkens it), and legacy `GalleryIcon` / `RemoveIcon` glyphs from\ndigit-ui-react-components.\n\nRewrote in v2 chrome:\n- Centered modal (440px max-width) over a proper dimmed overlay\n  (`rgba(11,12,12,0.5)` with `z-index: 9999`).\n- Brand-tinted heading + helper text + an explicit close (X) button.\n- Two ActionRow buttons (lucide Image + Trash2 icons in\n  brand-tinted / error-tinted chips) — \"Choose from gallery\" /\n  \"Remove current photo\".\n- Hidden native file input wired through the gallery action with\n  the existing 5MB size guard + Filestorage upload pipeline\n  (response → fileStoreId → setProfilePic). Successful upload\n  closes the modal automatically (legacy left it open).\n- Esc-to-dismiss + click-outside-to-dismiss for keyboard\n  accessibility, matching the pattern v2 ConfirmDialog already uses.\n\nSame component contract as before (`setProfilePic`, `closeDrawer`,\n`userType`, `removeProfilePic`, `showToast`) — UserProfile.js\nmounts it the same way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ba1dc0930eda2714e914bd2a410117fda3f533a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/3ba1dc0930eda2714e914bd2a410117fda3f533a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/be04b70590781cb3b982d7919f499d41e739fef4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"a