m/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/dda241c5e9fa15f5b8447960a9b8cc804f7a4535/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:25:34Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:25:34Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): take-action button sits at content end, not fixed bar\n\nPer user feedback — there''s no need for the Take Action bar to be\nfixed at viewport bottom and visible at every scroll level. Drop\nfixed-positioning on `.v2-pgr-details .digit-action-bar-wrap`\n(desktop + mobile) so it flows in the normal document order at the\nend of the page, transparent bg, right-aligned button. Page scrolls;\nthe action row scrolls with it like any other content.\n\nRemoved the 96px bottom padding-bottom reservation on .v2-pgr-details\nthat was previously clearing the fixed bar — no longer needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b8feb9b6c1da2a9d6fd9e871297dff5cdcf2287","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/4b8feb9b6c1da2a9d6fd9e871297dff5cdcf2287"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/dda241c5e9fa15f5b8447960a9b8cc804f7a4535","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakh