https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/8bdcd3b249f874962558f3fe1b52d6d1eb53dab2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:23:03Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:23:03Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): complaint-details map visible on mobile\n\nThe location map sits inside a `.digit-viewcard-field-pair` (no\n`.inline` modifier — the map is a \"block\" pair, not a label/value\npair). The mobile column-stack rule only covered the `.inline`\nvariant, so the non-inline pair stayed flex-row at ≤47.99rem and\nthe value column collapsed to 0px. Map rendered but with width:0,\ninvisible.\n\nLoosen the column-stack rule on `.v2-pgr-details` mobile to cover\nEVERY `.digit-viewcard-field-pair` (with or without `.inline`) and\nforce value-column children to `width: 100%` so the map''s relative\ncontainer has actual width to fill.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5cfc41ec5c9287d0520837edbf4a12defe379c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/a5cfc41ec5c9287d0520837edbf4a12defe379c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/8bdcd3b249f874962558f3fe1b52d6d1eb53dab2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following