","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/fe3a9c888546844c0d6382d114a7fc0f874d4981/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:17:46Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:17:46Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): pagination rows-per-page reads as a compact native select\n\nThe native `<select>` inside `.rdt_Pagination` was getting the\nunified-input rule''s 44px height + 12px padding, leaving a tall\n42×46 box with the browser''s native chevron stuck at the top and\n\"10\" floated below it.\n\nReset to the dimensions the data-table footer expects: height auto,\n2/6 padding, 4px radius, light-gray border. Browser draws its own\nchevron normally now.\n\nThe \"ROWS_PER_PAGE\" raw label is left for a separate pass — that''s\na `paginationComponentOptions` prop the InboxSearchComposer consumer\ndoesn''t pass through, not a CSS issue.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f728a27f034a302c853b78410e1511ce4a314e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/9f728a27f034a302c853b78410e1511ce4a314e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/fe3a9c888546844c0d6382d114a7fc0f874d4981","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.gith