"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/52c058ba1103c2a1c2073db4efe5ac1354462e3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:15:20Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:15:20Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): create-complaint width cap + phone prefix yellow scope\n\nTwo visual hits on /employee/pgr/create-complaint:\n\n- Complainant Name + Postal Code .digit-text-input-field wrappers\n  stretched to 764px while the dropdown column was capped at 600px,\n  giving a ragged right edge. Cap every wrapper on this surface to\n  the same 600px the dropdown triggers use.\n\n- Complainant Phone No was rendering with a fully-yellow input area.\n  The `.v2-employee-create-complaint .digit-text-input-field.prefix`\n  selector painted the WRAPPER yellow alongside the prefix button.\n  Drop the wrapper selector so the unified-input rule keeps the\n  wrapper white and only the inner `.digit-prefix` button carries\n  the yellow chip with a 1px right separator. Mirrors the fix\n  already applied to the v2-pgr-inbox surface.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bda24e3de9ae045cdb4411159c4e3deb99d0e845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/bda24e3de9ae045cdb4411159c4e3deb99d0e845"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/52c058ba1