l":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/e3944a3e40c0dbcf7191269800e477541a69b570/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:10:30Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:10:30Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"feat(modernize): forgot-password page in v2 chrome\n\nRefactored /employee/user/forgot-password from FormComposerV2 +\nBackground scaffolding to the same V2LoginShell the login page\nuses. Carousel-on-left when bannerImages are configured, single\ncentered Card otherwise. Form chrome is raw v2 (Card / Field /\nInput / Select / Button) so it picks up the unified input rule and\nthe brand-yellow CTA styling automatically.\n\nAdded:\n- Inline page header + description (matches the login page voice).\n- Username v2 Input.\n- City v2 Select wired to Digit.Hooks.useTenants.\n- Primary \"Continue\" CTA + ghost \"Back to login\" secondary, both\n  full-width inside the card.\n- \"Powered by DIGIT\" footer pinned to viewport bottom.\n\nSubmit logic byte-identical to the previous version: validates\nboth fields client-side, calls Digit.UserService.sendOtp with\n`type: \"passwordreset\"` + tenant scope, pushes to\n/change-password on success, surfaces server errors via Toast on\nfailure. URL params now properly URI-encoded.\n\nV2LoginShell exported from login.js so both pages share the same\nchrome layout component (single source of truth).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8145be77f6c7b08c946e9ba033fcd779f825f829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/8145be77f6c7b08c946e9ba033fcd779f825f829"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/e3944a3e40c0dbcf7191269800e477541a69b570","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/e3944a3e40c0dbcf7191269800e477541a69b570","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKGUzOTQ0YTNlNDBjMGRiY2Y3MTkxMjY5ODAwZTQ3NzU0MWE2OWI1NzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/1b08d0ab2d32f8c729184d7ac40755bbe6a2eba9","sha":"1b08d0ab2d32f8c729184d7ac40755bbe6a2eba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/1b08d0ab2d32f8c729184d7ac40755bbe6a2eba9"}],"sha":"e3944a3e40c0dbcf7191269800e477541a69b570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/e3944a3e40c0dbcf7191269800e477541a69b570"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/1b08d0ab2d32f8c729184d7ac40755bbe6a2eba9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:07:38Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:07:38Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): exclude password input from type=text rule too\n\nClicking the eye toggle on /employee/user/login flips the input\nfrom `type=\"password\"` to `type=\"text\"` so the value becomes\nvisible. The unified `input[type=\"text\"]:not(...)` selector chain\ndidn''t include `.v2-login-password-input` in its `:not()` list, so\nthe moment the type flipped, the inner input picked up the unified\n1px / 6px / 44px chrome — the user saw a second border appear over\nthe password input that disappeared again when they toggled back\nto type=\"password\".\n\nMirror the existing `:not(.v2-login-password-input)` exclusion (already\npresent on the type=password / focus / hover chains) to every\ntype=text selector — replaced via replace_all so all 6 occurrences\nin the unified rule pick up the exclusion at once.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa49faa018c0a3d40f1e5efbb57c4ed46eca3269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/fa49faa018c0a3d40f1e5efbb57c4ed46eca3269"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/1b08d0ab2d32f8c729184d7ac40755bbe6a2eba9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/1b08d0ab2d32f8c729184d7ac40755bbe6a2eba9","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKDFiMDhkMGFiMmQzMmY4YzcyOTE4NGQ3YWM0MDc1NWJiZTZhMmViYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/eaf3780da6d202d13eea4a316e8bb8127d5aef30","sha":"eaf3780da6d202d13eea4a316e8bb8127d5aef30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/eaf3780da6d202d13eea4a316e8bb8127d5aef30"}],"sha":"1b08d0ab2d32f8c729184d7ac40755bbe6a2eba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/1b08d0ab2d32f8c729184d7ac40755bbe6a2eba9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/eaf3780da6d202d13eea4a316e8bb8127d5aef30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:06:48Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:06:48Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): kill leftover focus outline on password input\n\nThe previous reset (`.v2-login-password-input:focus { outline: none }`)\nwas being overpowered by a vendor global :focus rule painting\n`outline: 2px solid <brand>` — a green vertical line was visible\nwhere the input met the eye SVG.\n\nWrapper-scoped chain\n(`.v2-password-input-wrap .v2-login-password-input:focus, …`) plus\nexplicit zeroing of outline-width / outline-style / outline-color\nbeats the vendor selector. Same treatment applied to the eye-toggle\nbutton so neither child renders a focus ring; only the\n:focus-within border on the wrapper does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23f5ea06e6d0b983b1b180cee338d07132898e1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/23f5ea06e6d0b983b1b180cee338d07132898e1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/eaf3780da6d202d13eea4a316e8bb8127d5aef30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/eaf3780da6d202d13eea4a316e8bb8127d5aef30","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKGVhZjM3ODBkYTZkMjAyZDEzZWVhNGEzMTZlOGJiODEyN2Q1YWVmMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/c216097a92bba2a20d114694087ab32a4af5f634","sha":"c216097a92bba2a20d114694087ab32a4af5f634","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/c216097a92bba2a20d114694087ab32a4af5f634"}],"sha":"eaf3780da6d202d13eea4a316e8bb8127d5aef30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/eaf3780da6d202d13eea4a316e8bb8127d5aef30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/c216097a92bba2a20d114694087ab32a4af5f634/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:04:51Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:04:51Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): password focus tints whole wrapper not just input\n\nFocus on /employee/user/login''s password field was painting a brand\nborder on just the input portion, leaving the eye-toggle SVG outside\nthe highlighted region — the user saw a partial border that stopped\nat the SVG.\n\nMove the focus border to the wrapper via `:focus-within`, so\nfocusing the input lights up the whole rounded frame at once. The\ninner input + the eye-toggle button get an explicit focus reset\n(outline / border / box-shadow → 0) so they never compete for the\nfocus ring. Invalid state propagates the same way via the\n`is-invalid` class on the wrapper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36bfb28f2b38835d035f01cacbf0d70299ddc6df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/36bfb28f2b38835d035f01cacbf0d70299ddc6df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/c216097a92bba2a20d114694087ab32a4af5f634","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/c216097a92bba2a20d114694087ab32a4af5f634","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKGMyMTYwOTdhOTJiYmEyYTIwZDExNDY5NDA4N2FiMzJhNGFmNWY2MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/652e920381800a41ebb223e705f6cd2b95eabc98","sha":"652e920381800a41ebb223e705f6cd2b95eabc98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/652e920381800a41ebb223e705f6cd2b95eabc98"}],"sha":"c216097a92bba2a20d114694087ab32a4af5f634","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/c216097a92bba2a20d114694087ab32a4af5f634"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/652e920381800a41ebb223e705f6cd2b95eabc98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:03:24Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:03:24Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): strip double border on employee login password input\n\nPasswordInput renders an outer div carrying the 1px visible border\n+ 6px radius and an inner bare input that holds the value while the\nsibling eye-toggle button sits beside it. The unified\n`input[type=\"password\"]:not(...)` rule was matching the inner input\nand stamping the same chrome on top, producing a visible inner box\ninside the wrapper — the user saw \"double borders one until the\neye svg and another one whole\".\n\nSame pattern as the citizen login phone input (`v2-login-phone-input`)\nand the OTP boxes (`v2-otp-box`): add `v2-login-password-input` to\nthe inner element and a matching `:not()` to the unified rule. The\nwrapper div is the canonical border-bearer; the input is borderless\nand transparent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0704b6fb2244ea09be101355f499898a022d4087","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/0704b6fb2244ea09be101355f499898a022d4087"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/652e920381800a41ebb223e705f6cd2b95eabc98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/652e920381800a41ebb223e705f6cd2b95eabc98","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKDY1MmU5MjAzODE4MDBhNDFlYmIyMjNlNzA1ZjZjZDJiOTVlYWJjOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/e3d54a191bae1249c9cd35456c469aea3da1a3e2","sha":"e3d54a191bae1249c9cd35456c469aea3da1a3e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/e3d54a191bae1249c9cd35456c469aea3da1a3e2"}],"sha":"652e920381800a41ebb223e705f6cd2b95eabc98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/652e920381800a41ebb223e705f6cd2b95eabc98"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/e3d54a191bae1249c9cd35456c469aea3da1a3e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:01:28Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:01:28Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): citizen logout lands on /citizen/login, not employee\n\nUserService.logout() picked the redirect URL as `/digit-ui/citizen`\nfor citizen sessions — just the root. After the same function then\nruns `localStorage.clear() + sessionStorage.clear()`, the App router\nboots at /digit-ui/citizen with NO stored userType to resolve from,\nfalls back to the employee shell, and lands the user on\n/employee/user/language-selection. Wrong screen for \"you''ve been\nlogged out\".\n\nAnchor the redirect to `/citizen/login` explicitly so the citizen\nlogout sends them to the login form they expect. Employee path is\nunchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24ba97b234a19d8180ad85741d9e96b613ba70bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/24ba97b234a19d8180ad85741d9e96b613ba70bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/e3d54a191bae1249c9cd35456c469aea3da1a3e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/e3d54a191bae1249c9cd35456c469aea3da1a3e2","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKGUzZDU0YTE5MWJhZTEyNDljOWNkMzU0NTZjNDY5YWVhM2RhMWEzZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/6755d5bfc966e85e2a1a7f18dd6c186b26539e52","sha":"6755d5bfc966e85e2a1a7f18dd6c186b26539e52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/6755d5bfc966e85e2a1a7f18dd6c186b26539e52"}],"sha":"e3d54a191bae1249c9cd35456c469aea3da1a3e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/e3d54a191bae1249c9cd35456c469aea3da1a3e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/6755d5bfc966e85e2a1a7f18dd6c186b26539e52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T11:58:28Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T11:58:28Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): mobile Hamburger drawer themed green\n\nThe citizen mobile drawer was rendering with `theme=\"light\"` —\na stale value from PR #99 when the v2 desktop sidebar was white.\nNow that the desktop sidebar reads `--color-sidebar-bg` (Nairobi\ngreen on naipepea), the mobile drawer was the only sidebar\nsurface still showing white. Flipped to `theme=\"dark\"` so both\nviewports match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76b45f0ab3ed8afa1c510b3427ff6b7b61685f71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/76b45f0ab3ed8afa1c510b3427ff6b7b61685f71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/6755d5bfc966e85e2a1a7f18dd6c186b26539e52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/6755d5bfc966e85e2a1a7f18dd6c186b26539e52","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKDY3NTVkNWJmYzk2NmU4NWUyYTFhN2YxOGRkNmMxODZiMjY1MzllNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/b90279cd50a4af7b2bee109d7a1c10963419c704","sha":"b90279cd50a4af7b2bee109d7a1c10963419c704","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/b90279cd50a4af7b2bee109d7a1c10963419c704"}],"sha":"6755d5bfc966e85e2a1a7f18dd6c186b26539e52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/6755d5bfc966e85e2a1a7f18dd6c186b26539e52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/b90279cd50a4af7b2bee109d7a1c10963419c704/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T11:57:17Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T11:57:17Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(modernize): edit-profile + language-selection get sidebar gutter\n\nThe citizen edit-profile route wraps in `<div class=\"employee\">`\n(not `.citizen`) — DIGIT shares one UserProfile component between\nboth userTypes and the outer layout class follows the rendering\ncontext, not the URL. The 260px sidebar-gutter rule was scoped to\n`.citizen .center-container.citizen-home-container...` which silently\nmissed `/citizen/user/profile`, leaving the form sitting underneath\nthe fixed v2 sidebar.\n\nDrop the `.citizen` ancestor — `:has(> aside.v2-scope)` is enough on\nits own to gate the rule. The aside-v2-scope is only ever mounted by\nthe v2 CitizenSidebar component (citizen-route exclusive); employee\nsurfaces don''t use `.citizen-home-container` to begin with, so the\nloosened selector is a no-op on every employee page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd7521978964c83d91d270d1fa172c3543607c69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/fd7521978964c83d91d270d1fa172c3543607c69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/b90279cd50a4af7b2bee109d7a1c10963419c704","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","or