/d8ca929352641633dbc900f6f5bc829a70acb392"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/aaf1014576b27f0a1d2478d63c49e7d402a9251d","sha":"aaf1014576b27f0a1d2478d63c49e7d402a9251d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/aaf1014576b27f0a1d2478d63c49e7d402a9251d"}],"sha":"550173a7d93ef2bd57ac8306946056b1be73c579","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/550173a7d93ef2bd57ac8306946056b1be73c579"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/aaf1014576b27f0a1d2478d63c49e7d402a9251d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T10:50:21Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T10:50:21Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(pgr-inbox): tighten filter popup — equal CTA heights, flush checkboxes, scroll past action bar\n\nThree follow-ups Chakshu/the user flagged on the inbox-v2 mobile filter\npopup:\n\n1. **Status checkboxes hidden behind Clear All / Apply.** The\n   `.digit-action-bar-wrap` is `position: fixed; bottom: 0; height: 128px`\n   on mobile, so the bottom of the scrollable form was painted over.\n   Add `padding-bottom: 144px` to `.digit-popup-children-wrap` so all\n   form content can scroll past the fixed action bar.\n\n2. **Clear All taller than Apply.** Clear was rendered with the\n   `.digit-button-secondary.large` size variant, whose inner H2''s\n   `margin: 16.6px 0` pushed the button to ~71px tall while Apply\n   (`.digit-submit-bar`) sat at 40px. Force both buttons to 40px and\n   zero the H2 margin / line-height so the stack reads balanced.\n\n3. **No gap between stacked Clear All / Apply.** Parent\n   `.digit-search-button-wrapper.inbox` was display: block. Switch to\n   flex-column with `gap: 8px`.\n\n4. **Status checkboxes had ~23px left padding vs the Status label.**\n   The (opacity: 0) input still consumed 16px of layout space before\n   the visible square, so the checkbox glyph started at x=40 while the\n   Status header sat at x=17. Position the input absolutely (popup-\n   scoped) and shrink the wrapper div to 24px so the visible square\n   sits flush at the container''s left edge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51ea778dcbe49d70afdad6bbeac189ac25857f8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/51ea778dcbe49d70afdad6bbeac189ac25857f8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/aaf1014576b27f0a1d2478d63c49e7d402a9251d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/aaf1014576b27f0a1d2478d63c49e7d402a9251d","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKGFhZjEwMTQ1NzZiMjdmMGExZDI0NzhkNjNjNDllN2Q0MDJhOTI1MWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/1275d7f04d09319cf43e0c088cc65a846c86200c","sha":"1275d7f04d09319cf43e0c088cc65a846c86200c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/1275d7f04d09319cf43e0c088cc65a846c86200c"}],"sha":"aaf1014576b27f0a1d2478d63c49e7d402a9251d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/aaf1014576b27f0a1d2478d63c49e7d402a9251d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/1275d7f04d09319cf43e0c088cc65a846c86200c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T10:38:25Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T10:38:25Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(pgr-inbox): mobile filter/search popup fullscreen + close stuck overlay\n\nTwo related issues on the inbox-v2 mobile filter and search popups:\n\n1. **Closing the X left the bg-blur overlay stuck.**\n   `InboxSearchComposer` rendered `<PopUp>` with NO `onClose` /\n   `onOverlayClick` props. The PopUp atom''s built-in × and overlay-click\n   both call `props.onClose` — when missing, the wrapper animates to\n   scale(0) (`closing` class) but the parent''s `popup` state never\n   flips, so the overlay stays mounted and the page is unusable. Wire\n   `onClose={handlePopupClose}` and `onOverlayClick={handlePopupClose}`\n   so the parent state actually clears.\n\n2. **Modal content didn''t fit on mobile.**\n   The PopUp wrapper sat at 91% width with the inner\n   `.digit-search-field-wrapper` rendering as a 3-column grid of fixed\n   80px columns, so dropdowns were clipped, header truncated, and\n   labels wrapped char-by-char. On phones (<= 600px):\n   - Make the PopUp wrapper fullscreen (100vw × 100vh, no border-radius).\n   - Force `.popup-module / .digit-search-wrapper / .popup-label /\n     .digit-label-field-pair` to 100% width.\n   - Stack `.digit-label-field-pair` vertically (`flex-direction: column`).\n   - Collapse the search-field-wrapper grid to a single full-width\n     column with 16px gaps.\n   - Allow the popup-label header text to wrap so it doesn''t get\n     crammed against the close-X.\n\nVerified on a 320px viewport: Assigned-to + Complaint Subtype + County +\nStatus section all stack cleanly, dropdowns full-width, Clear All /\nApply pinned at bottom.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8698cbe5021376c566c74ba850f15c2c93465422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/8698cbe5021376c566c74ba850f15c2c93465422"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/1275d7f04d09319cf43e0c088cc65a846c86200c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/1275d7f04d09319cf43e0c088cc65a846c86200c","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKDEyNzVkN2YwNGQwOTMxOWNmNDNlMGMwODhjYzY1YTg0NmM4NjIwMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/594c5df04a7a1c6caa570ed1469d4e1700b48a73","sha":"594c5df04a7a1c6caa570ed1469d4e1700b48a73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/594c5df04a7a1c6caa570ed1469d4e1700b48a73"}],"sha":"1275d7f04d09319cf43e0c088cc65a846c86200c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/1275d7f04d09319cf43e0c088cc65a846c86200c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/594c5df04a7a1c6caa570ed1469d4e1700b48a73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T10:23:27Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T10:23:27Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(pgr-inbox): add MobileDetailsOnClick so mobile doesn''t crash\n\n`MobileSearchResults` (the mobile branch of `InboxSearchComposer`)\nunconditionally calls\n  Digit.Customizations[masterName][moduleName].MobileDetailsOnClick(row.mapping, tenantId)\non every result row. PGRInboxConfig only defined `preProcess` and\n`additionalCustomizations` — no `MobileDetailsOnClick`. So on mobile,\noptional chaining stopped at `MobileDetailsOnClick`, making the call\n`undefined(...)` and the page tripped the ErrorBoundary with\n\"Something went wrong\". Worked on desktop because the desktop\n`RenderResult` path doesn''t go through `MobileSearchResults`.\n\nAdd a small `MobileDetailsOnClick` that maps a row to the existing\ncomplaint-details URL using the `CS_COMMON_COMPLAINT_NO` cell from the\nrow mapping (same target the desktop column-cell Link uses).\n\nReported by Chakshu via WhatsApp.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6a75a9b6856773a1f9ecb1dd48d8487f2d61513","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/d6a75a9b6856773a1f9ecb1dd48d8487f2d61513"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/594c5df04a7a1c6caa570ed1469d4e1700b48a73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type"