//api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/670533f0f1afc7139d676a860a4b339114c5bc7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:59:23Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:59:23Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(mobile): tighten Employee Edit Profile gutters\n\nVendor sets `.user-profile.employee { margin-top: 6rem; margin-left: 4.5rem }`\nto position the card next to the desktop sidebar. On a mobile viewport\nthat''s a 96px top gap and 72px left inset that crops the card to ~210px\nof the 290px content area. Reset to a small `16px 8px 0` gutter so the\nform fills the screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14320090bc81bab49c1c0a8398b3c41849351be5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/14320090bc81bab49c1c0a8398b3c41849351be5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/670533f0f1afc7139d676a860a4b339114c5bc7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/670533f0f1afc7139d676a860a4b339114c5bc7c","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKDY3MDUzM2YwZjFhZmM3MTM5ZDY3NmE4NjBhNGIzMzkxMTRjNWJjN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/e8cf0272fe0cb13de7777be3579a1bbdb4f52d68","sha":"e8cf0272fe0cb13de7777be3579a1bbdb4f52d68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/e8cf0272fe0cb13de7777be3579a1bbdb4f52d68"}],"sha":"670533f0f1afc7139d676a860a4b339114c5bc7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/670533f0f1afc7139d676a860a4b339114c5bc7c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/e8cf0272fe0cb13de7777be3579a1bbdb4f52d68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:57:32Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:57:32Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(mobile): radio dot nesting + clickability + inline label\n\nFollowups to the unprefixed-Radio fix on the Filter panel:\n\n- **Dot rendered outside the ring** — the older variant ships\n  `.radio-btn-checkmark:after { width:1.25rem; height:1.25rem; top:10px;\n  left:10px }` which placed the 20px dot''s top-left at (10,10) on a\n  24px ring, so the dot overflowed bottom-right. Shrink to 0.75rem\n  centered with `top:50%; left:50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%)`.\n\n- **Click stopped selecting** — both the input and the visual ring sit\n  absolutely over the same 24x24 area; the ring spans paint later in\n  DOM and were intercepting clicks before they reached the input. Set\n  `pointer-events: none` on the ring + dot pseudo, and bump the\n  input''s z-index so it stays the click target.\n\n- **Ring + label not on same baseline** — the radio option container\n  rendered `display: block` so the ring (display: inline-block) and\n  label (inline) wrapped to separate lines on narrow viewports. Force\n  the option to `display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px` so the\n  ring + label sit on a single row.\n\nAlso: stack-rows rule for `[class*=\"data-table\"] .row` made status pills\n(`.sla-cell-success`, etc.) inherit 100% width and stretch into a full-\nwidth green bar on the Employee Details page. Reset those pills to\n`inline-block; width: auto` so they hug their label.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a569a9e474d4cd62746ec4436e23e7985cdea6d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/a569a9e474d4cd62746ec4436e23e7985cdea6d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/e8cf0272fe0cb13de7777be3579a1bbdb4f52d68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/e8cf0272fe0cb13de7777be3579a1bbdb4f52d68","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKGU4Y2YwMjcyZmUwY2IxM2RlNzc3N2JlMzU3OWExYmJkYjRmNTJkNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/bd5caee71a837d184b2038661acc411d407bf04f","sha":"bd5caee71a837d184b2038661acc411d407bf04f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/bd5caee71a837d184b2038661acc411d407bf04f"}],"sha":"e8cf0272fe0cb13de7777be3579a1bbdb4f52d68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/e8cf0272fe0cb13de7777be3579a1bbdb4f52d68"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/bd5caee71a837d184b2038661acc411d407bf04f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:49:34Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:49:34Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(mobile): same circle/dot fix for older Radio variant\n\nEarlier PR #91 fixed `.digit-radio-options-wrap .digit-radio-btn` (the\ndigit-ui-components RadioButtons), but the older react-components Radio\nvariant uses unprefixed classes — `.radio-wrap` / `.radio-btn-wrap` /\n`.radio-btn-checkmark`. That variant ships on the employee inbox Filter\npanel (\"Employment Status\" Active / Inactive radios), and exhibited the\nsame bug: input rendered in-flow above the checkmark, label and ring\npositioned beside each other instead of nested.\n\nRestate the absolute-overlay layout for the unprefixed selector so the\ninput sits invisibly on top of the checkmark and the dot pseudo-element\nlands inside the ring.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1a6945ff5e6c7c1fa30340e6698b839b92ce3e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/b1a6945ff5e6c7c1fa30340e6698b839b92ce3e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/bd5caee71a837d184b2038661acc411d407bf04f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/bd5caee71a837d184b2038661acc411d407bf04f","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKGJkNWNhZWU3MWE4MzdkMTg0YjIwMzg2NjFhY2M0MTFkNDA3YmYwNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/edc392209add318e5a629b804d3219e65117a8ed","sha":"edc392209add318e5a629b804d3219e65117a8ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/edc392209add318e5a629b804d3219e65117a8ed"}],"sha":"bd5caee71a837d184b2038661acc411d407bf04f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/bd5caee71a837d184b2038661acc411d407bf04f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/edc392209add318e5a629b804d3219e65117a8ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:47:00Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:47:00Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(mobile): match sidebar drawer to Nai Pepea green + close topbar gap\n\nTwo fixes for the mobile employee menu:\n\n1. Drawer bg color — vendor''s `.digit-msb-sidebar.dark` reads from\n   `--color-digitv2-header-sidenav` (defaults to #0B4B66, MDMS sets it\n   to #204D56 blue-teal on Nai Pepea). The topbar reads from\n   `--color-header-bg` which MDMS sets to #204F37 (kenya-green) on the\n   same tenant, so the drawer was visibly off-brand against the rest of\n   the topbar/footer palette. Route the drawer (and the\n   `.digit-msb-sidebar-bottom` section that wraps the Logout button)\n   through `--color-sidebar-bg` (which MDMS also sets to the green).\n\n2. Topbar/drawer alignment — the previous fix pinned the drawer to\n   `top: 64px`, but the topbar height collapses to 56px on the mobile\n   viewport, leaving an 8px white strip between the topbar bottom and\n   the drawer top. Drop the drawer to `top: 56px` so they sit flush.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8020fb4dad8468f72fd9023207a8270fe5c22ce7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/8020fb4dad8468f72fd9023207a8270fe5c22ce7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/edc392209add318e5a629b804d3219e65117a8ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/edc392209add318e5a629b804d3219e65117a8ed","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKGVkYzM5MjIwOWFkZDMxOGU1YTYyOWI4MDRkMzIxOWU2NTExN2E4ZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/9e62d0f93379762e3a4bb9cb7bbf040605afd0d4","sha":"9e62d0f93379762e3a4bb9cb7bbf040605afd0d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/9e62d0f93379762e3a4bb9cb7bbf040605afd0d4"}],"sha":"edc392209add318e5a629b804d3219e65117a8ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/edc392209add318e5a629b804d3219e65117a8ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/9e62d0f93379762e3a4bb9cb7bbf040605afd0d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:38:01Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:38:01Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(mobile): restore line-height on My Complaints empty state\n\nVendor''s `.pgr-citizen-wrapper .applications-list-container p\n{ line-height: 0 !important }` is intended to tighten date/badge\nstacking inside complaint list cards, but it also applies to the\nempty-state `<p>` (\"You haven''t logged any complaints yet.\\nStart with\none, make a change.\") on the My Complaints page. With line-height: 0\nthe two lines collapse to the same baseline and render on top of each\nother as garbled text.\n\nRestore line-height: 1.5 on the empty-state card (`.employeeCard p`)\ninside the same container.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14b4e517c5f59d16b66a69502cd2c7a5ca68484b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/14b4e517c5f59d16b66a69502cd2c7a5ca68484b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/9e62d0f93379762e3a4bb9cb7bbf040605afd0d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/9e62d0f93379762e3a4bb9cb7bbf040605afd0d4","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKDllNjJkMGY5MzM3OTc2MmUzYTRiYjljYjdiYmYwNDA2MDVhZmQwZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/75947e1aadf1fd5bee5f751c4a1dd7fd45b1de2b","sha":"75947e1aadf1fd5bee5f751c4a1dd7fd45b1de2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/75947e1aadf1fd5bee5f751c4a1dd7fd45b1de2b"}],"sha":"9e62d0f93379762e3a4bb9cb7bbf040605afd0d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/9e62d0f93379762e3a4bb9cb7bbf040605afd0d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/75947e1aadf1fd5bee5f751c4a1dd7fd45b1de2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:34:43Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:34:43Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(mobile): zero BACK button margin-left in stacked action bar\n\nThe BACK button (`.digit-action-bar-wrap > .digit-button-secondary.previous-button`)\nships with `margin-left: 4rem` to space it from NEXT in the desktop row\nlayout. Our column-stacked mobile layout inherits that 64px inset, which\npushed the 300px button past the viewport right edge (visible right=380\non a 332px viewport). Zero the inline margin so both rows align flush at\nthe action-bar gutter.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab39ce8c7efaa692ad337a62ac24d5b707f4e7f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/ab39ce8c7efaa692ad337a62ac24d5b707f4e7f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/75947e1aadf1fd5bee5f751c4a1dd7fd45b1de2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/75947e1aadf1fd5bee5f751c4a1dd7fd45b1de2b","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKDc1OTQ3ZTFhYWRmMWZkNWJlZTVmNzUxYzRhMWRkN2ZkNDViMWRlMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/083e839ea5ae919f622b0cd8128eccae620ebe97","sha":"083e839ea5ae919f622b0cd8128eccae620ebe97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/083e839ea5ae919f622b0cd8128eccae620ebe97"}],"sha":"75947e1aadf1fd5bee5f751c4a1dd7fd45b1de2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/75947e1aadf1fd5bee5f751c4a1dd7fd45b1de2b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/083e839ea5ae919f622b0cd8128eccae620ebe97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:32:40Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:32:40Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(mobile): stack action-bar NEXT/BACK vertically on small viewports\n\n`.digit-action-bar-wrap` lays out NEXT + BACK as a flex row. On a 320–\n360px viewport BACK steals 200px and crushes NEXT down to a 56px pill\nthat ellipsises its label (\"NEX…\" or empty), so the user just sees a\nfloating yellow square. Switch the wrap to `flex-direction: column` and\nstretch each button to 100% so NEXT and BACK each take their own row,\nlabels intact.\n\nReported on the citizen Pin-Complaint-Location step.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad96ec45b398eed0a3f18a31974377766360bcaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/ad96ec45b398eed0a3f18a31974377766360bcaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/083e839ea5ae919f622b0cd8128eccae620ebe97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/083e839ea5ae919f622b0cd8128eccae620ebe97","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKDA4M2U4MzllYTVhZTkxOWY2MjJiMGNkODEyOGVjY2FlNjIwZWJlOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/391552ae6cbfd90926bcd06e6f7df29601ea0350","sha":"391552ae6cbfd90926bcd06e6f7df29601ea0350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/391552ae6cbfd90926bcd06e6f7df29601ea0350"}],"sha":"083e839ea5ae919f622b0cd8128eccae620ebe97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/083e839ea5ae919f622b0cd8128eccae620ebe97"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commits/391552ae6cbfd90926bcd06e6f7df29601ea0350/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:28:50Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T07:28:50Z","email":"prtkjakhar@gmail.com","name":"Prateek Jakhar"},"message":"fix(mobile): pin sidebar drawer to viewport, restore CitizenSideBar\n\nThe earlier conditional-mount + outside-click rewrite of CitizenSideBar\ncrashed the page (an error in CitizenSideBar tripped ErrorBoundary →\n\"Something went wrong\"). Revert to the original `isMobile ? <Hamburger />\n: <StaticCitizenSideBar />` shape and instead use the Hamburger atom''s\nexisting `closeOnClickOutside` + `onOutsideClick` props (the atom''s\nlistener was already switched to delayed `click` so it doesn''t trigger\non the open-click).\n\nDrawer position: vendor''s `.digit-msb-sidebar` is `position:fixed; top:0`\nwith `z-index:1000`, while the topbar is `top:0; z-index:9999` — so the\ndrawer paints from y=0 BEHIND the topbar (you couldn''t see the top of\nthe drawer), and `height: 93%` left a gap at the bottom (Logout button\nclipped on small screens).\n\nPin the drawer below the topbar with `top: 64px; height: calc(100vh -\n64px)` so it starts below the visible header and reaches the viewport\nbottom — Logout is fully visible.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b34ff610671fc1575aed467a062237ba6592d9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/trees/0b34ff610671fc1575aed467a062237ba6592d9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/git/commits/391552ae6cbfd90926bcd06e6f7df29601ea0350","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65057795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prtkjakhar","id":65057795,"login":"prtkjakhar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDU3Nzk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prtkjakhar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/theflywheel/digit-ui-esbuild/commit/391552ae6cbfd90926bcd06e6f7df29601ea0350","node_id":"C_kwDOSD-TUNoAKDM5MTU1MmFlNmNiZm