fdb6e429fba89eb83ccd227cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T07:00:06Z","email":"samalexander10@gmail.com","name":"Sam Alexander"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T07:00:06Z","email":"samalexander10@gmail.com","name":"Sam Alexander"},"message":"Initial commit: EKAP React MFE — Webpack 5 Module Federation mini-app integration\n\nFull-stack enterprise HR chat assistant POC with:\n- React+Webpack 5 shell host and MFE remote (React props onComplete callback)\n- Python FastAPI chat service with intent classification and SSE streaming\n- Java Spring Boot WebFlux HR service with Weaviate RAG\n- Python doc-processor with Claude Vision document verification\n- PostgreSQL, Redis, Kafka, Weaviate, MinIO infrastructure\n- Architecture docs with Mermaid diagrams and README\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b575da6cce2b73262a4a906ac057dbb9b2e111f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samalexander10/ekap-react-mfe/git/trees/1b575da6cce2b73262a4a906ac057dbb9b2e111f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samalexander10/ekap-react-mfe/git/commits/8a7f2f5fb014abafdb6e429fba89eb83ccd227cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33788018?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samalexander10","id":33788018,"login":"samalexander10","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzg4MDE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander1