users/samalexander10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samalexander10/ekap-nextjs-mfe/commits/f7fd1ebf646b7c287c648adb2ff3c3a2325d273e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T17:05:23Z","email":"samalexander10@gmail.com","name":"Sam Alexander"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T17:05:23Z","email":"samalexander10@gmail.com","name":"Sam Alexander"},"message":"Add local dev setup and BDD Playwright e2e tests\n\n- docker-compose.local.yml: shifts all host ports +200 (postgres 5634,\n  redis 6579, kafka 29292, zookeeper 2281, weaviate 8280,\n  chat-service 8200, hr-service 8201, doc-processor 8202)\n- start-local.sh: starts Docker infra then Next.js dev server on 5000\n  and hr-namechange remote on 5001 with all NEXT_PUBLIC_* env vars\n- e2e/: playwright-bdd suite (baseURL: localhost:5000, chat at /chat);\n  name-change panel accessed as inline side column; remote MFE loaded\n  dynamically via loadRemoteModule\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"957d3eb2fb70ff66239191ee99c02b81b8448d5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samalexander10/ekap-nextjs-mfe/git/trees/957d3eb2fb70ff66239191ee99c02b81b8448d5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samalexander10/ekap-nextjs-mfe/git/commits/f7fd1ebf646b7c287c648adb2ff3c3a2325d273e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33788018?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samalexander10","id":33788018,"login":"samalexander10","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzg4MDE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samalexander10/ekap-nextjs-mfe/commit/f7fd1ebf646b7c287c648adb2ff3c3a2325d273e","node_id":"C_kwDOSEDj4toAKGY3ZmQxZWJmNjQ2YjdjMjg3YzY0OGFkYjJmZjNjM2EyMzI1ZDI3M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samalexander10/ekap-nextjs-mfe/commit/6036aab885229aa20f6bd1dad6e47e7285da75bc","sha":"6036aab885229aa20f6bd1dad6e47e7285da75bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samalexander10/ekap-nextjs-mfe/commits/6036aab885229aa20f6bd1dad6e47e7285da75bc"}],"sha":"f7fd1ebf646b7c287c648adb2ff3c3a2325d273e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samalexander10/ekap-nextjs-mfe/commits/f7fd1ebf646b7c287c648adb2ff3c3a2325d273e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33788018?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samalexander10","id":33788018,"login":"samalexander10","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzg4MDE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samalexander10/ekap-nextjs-mfe/commits/6036aab885229aa20f6bd1dad6e47e7285da75bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T16:43:23Z","email":"samalexander10@gmail.com","name":"Sam Alexander"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T16:43:23Z","email":"samalexander10@gmail.com","name":"Sam Alexander"},"message":"Upgrade shell to Next.js 16 with Webpack mode + dynamic Module Federation\n\nNext.js 16 defaults to Turbopack, so --webpack flag and NEXT_PRIVATE_LOCAL_WEBPACK=true\nare required for Module Federation support. A preload script (webpack-sources-fix.js)\npatches Next.js''s require hook aliases to prevent a circular dependency between the\ncompiled webpack shims and the local webpack package.\n\nReplaced @module-federation/nextjs-mf (App Router incompatible) with webpack''s native\nModuleFederationPlugin + a runtime remote loader (lib/load-remote.ts) that dynamically\nloads MFE containers via script injection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6dc14c8ecf8df5e122cd392041985c3e62aaac00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samalexander10/ekap-nextjs-mfe/git/trees/6dc14c8ecf8df5e122cd392041985c3e62aaac00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samalexander10/ekap-nextjs-mfe/git/commits/6036aab885229aa20f6bd1dad6e47e7285da75bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33788018?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samalexander10/followers","following_url":