outes the user could otherwise reach by deep\nlink or refresh.\n\nMove to /api/auth (better-auth''s default basePath):\n\n- apps/api/src/main.ts: mount Hono handler at /api/auth/*\n- apps/api/src/infrastructure/auth/better-auth.ts: drop custom\n  basePath override so it stays at the default\n- apps/web/src/libs/auth/client.ts: point client at /api/auth\n- apps/web/vite.config.ts: drop /auth dev proxy entry; /api\n  already proxies auth traffic\n\nHono matches /api/auth/* before the generic /api/* oRPC handler\nbecause it''s declared first, so oRPC OpenAPI routes are unaffected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"daa8ef6e813cf553e09b735480f190d2814ed38a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/git/trees/daa8ef6e813cf553e09b735480f190d2814ed38a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/git/commits/3c99c1ef6f10601760b7792e399f32d7186dbc98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52963042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyCode17","id":52963042,"login":"KeyCode17","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyOTYzMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/commit/3c99c1ef6f10601760b7792e399f32d7186dbc98","node_id":"C_kwDOSEL5CNoAKDNjOTljMWVmNmYxMDYwMTc2MGI3NzkyZTM5OWYzMmQ3MTg2ZGJjOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/commit/abffd5cf2f4fb6b9b7e5b1ed1262b10d8d9335f1","sha":"abffd5cf2f4fb6b9b7e5b1ed1262b10d8d9335f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/commits/abffd5cf2f4fb6b9b7e5b1ed1262b10d8d9335f1"}],"sha":"3c99c1ef6f10601760b7792e399f32d7186dbc98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/commits/3c99c1ef6f10601760b7792e399f32d7186dbc98"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52963042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyCode17","id":52963042,"login":"KeyCode17","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyOTYzMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/commits/abffd5cf2f4fb6b9b7e5b1ed1262b10d8d9335f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T19:30:39Z","email":"m.daffa.karyudi@gmail.com","name":"KeyCode17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T19:30:39Z","email":"m.daffa.karyudi@gmail.com","name":"KeyCode17"},"message":"fix(auth): set better-auth basePath to /auth to match Hono mount\n\nHono mounts the better-auth handler at /auth/*, but better-auth''s\ndefault basePath is /api/auth. Requests like POST /auth/sign-in/email\nentered the handler then hit the internal router at /sign-in/email,\nwhich doesn''t exist because routes are registered under /api/auth/*.\nEvery auth call 404''d, breaking login + signup.\n\nSetting basePath=\"/auth\" aligns the handler''s router with the URL\npath Hono delivers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24e548d5759f3b3e368b11cd6a87fab0b62f1556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/git/trees/24e548d5759f3b3e368b11cd6a87fab0b62f1556"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/git/commits/abffd5cf2f4fb6b9b7e5b1ed1262b10d8d9335f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52963042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyCode17","id":52963042,"login":"KeyCode17","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyOTYzMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/commit/abffd5cf2f4fb6b9b7e5b1ed1262b10d8d9335f1","node_id":"C_kwDOSEL5CNoAKGFiZmZkNWNmMmY0ZmI2YjliN2U1YjFlZDEyNjJiMTBkOGQ5MzM1ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/commit/20f8d74470dde5a1d04ff58e6ddbd70fb888265c","sha":"20f8d74470dde5a1d04ff58e6ddbd70fb888265c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/commits/20f8d74470dde5a1d04ff58e6ddbd70fb888265c"}],"sha":"abffd5cf2f4fb6b9b7e5b1ed1262b10d8d9335f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/commits/abffd5cf2f4fb6b9b7e5b1ed1262b10d8d9335f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52963042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyCode17","id":52963042,"login":"KeyCode17","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyOTYzMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/commits/20f8d74470dde5a1d04ff58e6ddbd70fb888265c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T19:25:40Z","email":"m.daffa.karyudi@gmail.com","name":"KeyCode17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T19:25:52Z","email":"m.daffa.karyudi@gmail.com","name":"KeyCode17"},"message":"feat(db): add migration for org/member/invitation/activity/rbac tables\n\nCloses the migration/schema drift surfaced by the audit: the\nrepo''s schema.ts defines 10 tables but drizzle only had a\nmigration for 4 (account/session/user/verification). Fresh\ndeploys running `drizzle-kit migrate` got an empty RBAC +\nmulti-tenancy layer, and seed/app startup crashed with 42P01\nundefined_table.\n\nGenerated with `pnpm db:generate`:\n\n  drizzle/0001_petite_scourge.sql\n\nAdds organization, member, invitation, activity_log, app_role,\nrole_permission + FKs, on top of the existing base migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"361e0467306272e8fddd4f1520bc0be327ade25f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/git/trees/361e0467306272e8fddd4f1520bc0be327ade25f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kana-consultant/saas-boilerplate/git/commits/20f8d74470dde5a1d04ff58e6ddbd70fb888265c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52963042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyCode17","id":52963042,"login":"KeyCode17","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyOTYzMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyCode17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kana-con