_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChiragBoghara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChiragBoghara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChiragBoghara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChiragBoghara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/ecba0edcba73652d2723eb3a34db6c7360710aca","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGVjYmEwZWRjYmE3MzY1MmQyNzIzZWIzYTM0ZGI2YzczNjA3MTBhY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/ad0e19a8f77d5bfddce6bc82b5f64a5395c3d1f3","sha":"ad0e19a8f77d5bfddce6bc82b5f64a5395c3d1f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/ad0e19a8f77d5bfddce6bc82b5f64a5395c3d1f3"}],"sha":"ecba0edcba73652d2723eb3a34db6c7360710aca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/ecba0edcba73652d2723eb3a34db6c7360710aca"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/ad0e19a8f77d5bfddce6bc82b5f64a5395c3d1f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T04:12:33Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T04:12:33Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Fix: comprehensive UI/UX polish — error states, Clerk @clerk/ui, mobile overflow\n\n## Clerk structural CSS warning fix\n- Installed @clerk/ui@1.6.0 and wired `ui={ui}` into ClerkProvider in App.tsx\n- Removed 4 structural CSS selectors from index.css (.cl-signIn-root, .cl-signUp-root)\n- Added footer/footerPages hiding via stable Clerk elements API in clerkAppearance.ts\n- Excluded @solana/web3.js + Solana wallet adapter deps from Vite optimization\n  (clerk/ui transitively pulls these in but they''re unused in this project)\n\n## User-facing error state improvements (terminal pattern + retry/toast)\n- Alerts.tsx: fetchError state + inline terminal error banner with RETRY button\n- NotificationCenter.tsx: useToast import + hook; markAllRead optimistic rollback + toast;\n  SSE console.warn gated behind import.meta.env.DEV\n- AlternateTimeline.tsx: fetchSaved failure shows toast for signed-in users\n- Resume.tsx: loadResume catch now shows destructive toast instead of silent fail\n- BuyCashStore.tsx: loadPurchases catch now shows toast instead of silent fail\n- ActivityNudge.tsx: Added useToast + checkin failure toast for user-triggered action\n\n## Mobile 375px responsiveness fixes\n- Charts.tsx: indicator panel dropdown w-[400px] → w-[min(400px,calc(100vw-32px))]\n- Charts.tsx: Claude modal w-[500px] → w-full max-w-[500px] mx-4\n- DailySpinWheel.tsx: spin wheel w-[360px] → w-[min(360px,calc(100vw-24px))]\n- Dashboard.tsx: portfolio stats grid grid-cols-4 → grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 3302911c-c6b3-43e3-b5bd-98e516406a85","tree":{"sha":"a45382e1f133cfb34074fc4ead3a1a7bd6ce2638","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/a45382e1f133cfb34074fc4ead3a1a7bd6ce2638"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/ad0e19a8f77d5bfddce6bc82b5f64a5395c3d1f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/ad0e19a8f77d5bfddce6bc82b5f64a5395c3d1f3","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGFkMGUxOWE4Zjc3ZDViZmRkY2U2YmM4MmI1ZjY0YTUzOTVjM2QxZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/15ea687cc0c52e6354945fe5881f2a58634ba646","sha":"15ea687cc0c52e6354945fe5881f2a58634ba646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/15ea687cc0c52e6354945fe5881f2a58634ba646"}],"sha":"ad0e19a8f77d5bfddce6bc82b5f64a5395c3d1f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/ad0e19a8f77d5bfddce6bc82b5f64a5395c3d1f3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/15ea687cc0c52e6354945fe5881f2a58634ba646/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T03:05:48Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T03:05:48Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Update application to use consistent terminal-style empty states\n\nIntroduce a reusable TerminalError component and apply consistent terminal-style empty states across various pages to enhance the Bloomberg Terminal aesthetic.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: 7ebb8cef-7688-4230-91cb-4b563c6b867e\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/9z8gPAe\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"e638faf4e57be0060cf086602db5754d10d90368","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/e638faf4e57be0060cf086602db5754d10d90368"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/15ea687cc0c52e6354945fe5881f2a58634ba646","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/15ea687cc0c52e6354945fe5881f2a58634ba646","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDE1ZWE2ODdjYzBjNTJlNjM1NDk0NWZlNTg4MWYyYTU4NjM0YmE2NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/878161340e3fa8c47606332bd27cfa2e42e8e845","sha":"878161340e3fa8c47606332bd27cfa2e42e8e845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/878161340e3fa8c47606332bd27cfa2e42e8e845"}],"sha":"15ea687cc0c52e6354945fe5881f2a58634ba646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/15ea687cc0c52e6354945fe5881f2a58634ba646"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/878161340e3fa8c47606332bd27cfa2e42e8e845/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T02:42:14Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T02:42:14Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Update documentation files with new table and schema information\n\nUpdate `all_defined_tables.txt`, `schema_files.txt`, and `used_tables.txt` to reflect current project schema and table definitions.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: 9b7bd338-c612-48d7-86d9-d691c130af9f\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/Rru35Tr\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"ca43a6df680b73f8a35da3b89bae364388d55d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/ca43a6df680b73f8a35da3b89bae364388d55d26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/878161340e3fa8c47606332bd27cfa2e42e8e845","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/878161340e3fa8c47606332bd27cfa2e42e8e845","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDg3ODE2MTM0MGUzZmE4YzQ3NjA2MzMyYmQyN2NmYTJlNDJlOGU4NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/caefc0774bb2538933234596328a77edc8c306e5","sha":"caefc0774bb2538933234596328a77edc8c306e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/caefc0774bb2538933234596328a77edc8c306e5"}],"sha":"878161340e3fa8c47606332bd27cfa2e42e8e845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/878161340e3fa8c47606332bd27cfa2e42e8e845"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/caefc0774bb2538933234596328a77edc8c306e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T01:47:15Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T01:47:15Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: implement proportional batch CapitalAllocator\n\nAdd CapitalAllocator class that performs portfolio-level capital allocation\nacross all strategy results from Orchestrator.runMulti():\n- Filters for EXECUTE/BUY/SELL decisions meeting min score/confidence\n- Ranks strategies by score × confidence product\n- Assigns proportional weights with per-tier caps:\n  core (score≥75, conf≥70) → 40%, satellite → 24%, speculative → 12%\n- Drawdown penalty: strategies with >25% drawdown risk capped at 10%\n- Normalizes total exposure down to maxExposure (100%) when exceeded\n  (never scales up, preserving per-strategy caps)\n- Uses stdDevPct from VolatilityMetrics as drawdown proxy\n- Each OrchestratorResult gets portfolioAllocation field with\n  {strategyId, symbol, allocation, rawWeight, capped, tier}\n- Exported from agents index, documented in replit.md\n\nFiles changed:\n- NEW: artifacts/api-server/src/lib/agents/CapitalAllocator.ts\n- MOD: artifacts/api-server/src/lib/agents/Orchestrator.ts\n- MOD: artifacts/api-server/src/lib/agents/index.ts\n- MOD: replit.md","tree":{"sha":"e13ca8eb5d61741c1af943d40d8441acd040f896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/e13ca8eb5d61741c1af943d40d8441acd040f896"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/caefc0774bb2538933234596328a77edc8c306e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/caefc0774bb2538933234596328a77edc8c306e5","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGNhZWZjMDc3NGJiMjUzODkzMzIzNDU5NjMyOGE3N2VkYzhjMzA2ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/3cd1cb50375aa58be1a84edf44337c423ad126b8","sha":"3cd1cb50375aa58be1a84edf44337c423ad126b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/3cd1cb50375aa58be1a84edf44337c423ad126b8"}],"sha":"caefc0774bb2538933234596328a77edc8c306e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/caefc0774bb2538933234596328a77edc8c306e5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/3cd1cb50375aa58be1a84edf44337c423ad126b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T19:00:42Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T19:00:42Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #170: Production Hardening & Funnel Integrity — Complete\n\nAll hardening items verified end-to-end:\n\nROUTES: All 14 commented-out routes restored (resumes, jobs, gigs, marketing,\ndailyContent, viral, launchChecks, giveaway, simulation, timeline, habits,\nlifeOutcomes, coaching, businessDocs). Confirmed non-404 via live API crawl:\n18/19 routes return correct status codes (401 for auth-gated, 200 for public).\nOne \"fail\" was /users/me returning 429 (rate-limited mid-crawl, route is alive).\n\nHEALTH MONITOR: All 10 endpoints pass. TaxGPT GET handler added → 401 (verified\nin logs). /admin/launch-checks uses requireAuth (admin auth gated, not admin\nbypass). /gamification/badges path corrected. API_INTERNAL_BASE_URL fallback\nadded (no hardcoded localhost). /status/services + /status/incidents added.\n\nCHECKOUT FUNNEL (verified):\n  signup → Clerk env validation at startup\n  → Dashboard welcome modal (OnboardingProvider)\n  → Pricing POST /stripe/create-checkout (restored route, verified 401 correct)\n  → Stripe session success_url=/profile?payment=success\n  → checkout.session.completed webhook → updateUserTier() activates tier in DB\n  → Profile.tsx (NEW) reads payment=success, shows toast, cleans URL\n\nSTALE CACHE: fetchWithCache throws on HTTP 4xx/5xx; stale data only on network\nfailure with console.warn. Tier data is never silently masked.\n\nCLERK: validateClerkEnv() at startup; /health returns \"degraded\" in production\nwhen CLERK_SECRET_KEY missing; CSP clerk.browser-telemetry.com added;\nenv vars documented in replit.md.\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 695e132c-3c86-4474-9474-53ea5d11d3b8","tree":{"sha":"dfe189f30594ce167a821ba64fefc56000aac4e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/dfe189f30594ce167a821ba64fefc56000aac4e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/3cd1cb50375aa58be1a84edf44337c423ad126b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/3cd1cb50375aa58be1a84edf44337c423ad126b8","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDNjZDFjYjUwMzc1YWE1OGJlMWE4NGVkZjQ0MzM3YzQyM2FkMTI2Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/73fe916573661fa418d2dce91d897e35380b1269","sha":"73fe916573661fa418d2dce91d897e35380b1269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/73fe916573661fa418d2dce91d897e35380b1269"}],"sha":"3cd1cb50375aa58be1a84edf44337c423ad126b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/3cd1cb50375aa58be1a84edf44337c423ad126b8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/73fe916573661fa418d2dce91d897e35380b1269/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T18:58:51Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T18:58:51Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #171: Data Integrity & Mobile Polish\n\n## Summary\nImplemented data integrity labels and mobile UX improvements across the EntangleWealth platform.\n\n## Data Integrity Changes\n\n### WealthSim offline/estimated mode\n- Enhanced offline mode banner to also display for guest (unauthenticated) users using client-side projections\n- Added \"OFFLINE — ESTIMATED\" and \"ESTIMATED · GUEST MODE\" labels depending on context\n- Added \"EST\" badge to each of the four result stat cards when projections are client-side\n- Added a prominent \"ESTIMATED — these figures are simulated projections, not financial advice\" banner above result cards in offline/guest mode\n- Added info note in wizard step 1 for guest users: \"These are example starting values — adjust all sliders to match your actual situation\"\n\n### Stock price \"Delayed\" badges\n- Replaced the subtle \"Simulated prices\" dot indicator with a prominent amber \"DELAYED · Reference catalog prices — not live market data\" banner in the Stocks page header\n- Added \"DELAYED\" badge displayed next to the price on the selected stock detail view\n\n### MockExchange paper trading labels\n- PaperTradingWidget already had clear \"PAPER TRADING\" labels in header, minimized state, and inline variant — confirmed and preserved. No changes needed as labeling was already explicit.\n\n## Mobile UX Improvements\n\n### Touch targets (44px minimum)\n- Terminal mobile panel tabs: bumped tab buttons to min-h-[44px], prev/next arrows to w-11 h-11 (44px)\n- PWA install button: added min-h-[44px]\n- PWA dismiss button: updated from p-1 (24px) to w-11 h-11 (44px) with proper aria-label\n- WealthSim wizard navigation buttons: added min-h-[44px] to Continue/Run Simulation and Back\n- PaperTradingWidget minimize X button: updated from bare icon to w-11 h-11 (44px) with aria-label\n\n### Bottom nav safe area insets\n- Added CSS class main-content-mobile-pad using calc(5rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px))\n- Class resets to padding-bottom: 0 at lg breakpoint (when bottom nav is hidden)\n- BottomNav already had safe-area-inset-bottom padding; content now matches\n\n### Drawer safe area\n- Added paddingBottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) to DrawerContent to prevent content cut-off on devices with home indicators\n\n### PWA install prompt\n- Verified MIN_VISITS=3, 60s delay, proper dismissal persistence via localStorage — no logic changes needed\n\n## Files Changed\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/pages/WealthSim.tsx\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/pages/Stocks.tsx\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/pages/Terminal.tsx\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/components/PaperTradingWidget.tsx\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/components/pwa/InstallPrompt.tsx\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/components/ui/drawer.tsx\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/components/layout/Layout.tsx\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/index.css\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 5555f11c-edb2-45c2-95ec-1732293f92a8","tree":{"sha":"3ba2df92c9fbaa241c3450dfd45236a98ae515c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/3ba2df92c9fbaa241c3450dfd45236a98ae515c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/73fe916573661fa418d2dce91d897e35380b1269","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/73fe916573661fa418d2dce91d897e35380b1269","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDczZmU5MTY1NzM2NjFmYTQxOGQyZGNlOTFkODk3ZTM1MzgwYjEyNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/628059cea340984333094f47318c074b8ec25c70","sha":"628059cea340984333094f47318c074b8ec25c70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/628059cea340984333094f47318c074b8ec25c70"}],"sha":"73fe916573661fa418d2dce91d897e35380b1269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/73fe916573661fa418d2dce91d897e35380b1269"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/628059cea340984333094f47318c074b8ec25c70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T18:05:10Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T18:05:10Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Update website''s social media sharing image\n\nReplace existing opengraph.jpg image file in the public artifacts directory.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: 9f1b848d-a739-41ee-8548-39cd7c8e2e5a\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/POm5YtR\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"25cb879641ed57d2ea248dfa73c4949e298ae333","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/25cb879641ed57d2ea248dfa73c4949e298ae333"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/628059cea340984333094f47318c074b8ec25c70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/628059cea340984333094f47318c074b8ec25c70","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDYyODA1OWNlYTM0MDk4NDMzMzA5NGY0NzMxOGMwNzRiOGVjMjVjNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/4db7fa0467e1aa32c3f164b302055fc4e8883ee1","sha":"4db7fa0467e1aa32c3f164b302055fc4e8883ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/4db7fa0467e1aa32c3f164b302055fc4e8883ee1"}],"sha":"628059cea340984333094f47318c074b8ec25c70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/628059cea340984333094f47318c074b8ec25c70"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/4db7fa0467e1aa32c3f164b302055fc4e8883ee1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T07:18:34Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T07:18:34Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #169: Trade Execution Safeguards — Idempotency, Position Dedup, Exposure Breaker\n\n## What was implemented\n\n### New file: artifacts/api-server/src/lib/agents/TradeExecutionGuard.ts\nStandalone guard module implementing all three execution-layer safeguards:\n\n1. **Idempotency layer** (`checkAndMarkIdempotency`):\n   - Auto-creates `trade_execution_idempotency_keys` table with PRIMARY KEY on key column\n   - `generateIdempotencyKey(executionId, timestamp)`: timestamp=0 → direct sha256(executionId); timestamp>0 → sha256(executionId:minute_bucket)\n   - Atomically inserts via `INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (key) DO NOTHING RETURNING key`\n   - 0 rows = duplicate (rejected); 1 row = first execution (allowed)\n   - Rejections logged to `agent_logs` audit trail; expired keys pruned async; fail-open on DB errors\n\n2. **Position dedup** (`checkPositionDedup`):\n   - Only applies to new position opens: `buy` and `short_sell`\n   - Blocks if ANY non-zero quantity position exists for the symbol (long or short)\n   - Returns `{status:\"skipped\", reason:\"already in position\"}` on block\n   - Activations logged to `agent_logs` audit trail\n\n3. **Exposure circuit breaker** (`checkExposureBreaker`):\n   - Only applies to new position opens: `buy` and `short_sell`\n   - Calculates total exposure = sum(|qty|×live price) / total portfolio value; falls back to avgCost\n   - Blocks when exposure ≥ 80%; exits/reduces unaffected\n   - Activations logged to `agent_logs` audit trail\n\n### Modified: artifacts/api-server/src/lib/agents/Orchestrator.ts\n- Step 0: atomic `checkAndMarkIdempotency(\"${strategyId}:${symbol}:${timeframe}\", totalStart)` — includes symbol+timeframe discriminators to prevent cross-timeframe collisions in runMulti/runMultiTimeframe\n- Properly typed stub objects for early-return (no `as any` casts)\n- `idempotencyGuard: IdempotencyGuardResult` field added to `OrchestratorResult`\n\n### Modified: artifacts/api-server/src/routes/paperTrading.ts\n- `POST /paper-trading/trade`: accepts optional `idempotencyKey` field; if provided, `checkAndMarkIdempotency(key, 0)` (direct hash, no time bucketing — true request-level dedup)\n- Position dedup + exposure checks run in parallel before order execution\n- `evaluatePendingOrders`: position dedup + exposure checks before every `executeMarketOrder` call; blocked fills marked \"rejected\" with reserved cash refunded\n- All guards only fire on `buy`/`short_sell` sides; exits/reduces unaffected\n\n## No deviations from task scope\n- Agent decision pipeline unchanged; no UI changes; no modifications to existing order types or matching logic\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 4fa1a890-aa11-4e08-9ab6-f74b7e02b480","tree":{"sha":"69e1354dba2f9960f103861926ad96dbaf29ff3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/69e1354dba2f9960f103861926ad96dbaf29ff3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/4db7fa0467e1aa32c3f164b302055fc4e8883ee1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/4db7fa0467e1aa32c3f164b302055fc4e8883ee1","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDRkYjdmYTA0NjdlMWFhMzJjM2YxNjRiMzAyMDU1ZmM0ZTg4ODNlZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/ff6b584474427682644f86d30103287ed9f6a1e1","sha":"ff6b584474427682644f86d30103287ed9f6a1e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/ff6b584474427682644f86d30103287ed9f6a1e1"}],"sha":"4db7fa0467e1aa32c3f164b302055fc4e8883ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/4db7fa0467e1aa32c3f164b302055fc4e8883ee1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/ff6b584474427682644f86d30103287ed9f6a1e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T06:35:29Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T06:35:29Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #168: Execution Layer & Exchange Adapter\n\n## What was implemented\n\n### New files\n- `artifacts/api-server/src/lib/exchange/ExchangeAdapter.ts`\n  - ExchangeAdapter interface: placeOrder, closePosition, getPosition\n  - OrderSide (BUY/SELL) and OrderType (MARKET/LIMIT) enums; OrderResult and PositionInfo types\n\n- `artifacts/api-server/src/lib/exchange/AlpacaExchangeAdapter.ts`\n  - Wraps Alpaca paper trading API; reuses resolveAlpacaCreds, alpacaCircuit, retryWithBackoff\n  - closePosition derives actual side from API response (sell=long close, buy=short cover)\n\n- `artifacts/api-server/src/lib/exchange/MockExchange.ts`\n  - In-memory position tracking for full execution loop testing without live APIs\n\n- `artifacts/api-server/src/lib/executionLoop.ts`\n  - runExecutionLoop(): consumes AsyncIterable<OrchestratorInput>, runs orchestrator cycles\n  - Kill-switch override applied inline before routing (forces EXIT when triggered)\n  - Error path uses OrchestratorResult | null (no unsafe casts)\n\n### Modified files\n- `artifacts/api-server/src/lib/agents/ExecutionAgent.ts`\n  - ExecutionAction extended with BLOCK (BLOCK | HOLD both route to no-op explicitly)\n  - Added execute(decision, adapter, sizeShares) method\n  - Idempotency key: sha256(strategyId:symbol:ACTION:windowedTs) — action included\n  - Publishes trade_executed after successful order placement (real orders only)\n\n- `artifacts/api-server/src/lib/agents/Orchestrator.ts`\n  - Learned failure block action changed from HOLD → BLOCK for semantic clarity\n  - AllocationAgent skips BLOCK actions (alongside EXIT/HOLD)\n  - Pre-execution event changed from trade_executed → episode_recorded\n\n- `artifacts/api-server/src/lib/agents/LearningAgent.ts`\n  - Subscribes to episode_recorded (was trade_executed) to receive decision episodes\n\n- `artifacts/api-server/src/routes/quant.ts`\n  - Added POST /quant/execute protected with requireAuth\n  - Live adapter only selected when key starts with \"PK\" AND secret > 30 chars (both required)\n  - Falls back to MockExchange if credentials incomplete\n\n## Code review fixes\n- requireAuth on POST /quant/execute (broken access control)\n- Kill-switch applied inline in executionLoop\n- trade_executed semantics: Orchestrator uses episode_recorded; trade_executed = real order only\n- BLOCK action type added with explicit no-op routing (no SELL fallthrough)\n- Idempotency key includes action to prevent cross-action suppression\n- closePosition derives side from API response (not hardcoded SELL)\n- Credential gating requires both key (PK prefix) and secret (>30 chars) for live adapter\n\nReplit-Task-Id: de981ef2-a32d-4959-84e8-5c10077256a5","tree":{"sha":"fa793fb2f07d6f9b9e1f903b180f2f93d8028dee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/fa793fb2f07d6f9b9e1f903b180f2f93d8028dee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/ff6b584474427682644f86d30103287ed9f6a1e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/ff6b584474427682644f86d30103287ed9f6a1e1","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGZmNmI1ODQ0NzQ0Mjc2ODI2NDRmODZkMzAxMDMyODdlZDlmNmExZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/dc9491fd507aefdffbfc18fcf85b33dd3a0690e4","sha":"dc9491fd507aefdffbfc18fcf85b33dd3a0690e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/dc9491fd507aefdffbfc18fcf85b33dd3a0690e4"}],"sha":"ff6b584474427682644f86d30103287ed9f6a1e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/ff6b584474427682644f86d30103287ed9f6a1e1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/dc9491fd507aefdffbfc18fcf85b33dd3a0690e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:54:52Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:54:52Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #167: Enriched Evaluation Response Schema\n\n## Summary\nImplemented the full enriched evaluation response schema with unified canonical\nenvelope, new computation engines, and updated frontend display.\n\n## Backend Changes (artifacts/api-server)\n\n### evaluationPipeline.ts\n- Added new interfaces: DecisionResult, FailureSurface, FailureSurfaceCondition,\n  StrategyProfile, EnrichedRefinement, EvalMode\n- Added computeDecision(): ACTIVE/LIMITED/BLOCKED status from score, confidence,\n  and stress results with human-readable reason\n- Added computeFailureSurface(): extracts regime-specific failure conditions with\n  confidence values from severity of drawdown + score failure\n- Added computeStrategyProfile(): auto-classifies type (trend_follower,\n  mean_reverter, momentum, balanced), speed from timeframes, risk from M4, dependency\n- Added computeEnrichedRefinement(): ACCEPTED/REJECTED status with reasons\n  (overfit, low_robustness, insufficient_data)\n- Updated executeEvaluation() to build the unified canonical envelope stored in\n  summaryJson; version/version_hash fetched from latest strategyVersionsTable record\n\n### routes/evaluate.ts\n- Added mode: \"fast\" | \"deep\" to submitEvalSchema (default: \"deep\")\n- Fast mode forces runStress=false, runRefinement=false\n- Deep mode forces runStress=true, runRefinement=true (guaranteed full pipeline)\n- GET /evaluate/:jobId: detects unified envelope vs legacy summaryJson shape using\n  `raw.score` field check; legacy rows use column-based fallback envelope\n\n## Frontend Changes (artifacts/entangle-wealth)\n\n### EvalPipeline.tsx\n- Updated EvalJobResult interface to unified envelope shape\n- Added evalMode state with Fast/Deep selector cards\n- Updated submitEval() to pass mode to API\n- Removed user-controllable stress/refinement checkboxes (now mode-controlled)\n- Added decision status badge (ACTIVE=green, LIMITED=yellow, BLOCKED=red)\n- Added mode indicator pill + version/hash display in results header\n- Added strategy profile card (type/speed/risk/dependency)\n- Added failure surface conditions list with confidence bars\n- Enriched refinement section: ACCEPTED/REJECTED badge, before/after score grid\n- Summary section uses evalResult.summary as primary, summaryData as fallback\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 4db0c2b3-ff8c-4357-8268-96709b68f949","tree":{"sha":"ed303ba990083287c98407fa21975e194e1c5c72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/ed303ba990083287c98407fa21975e194e1c5c72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/dc9491fd507aefdffbfc18fcf85b33dd3a0690e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/dc9491fd507aefdffbfc18fcf85b33dd3a0690e4","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGRjOTQ5MWZkNTA3YWVmZGZmYmZjMThmY2Y4NWIzM2RkM2EwNjkwZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/8258afdc6a1f8c2ad5f60338a65066bfe12df08c","sha":"8258afdc6a1f8c2ad5f60338a65066bfe12df08c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/8258afdc6a1f8c2ad5f60338a65066bfe12df08c"}],"sha":"dc9491fd507aefdffbfc18fcf85b33dd3a0690e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/dc9491fd507aefdffbfc18fcf85b33dd3a0690e4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/8258afdc6a1f8c2ad5f60338a65066bfe12df08c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:41:53Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:41:53Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #163: Quant Engine Critical Fixes & Enhancements (rebased onto Task #159)\n\n## Summary\nFixed 8 critical bugs and added key enhancements to the quant strategy engine,\nthen rebased onto Task #159 (multi-agent orchestration engine).\n\n## Core Changes (Task #163)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n1. Worker thread path: fixed double-path issue → `__dirname/strategyWorker.mjs`\n2. DST market hours: replaced hardcoded UTC-5 with `Intl.DateTimeFormat(\"America/New_York\")`\n3. Alpaca keys: explicit `ALPACA_KEY_ID` + `ALPACA_SECRET_KEY` env vars\n4. Dead code: removed unused `strategyChunks` computation\n5. Error logging: added `console.error()` in worker catch block\n\n### Performance\n6. O(n²) → O(n) backtest: `generateSignalsArray()` pre-computes all indicator arrays once.\n   Added 11 array indicator functions to indicators.ts.\n7. Removed duplicate `executeStrategySlice` (~60 LOC); `executeStrategy` now uses\n   `generateSignalsArray` for both live signal and backtest.\n\n### Enhancements\n8. Multi-timeframe: `timeframe?` field on `StrategyDescriptor`; 1H intraday strategies\n   (EMA crossover, RSI, MACD, Bollinger); parallel daily + 1H data fetch.\n9. DB persistence: `quant_engine_runs` table; `persistRunResult()` after each run;\n   `GET /api/quant/runs` endpoint returns run history.\n\n## Rebase Conflict Resolution (Task #159 → Task #163)\n\n**quant.ts** [DIFFICULT]: Merged HEAD''s `deriveAction()` + full `/quant/orchestrate`\n  endpoint (multi-agent pipeline) with incoming''s `/quant/runs` endpoint. Both kept.\n\n**index.ts** [NONTRIVIAL]: Adopted Task 163''s multi-timeframe strategy split\n  (dailyStrategies / hourlyStrategies) while adding Task 159''s RSI_EMA_GRID count\n  logging to the combined logger.info call.\n\n**strategyGenerator.ts** [NONTRIVIAL]:\n  - Added `RSI_EMA_GRID` case to `generateSignalsArray()` using array indicator functions.\n  - Kept Task 163''s simpler PRICE_SMA_DISTANCE confidence + added RSI_EMA_GRID\n    confidence block (reads from already-determined `action`).\n  - Removed `executeStrategySlice` (Task 163''s refactor prevails).\n  - Kept BOTH Task 159''s RSI_EMA_GRID seeded-RNG grid (450 variants/combo) AND\n    Task 163''s 1H intraday strategies in `generateAllStrategies()`.\n\nReplit-Task-Id: bad498fd-909b-4998-89aa-249b5964b790","tree":{"sha":"4192f1593a0406ada89bf7523ab796e0de75f6ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/4192f1593a0406ada89bf7523ab796e0de75f6ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/8258afdc6a1f8c2ad5f60338a65066bfe12df08c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/8258afdc6a1f8c2ad5f60338a65066bfe12df08c","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDgyNThhZmRjNmExZjhjMmFkNWY2MDMzOGE2NTA2NmJmZTEyZGYwOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/f1538e991d3dc7d894058f7c214ae6964b57c4f3","sha":"f1538e991d3dc7d894058f7c214ae6964b57c4f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/f1538e991d3dc7d894058f7c214ae6964b57c4f3"}],"sha":"8258afdc6a1f8c2ad5f60338a65066bfe12df08c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/8258afdc6a1f8c2ad5f60338a65066bfe12df08c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/f1538e991d3dc7d894058f7c214ae6964b57c4f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:39:21Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:39:21Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Add crypto market data + on-demand evaluation endpoint + frontend integration\n\n## Task Summary\nAdds BTC/USD, ETH/USD, SOL/USD (10+ pairs) crypto data fetching via Alpaca''s\ncrypto API, a POST /api/evaluate/on-demand endpoint for full M1-M6 evaluation,\nGET /api/evaluate/strategies listing endpoint, and frontend exposure across\nQuant Signals (new On-Demand Eval tab) and Dashboard (live crypto prices).\n\n## Backend Changes\n- executionEngine.ts: fetchCryptoBarsForSymbols, split equity/crypto batch routing\n- quantEngine/index.ts: CRYPTO_UNIVERSE (10 pairs) in full scan\n- nasdaq-stocks.ts: CRYPTO_ASSETS registry, getAllCryptoSymbols, isCryptoSymbol\n- alpaca.ts: crypto-aware symbol validation + snapshot/bars/multibars routes\n- livePriceBroadcaster.ts: crypto WS + REST fallback; equity WS filters out crypto\n- priceService.ts: routes crypto to /v1beta3/crypto/us/snapshots\n- evaluate.ts: GET /api/evaluate/strategies + POST /api/evaluate/on-demand\n  (M1-M6 scores, stress tests, confidence, recommendation)\n\n## Frontend Changes\n- Dashboard.tsx: live crypto prices via snapshots polling, removed disclaimer\n- QuantSignals.tsx: crypto/equity/all asset filter, OnDemandTab component with\n  strategy selector, asset picker, timeframe/market-state, full results display\n\n## Rebase Conflict Resolution\n- executionEngine.ts: HEAD bumped WORKER_COUNT to 8; task branch added\n  CRYPTO_BATCH_SIZE = 5. Kept both constants (CRYPTO_BATCH_SIZE=5, WORKER_COUNT=8).\n  No semantic divergence.\n\nReplit-Task-Id: e5a485d9-c017-455c-ba99-2010cfecf501","tree":{"sha":"4b254a6000564367c3edb4431d8fd1f327689901","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/4b254a6000564367c3edb4431d8fd1f327689901"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/f1538e991d3dc7d894058f7c214ae6964b57c4f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/f1538e991d3dc7d894058f7c214ae6964b57c4f3","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGYxNTM4ZTk5MWQzZGM3ZDg5NDA1OGY3YzIxNGFlNjk2NGI1N2M0ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/72b0aabccefaa9a4db5139f18e84247b234bad5b","sha":"72b0aabccefaa9a4db5139f18e84247b234bad5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/72b0aabccefaa9a4db5139f18e84247b234bad5b"}],"sha":"f1538e991d3dc7d894058f7c214ae6964b57c4f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/f1538e991d3dc7d894058f7c214ae6964b57c4f3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/72b0aabccefaa9a4db5139f18e84247b234bad5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:39:04Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:39:04Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #166: Production Tightening — Close Every Gap\n\n## Backend Security & Validation\n\n- **quant.ts**: Added `requireAuth` to `POST /quant/run`.\n\n- **taxflow.ts**: Added Zod schemas and `validateQuery` to ALL six TaxFlow\n  endpoints: impact, summary, projection, optimize, harvest, export.\n  All raw `parseInt`/`parseFloat(req.query...)` replaced.\n  Fixed contradictory `symbol: z.string().min(1).optional()` — removed min(1)\n  so the empty-string default passes validation correctly.\n\n- **stocks.ts**: Wrapped `GET /stocks` in try/catch with logger.error + 500.\n\n- **integrations.ts**: Accounting sync now returns `syncStatus: \"connected_not_syncing\"`\n  (machine-readable flag) and an honest message instead of implying real ingestion.\n\n## Frontend Mock Data & Cleanup\n\n- **MarketTicker.tsx**: Shows \"Market data unavailable\" when empty.\n- **WatchlistPanel.tsx**: Removed hardcoded defaultWatchlist; empty-state used.\n  \"Loading...\" → \"Price unavailable\".\n- **MirofishTerminal.tsx**: RISK/STATUS/SIGNALS/PORTFOLIO commands replaced:\n  - RISK: Redirects to POSITIONS command guidance\n  - STATUS: Removed fake uptime metric\n  - SIGNALS: Fetches `/api/quant/signals` with typed response interface (no `any`)\n  - PORTFOLIO: Fetches `/api/alpaca/account` with proper error handling\n- **mock-data.ts**: Deleted.\n- **TestFixture.tsx**: Deleted.\n- **Profile.tsx**: Removed \"coming soon\" placeholder text.\n\n## Routing Cleanup\n\n- **App.tsx**: `/quant-signals` → `/quant`, `/evaluator` → `/evaluate`,\n  `/case-study` → `/case-study/platform-comparison` (canonical slug redirect).\n\nReplit-Task-Id: cc4402c4-bf96-466f-9ce0-5477cd6ef888","tree":{"sha":"af12a78eee67925ad92cc9e2a5f006eba8372afc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/af12a78eee67925ad92cc9e2a5f006eba8372afc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/72b0aabccefaa9a4db5139f18e84247b234bad5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/72b0aabccefaa9a4db5139f18e84247b234bad5b","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDcyYjBhYWJjY2VmYWE5YTRkYjUxMzlmMThlODQyNDdiMjM0YmFkNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/be2fcb42713253e600a6722d0f0c896156af1d60","sha":"be2fcb42713253e600a6722d0f0c896156af1d60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/be2fcb42713253e600a6722d0f0c896156af1d60"}],"sha":"72b0aabccefaa9a4db5139f18e84247b234bad5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/72b0aabccefaa9a4db5139f18e84247b234bad5b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/be2fcb42713253e600a6722d0f0c896156af1d60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:34:37Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:34:37Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Wire Orchestrator into the learning feedback loop\n\nThe Orchestrator now closes the full learn→detect→block cycle:\n\n1. After regime analysis (Step 1), checks PatternAgent''s latest report\n   for critical failure patterns matching this strategy×regime pair\n2. Falls back to LearningAgent''s direct insight lookup if no pattern\n   match — blocks on high-confidence unfavorable signals (>=0.7, >=10 samples)\n3. If blocked: overrides decision to HOLD with rationale\n   \"[LEARNED BLOCK] fails in low liquidity | Original BUY: ...\"\n4. After execution decision, publishes trade_executed event via EventBus\n   with the unified payload format (strategy_id, regime, result.pnl,\n   result.drawdown) so LearningAgent''s memory gets the episode\n\nOrchestrator uses lazy registry lookups (getLearning/getPattern) to\nresolve the registered agent instances at call time, avoiding the\nmodule-load-time ordering issue. Constructor signature unchanged —\nbackward compatible with existing instantiation in quant.ts.\n\nNew fields on OrchestratorResult: learnedBlock (bool), learnedInsight (string|null)","tree":{"sha":"97c7aa9b96ce38982ff505ab15e581e1558b6b6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/97c7aa9b96ce38982ff505ab15e581e1558b6b6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/be2fcb42713253e600a6722d0f0c896156af1d60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/be2fcb42713253e600a6722d0f0c896156af1d60","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGJlMmZjYjQyNzEzMjUzZTYwMGE2NzIyZDBmMGM4OTYxNTZhZjFkNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/18c46c4678b8e2cba4b17990ecf00976ee1c28b7","sha":"18c46c4678b8e2cba4b17990ecf00976ee1c28b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/18c46c4678b8e2cba4b17990ecf00976ee1c28b7"}],"sha":"be2fcb42713253e600a6722d0f0c896156af1d60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/be2fcb42713253e600a6722d0f0c896156af1d60"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/18c46c4678b8e2cba4b17990ecf00976ee1c28b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:30:20Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:30:20Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Add agent to detect trading patterns and potential failures\n\nIntroduce the PatternAgent to identify failure patterns, streaks, and regime vulnerabilities from trading data, along with associated API endpoints for reporting and scanning.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: f5dfef47-ea61-4837-97bc-70fbc0fe2060\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/7RtCrde\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"3fdf9c9957678251531886f81e73af1845f38656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/3fdf9c9957678251531886f81e73af1845f38656"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/18c46c4678b8e2cba4b17990ecf00976ee1c28b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/18c46c4678b8e2cba4b17990ecf00976ee1c28b7","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDE4YzQ2YzQ2NzhiOGUyY2JhNGIxNzk5MGVjZjAwOTc2ZWUxYzI4Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/ef465de476749940d9f4b20b2c762c9fad2c3210","sha":"ef465de476749940d9f4b20b2c762c9fad2c3210","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/ef465de476749940d9f4b20b2c762c9fad2c3210"}],"sha":"18c46c4678b8e2cba4b17990ecf00976ee1c28b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/18c46c4678b8e2cba4b17990ecf00976ee1c28b7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/ef465de476749940d9f4b20b2c762c9fad2c3210/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:27:14Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:27:14Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Implement a three-tier memory system for the learning agent\n\nRefactors the LearningAgent to include short-term (rolling 50 events), episodic (full history), and long-term (cached insights) memory storage, and adds a new API endpoint for memory retrieval.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: 5f0435db-2e1b-4234-8d20-203dd4f69c55\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/7RtCrde\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"bbd24a17a8e5d2217e6923e26bd563984cf548e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/bbd24a17a8e5d2217e6923e26bd563984cf548e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/ef465de476749940d9f4b20b2c762c9fad2c3210","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/ef465de476749940d9f4b20b2c762c9fad2c3210","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGVmNDY1ZGU0NzY3NDk5NDBkOWY0YjIwYjJjNzYyYzlmYWQyYzMyMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/9cbef7c1d50effd4a409da73daa58142eed9b79d","sha":"9cbef7c1d50effd4a409da73daa58142eed9b79d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/9cbef7c1d50effd4a409da73daa58142eed9b79d"}],"sha":"ef465de476749940d9f4b20b2c762c9fad2c3210","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/ef465de476749940d9f4b20b2c762c9fad2c3210"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/9cbef7c1d50effd4a409da73daa58142eed9b79d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:24:53Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:24:53Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Add insights and confidence scores to learning agent\n\nAdds natural language insight generation, confidence scoring, and API endpoints to the LearningAgent, emitting enriched insights via the `learning_updated` event.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: 046353ef-da2d-4cce-8185-2ee63c1201d4\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/7RtCrde\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"97300685aa257d38dd867aff831fd6584d05a66b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/97300685aa257d38dd867aff831fd6584d05a66b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/9cbef7c1d50effd4a409da73daa58142eed9b79d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/9cbef7c1d50effd4a409da73daa58142eed9b79d","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDljYmVmN2MxZDUwZWZmZDRhNDA5ZGE3M2RhYTU4MTQyZWVkOWI3OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/4018413e90a6839cbb8254fa9a03373bda4a3654","sha":"4018413e90a6839cbb8254fa9a03373bda4a3654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/4018413e90a6839cbb8254fa9a03373bda4a3654"}],"sha":"9cbef7c1d50effd4a409da73daa58142eed9b79d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/9cbef7c1d50effd4a409da73daa58142eed9b79d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/4018413e90a6839cbb8254fa9a03373bda4a3654/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:21:50Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:21:50Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Add enhanced strategy performance tracking with regime analysis\n\nUpdate the LearningAgent to process unified trade execution events, incorporating direct regime information and drawdown metrics for more comprehensive strategy performance analysis.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: ffccff87-0248-42a8-b76c-f00eee9c22cd\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/7RtCrde\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"6d264c90fbb1eaeef67da5efa608516f0b8e59e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/6d264c90fbb1eaeef67da5efa608516f0b8e59e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/4018413e90a6839cbb8254fa9a03373bda4a3654","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/4018413e90a6839cbb8254fa9a03373bda4a3654","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDQwMTg0MTNlOTBhNjgzOWNiYjgyNTRmYTlhMDMzNzNiZGE0YTM2NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/be565f07ee114bcd50cb695012acf8d6f5f7dbba","sha":"be565f07ee114bcd50cb695012acf8d6f5f7dbba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/be565f07ee114bcd50cb695012acf8d6f5f7dbba"}],"sha":"4018413e90a6839cbb8254fa9a03373bda4a3654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/4018413e90a6839cbb8254fa9a03373bda4a3654"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/be565f07ee114bcd50cb695012acf8d6f5f7dbba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:16:06Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:16:06Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Add LearningAgent: strategy×regime insight aggregation from trade episodes\n\nImplements the user''s LearningAgent pseudocode as a production TypeScript agent:\n- Subscribes to trade_executed + regime_detected events via EventBus\n- Buffers episodic records (strategy_id, regime, pnl, timestamp) in memory\n- Consolidates every 5 minutes (or every 50 episodes) into strategy_regime_insights\n  DB table via upsert: tracks avg PnL, total PnL, samples, win rate, avg win/loss,\n  max drawdown, best PnL per strategy×regime pair\n- getInsight() classifies as favorable/unfavorable/neutral/insufficient_data\n- Episode buffer bounded at 5K entries, regime map bounded at 1K entries\n- Emits learning_updated event after consolidation\n- Schema: strategy_regime_insights table with unique index on (strategy_id, regime)\n- Registered in AgentRegistry as agent #23","tree":{"sha":"3019ec5ab1df22e0d0a8d23c660a4d3ac38d1836","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/3019ec5ab1df22e0d0a8d23c660a4d3ac38d1836"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/be565f07ee114bcd50cb695012acf8d6f5f7dbba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/be565f07ee114bcd50cb695012acf8d6f5f7dbba","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGJlNTY1ZjA3ZWUxMTRiY2Q1MGNiNjk1MDEyYWNmOGQ2ZjVmN2RiYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/8009d33f393d9c71e8f78a5dbd99c54ccc963204","sha":"8009d33f393d9c71e8f78a5dbd99c54ccc963204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/8009d33f393d9c71e8f78a5dbd99c54ccc963204"}],"sha":"be565f07ee114bcd50cb695012acf8d6f5f7dbba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/be565f07ee114bcd50cb695012acf8d6f5f7dbba"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/8009d33f393d9c71e8f78a5dbd99c54ccc963204/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:10:53Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:10:53Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"fix(task-159): resolve all code review rejections for multi-agent orchestration engine\n\nCritical fixes applied across three rounds of code review feedback:\n\nRound 1 fixes:\n- Kill switch now unconditionally forces EXIT and zeroes score (removed incorrect !== \"HOLD\" guard)\n- Added DriftAgent, EnsembleAgent, AllocationAgent as Orchestrator constructor params and wired into pipeline\n- Multi-timeframe OHLCV fetching: each timeframe fetches separate data via Promise.all\n- deriveAction() replaces hardcoded \"hold\" with RSI/MACD/SMA20-based signal detection per symbol+timeframe\n- All 8 new agents registered in agentRegistry in src/index.ts\n- FinalArbiter: accurate filteredByKillSwitch count, kill-switch results sorted last\n\nRound 2 fixes:\n- EventBus schema alignment: AllocationAgent.onEnsembleRanked maps EnsembleRanking payload\n  (ensembleScore → score, agreement → confidence) to avoid NaN in Kelly calculations\n- StrategyAgent: added public evaluateFromOHLCV() computing RSI, MACD, Bollinger signals\n  from raw OHLCV arrays, returning score/confidence/direction/signals\n- RiskAgent: added public assessFromInputs() for market risk without userId/DB access\n- Orchestrator Step 2: now runs StrategyAgent.evaluateFromOHLCV() + runAllModels() + runStressEngine() in parallel\n- Orchestrator Step 3: now uses RiskAgent.assessFromInputs() (not local heuristic)\n- AllocationAgent.resetBudget() called at start of every runMulti() to prevent cross-request state leakage\n\nRound 3 fix:\n- RiskAgent.assessFromInputs(): normalizes volatilityRegime and liquidityTier to lowercase\n  before comparison, correctly handling VolatilityAgent output (\"low\"|\"moderate\"|\"high\"|\"extreme\")\n  and LiquidityAgent output (\"high\"|\"medium\"|\"low\"|\"illiquid\") — previously uppercase checks\n  were silently ignoring all risk contributions from new agents\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 5f00a639-1948-4c01-b737-b08062707e64","tree":{"sha":"e92bfec75e5a0bec9148b89094b37c7acc2e54f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/e92bfec75e5a0bec9148b89094b37c7acc2e54f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/8009d33f393d9c71e8f78a5dbd99c54ccc963204","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/8009d33f393d9c71e8f78a5dbd99c54ccc963204","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDgwMDlkMzNmMzkzZDljNzFlOGY3OGE1ZGJkOTljNTRjY2M5NjMyMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/388985539fd5278604d7d0e57e92d40ec4460168","sha":"388985539fd5278604d7d0e57e92d40ec4460168","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/388985539fd5278604d7d0e57e92d40ec4460168"}],"sha":"8009d33f393d9c71e8f78a5dbd99c54ccc963204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/8009d33f393d9c71e8f78a5dbd99c54ccc963204"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/388985539fd5278604d7d0e57e92d40ec4460168/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:10:51Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:10:51Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #164: Align Quant Engine to Blueprint Specs\n\nChanges:\n\n1. Worker pool (executionEngine.ts):\n   - WORKER_COUNT 4 → 8 for higher parallelism\n\n2. Scorer weights simplified to 3-factor formula (scorer.ts):\n   - Was: 30% expectedReturn, 25% winRate, 20% confidence, 15% maxDrawdown, 10% riskScore\n   - Now: 40% expectedReturn, 30% confidence, 30% riskPenalty (100 - riskScore)\n   - winRate and maxDrawdown still retained in output fields but not in composite score\n\n3. RSI×EMA parameter grid strategy family (strategyGenerator.ts):\n   - New type: RSI_EMA_GRID (BUY: RSI < oversold AND emaShort > emaLong; SELL: opposite)\n   - Grid: RSI [7,14,21] × EMA short [9,12,20] × EMA long [50,100,200] = 27 base combos\n   - 450 seeded-random threshold variations per combo (LCG seeded per combo for reproducibility)\n   - Total grid strategies: 27 × 450 = 12,150 — grand total ~12,663\n   - RSI_EMA_GRID added to executeStrategySlice() for backtest simulation consistency\n   - All existing strategy families preserved\n\n4. Run-start logging (index.ts):\n   - Strategy count breakdown logged at each run: total, gridStrategies, baseStrategies\n\nDeviation: Per-combo variation count is 450 (not 150 as stated in task) because\n27 × 150 = 4,050 is insufficient to reach the ~12,000+ blueprint target.\nAll API endpoints (/quant/signals, /quant/status, /quant/run) verified working.\nBuild clean. Scheduler, caching, worker timeout behavior unchanged.\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 0e3df548-ef66-4f7d-a650-9f5eeeff5d50","tree":{"sha":"e1273ad265132a696818a05db606f244a9f60534","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/e1273ad265132a696818a05db606f244a9f60534"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/388985539fd5278604d7d0e57e92d40ec4460168","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/388985539fd5278604d7d0e57e92d40ec4460168","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDM4ODk4NTUzOWZkNTI3ODYwNGQ3ZDBlNTdlOTJkNDBlYzQ0NjAxNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/3656decdae9c802291bdffc8675af149a3e23e27","sha":"3656decdae9c802291bdffc8675af149a3e23e27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/3656decdae9c802291bdffc8675af149a3e23e27"}],"sha":"388985539fd5278604d7d0e57e92d40ec4460168","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/388985539fd5278604d7d0e57e92d40ec4460168"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/3656decdae9c802291bdffc8675af149a3e23e27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:03:33Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:03:33Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #161: Strategy Experience Mega Upgrade\n\n## Summary\nFull Bloomberg-grade UI/UX upgrade of four strategy pages in the EntangleWealth trading platform.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### Route Fix\n- Added `/evaluator` alias route in App.tsx (alongside `/evaluate`)\n\n### New Shared Components (src/components/strategy/)\n- `AnimatedGauge.tsx`: SVG arc gauge with gradient fill, animated stroke, glow shadow, and needle + `ScoreRing` export (circular mini rings for per-model scores)\n- `HeatmapGrid.tsx`: Color-coded stress test heatmap cells with drawdown severity gradients\n- `BeforeAfterCard.tsx`: Before/After parameter comparison cards with animated impact bars and trend indicators\n- `PageTransition.tsx`: Framer Motion wrappers — `FadeIn`, `PageTransition`, `StaggerContainer`, `staggerItem`\n- `StrategySkeletons.tsx`: 4 layout-matching skeleton loaders for each page\n\n### Page Upgrades (frontend-only, no API changes)\n\n**StrategyEvaluator.tsx** — Full rewrite:\n- Animated SVG gauge (AnimatedGauge) for confidence/aggregate scores\n- Expandable AgentCard with animated confidence bars (framer-motion)\n- PipelineProgress component with per-model animated status badges\n- ConsensusBadge with pulse animation\n- Radar chart with custom tooltip and glow styling\n- Animated empty/connecting/streaming states with AnimatePresence\n- Fast vs Deep evaluation mode selector\n- Comprehensive error classification (rate_limit, auth, capacity, generic)\n\n**EvalPipeline.tsx** — Full rewrite:\n- Animated RunningView with M1–M6 pipeline flow using framer-motion\n- ScoreRing grid for per-model score visualization\n- HeatmapGrid replacing flat stress test list\n- BeforeAfterCard grid replacing plain refinement list\n- Model legend with colored dot indicators\n- AnimatePresence view transitions between select/running/results/rankings/versions\n\n**StrategyBuilder.tsx** — Targeted upgrades:\n- Replaced LineChart with AreaChart with gradient fill + ReferenceLine baseline\n- Upgraded strategy summary sidebar with visual parameter bars and styled name card\n- Fixed TypeScript error (Target → TargetIcon)\n\n**QuantSignals.tsx** — Targeted upgrades:\n- Animated pulsing dot indicator for running engine status\n- Color-coded engine status cards (cyan for scans, purple for strategies)\n- Upgraded table rows: gradient confidence bars, glow-score badges, color-coded metrics\n- Added `maxDrawdown` to SortField type\n- Added framer-motion import\n\n## Notes\n- All changes are pure frontend (no backend/API modifications)\n- Pre-existing TypeScript errors in Community.tsx, Earn.tsx, Options.tsx etc. untouched\n- Pre-existing authFetch error in PipelineTab (QuantSignals.tsx:716) untouched\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 86a841b7-f890-4dc0-b6b8-d9ddc0b05a12","tree":{"sha":"446bb4b92e3d31a7f2944fd4f385751a7ff50646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/446bb4b92e3d31a7f2944fd4f385751a7ff50646"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/3656decdae9c802291bdffc8675af149a3e23e27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/3656decdae9c802291bdffc8675af149a3e23e27","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDM2NTZkZWNkYWU5YzgwMjI5MWJkZmZjODY3NWFmMTQ5YTNlMjNlMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/86fc56b1efdbe2b8fdc1fd640fd4d131cff0fb0f","sha":"86fc56b1efdbe2b8fdc1fd640fd4d131cff0fb0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/86fc56b1efdbe2b8fdc1fd640fd4d131cff0fb0f"}],"sha":"3656decdae9c802291bdffc8675af149a3e23e27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/3656decdae9c802291bdffc8675af149a3e23e27"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/86fc56b1efdbe2b8fdc1fd640fd4d131cff0fb0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:00:26Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:00:26Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: Market Condition Indicators — Low Liquidity & Sideways (Task #160)\n\n## Summary\nAdded \"Low Liquidity\" and \"Sideways\" market condition detection and display to\nthe EntangleWealth dashboard Market Internals section.\n\n## Changes\n\n### artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/lib/indicators.ts\n- Added `MarketCondition` and `MarketConditionInput` interfaces\n- Added `detectMarketConditions()` with:\n  - LOW LIQUIDITY: relativeVolume < 0.5, mirroring stress-engine drought ratio.\n    Comment documents that absolute-volume guard from backend is unavailable\n    on frontend (no raw volume feed), so ratio-only is an intentional approx.\n  - SIDEWAYS: multi-signal — A/D ratio near 1.0 (0.88–1.12), OR price-action\n    trendlessness via muted TICK (|tick|/(range/2) < 0.35) AND neutral TRIN\n    (0.85–1.15), combined with balanced new highs/lows or neutral above-50 SMA\n  - Context subtext varies by which signal triggered detection\n- Inputs include all used fields only (vixCurrent/vixPercentile removed)\n\n### artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/pages/Dashboard.tsx\n- Added `relativeVolume: 0.38` to MARKET_INTERNALS.volume (62% below avg,\n  triggers Low Liquidity badge in demo state)\n- Added `MarketConditionBadges` component: Bloomberg pill badges with colored\n  dot, bold label, contextual subtext — amber for Low Liquidity, slate-gray\n  for Sideways\n- `detectMarketConditions()` called inline (no useMemo), re-evaluates on each\n  render for full reactivity to state/data changes\n- Passes tick, TRIN, A/D, breadth, volume fields from MARKET_INTERNALS\n- Badges appear in Market Internals tab between section header and DataRow list\n\n## No deviations from spec\n- No new API endpoints — frontend-only derivation\n- Bloomberg terminal aesthetic with amber/gray badge styling\n- No alerting, notifications, or historical tracking\n\nReplit-Task-Id: bf049953-2ee6-4cbf-aa3d-ebf45a975201","tree":{"sha":"fcb281af56ccb174fb3baa7cb276b59ed3d8ae62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/fcb281af56ccb174fb3baa7cb276b59ed3d8ae62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/86fc56b1efdbe2b8fdc1fd640fd4d131cff0fb0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/86fc56b1efdbe2b8fdc1fd640fd4d131cff0fb0f","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDg2ZmM1NmIxZWZkYmUyYjhmZGMxZmQ2NDBmZDRkMTMxY2ZmMGZiMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/de110d3bb8362c7eeea557d14085079c4c8ad73a","sha":"de110d3bb8362c7eeea557d14085079c4c8ad73a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/de110d3bb8362c7eeea557d14085079c4c8ad73a"}],"sha":"86fc56b1efdbe2b8fdc1fd640fd4d131cff0fb0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/86fc56b1efdbe2b8fdc1fd640fd4d131cff0fb0f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/de110d3bb8362c7eeea557d14085079c4c8ad73a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:00:23Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T05:00:23Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: integrate master system prompt into AI pipeline (Task #162)\n\n## Summary\nWired system-prompt.md (Section I) into all AI endpoints so every response\ncarries the unified \"quantum-entangled polymath\" identity and behavioral\nframework as a foundation layer before domain-specific prompts.\n\n## New file: artifacts/api-server/src/lib/masterPrompt.ts\n- Reads system-prompt.md at server startup, extracts Section I (Identity &\n  Core Framework, Guiding Principles, Disclaimer Framework) via text search\n  between \"## I.\" and \"## II.\" markers\n- Uses multi-candidate path resolution: tries cwd-relative paths and\n  __dirname-relative paths (esbuild banner injects __dirname as dist dir)\n- Logs the resolved file path explicitly on success so fallback vs real load\n  is always distinguishable in logs\n- Falls back to an embedded copy of Section I if the file cannot be found,\n  with an ERROR log listing all candidate paths attempted\n- Confirmed working: startup log shows resolved path at runtime\n\n## Route files updated (5 total)\n- analyze.ts: MASTER_BASE_PROMPT + separator + 7-agent analysis system prompt\n- taxgpt.ts: MASTER_BASE_PROMPT + separator before TAX_SYSTEM_PROMPT; dynamic\n  occupation/profile context layers still appended after as before\n- coaching.ts: buildCoachingSystemPrompt() starts with MASTER_BASE_PROMPT\n  before behavioral finance coach specialization + user context\n- dailyContent.ts: MASTER_BASE_PROMPT prepended to BRAND_VOICE_SYSTEM prompt\n- marketing.ts: MASTER_BASE_PROMPT prepended before platform-specific prompt\n\n## Pattern used consistently across all routes\nMASTER_BASE_PROMPT + \"\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Domain Specialization: X\\n\\n\" + existing\n\n## Prompt injection protections\ninputSanitizer.ts is unchanged — it operates on user request body before it\nreaches any prompt construction; unaffected by longer system prompts.\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 65062672-da73-406b-a22a-99cd71810a8b\n\n## No deviations from task spec","tree":{"sha":"88900de36a0790952ec6f7ae44c1d13c5cf09ab6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/88900de36a0790952ec6f7ae44c1d13c5cf09ab6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/de110d3bb8362c7eeea557d14085079c4c8ad73a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/de110d3bb8362c7eeea557d14085079c4c8ad73a","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGRlMTEwZDNiYjgzNjJjN2VlZWE1NTdkMTQwODUwNzljNGM4YWQ3M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/b4a0d12746951657d9bd04eb20a96222a1f64476","sha":"b4a0d12746951657d9bd04eb20a96222a1f64476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/b4a0d12746951657d9bd04eb20a96222a1f64476"}],"sha":"de110d3bb8362c7eeea557d14085079c4c8ad73a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/de110d3bb8362c7eeea557d14085079c4c8ad73a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/b4a0d12746951657d9bd04eb20a96222a1f64476/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T04:46:20Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T04:46:20Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Update EMA fast default from 12 to 10 for improved low_liquidity/sideways scores\n\nBased on stress test findings showing +2.1 score improvement on low_liquidity\nand sideways scenarios. Updated in:\n- evaluationPipeline.ts (M1 Trend scorer default)\n- strategyBridge.ts (all EMA crossover condition evaluators)\nMACD fast parameter (12/26/9) intentionally left unchanged as it is a\nseparate standard indicator.","tree":{"sha":"84b3f6639e0311da9e4358a085fd356538451da7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/84b3f6639e0311da9e4358a085fd356538451da7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/b4a0d12746951657d9bd04eb20a96222a1f64476","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/b4a0d12746951657d9bd04eb20a96222a1f64476","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGI0YTBkMTI3NDY5NTE2NTdkOWJkMDRlYjIwYTk2MjIyYTFmNjQ0NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/37e6797f9347b9960cf003706bcd17a0d96d2e6c","sha":"37e6797f9347b9960cf003706bcd17a0d96d2e6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/37e6797f9347b9960cf003706bcd17a0d96d2e6c"}],"sha":"b4a0d12746951657d9bd04eb20a96222a1f64476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/b4a0d12746951657d9bd04eb20a96222a1f64476"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/37e6797f9347b9960cf003706bcd17a0d96d2e6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:59:32Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:59:32Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Improve error handling for fetching stock prices\n\nUpdate getFreshPrice to log errors instead of silently swallowing them.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: ba2adb09-3936-46d9-a261-c1b1830a9374\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/7RtCrde\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"8e1538a03cb48f256f159b54187bb4b7cc6aa58e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/8e1538a03cb48f256f159b54187bb4b7cc6aa58e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/37e6797f9347b9960cf003706bcd17a0d96d2e6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/37e6797f9347b9960cf003706bcd17a0d96d2e6c","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDM3ZTY3OTdmOTM0N2I5OTYwY2YwMDM3MDZiY2QxN2EwZDk2ZDJlNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/909b8d9a2acb3d255adbbdbc5bc853cf07be3600","sha":"909b8d9a2acb3d255adbbdbc5bc853cf07be3600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/909b8d9a2acb3d255adbbdbc5bc853cf07be3600"}],"sha":"37e6797f9347b9960cf003706bcd17a0d96d2e6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/37e6797f9347b9960cf003706bcd17a0d96d2e6c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/909b8d9a2acb3d255adbbdbc5bc853cf07be3600/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:55:02Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:55:02Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Market data pipeline upgrade: 3-layer WebSocket + REST fallback + unified cache\n\n- Rewrote livePriceBroadcaster.ts with Alpaca WebSocket primary, REST polling\n  fallback (auto-switch on WS failure), unified price cache with monotonic versioning,\n  exponential backoff reconnect, watchdog timer for stale WS detection\n- Updated priceService.ts to read from unified broadcaster cache first\n- Added GET /api/prices?tickers= with on-demand fetch, GET /api/prices/pipeline\n  for status, throttled SSE at /api/price-stream with 100ms batching\n- Installed ws + @types/ws packages, added ws to esbuild externals\n- Code review fixes: guarded WS close/error handlers against shutdown lifecycle leak,\n  watchdog forces WS reconnect on stale detection, unsubscribe cleans up WS subs,\n  version counter only increments on actual price changes, eliminated silent catches,\n  added size bounds on all in-memory maps (currentPrices, subscribers, permanentSymbols,\n  wsSubscribedSymbols, connectionsByIp)","tree":{"sha":"afffd10214299c24b0b750776250f37d65ef3396","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/afffd10214299c24b0b750776250f37d65ef3396"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/909b8d9a2acb3d255adbbdbc5bc853cf07be3600","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/909b8d9a2acb3d255adbbdbc5bc853cf07be3600","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDkwOWI4ZDlhMmFjYjNkMjU1YWRiYmRiYzViYzg1M2NmMDdiZTM2MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/304a3301a1eef9d0b3b06643d8d882540b736fc1","sha":"304a3301a1eef9d0b3b06643d8d882540b736fc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/304a3301a1eef9d0b3b06643d8d882540b736fc1"}],"sha":"909b8d9a2acb3d255adbbdbc5bc853cf07be3600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/909b8d9a2acb3d255adbbdbc5bc853cf07be3600"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/304a3301a1eef9d0b3b06643d8d882540b736fc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:50:52Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:50:52Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Market data pipeline upgrade: 3-layer WebSocket + REST fallback + unified cache\n\n- T001: Rewrote livePriceBroadcaster.ts with Alpaca WebSocket primary (wss://stream.data.alpaca.markets/v2/iex),\n  REST polling fallback (auto-switch on WS failure), unified in-memory price cache with monotonic versioning,\n  exponential backoff reconnect, watchdog timer for stale WS detection\n- T002: Updated priceService.ts to read from unified broadcaster cache first, on-demand fetch only on miss\n- T003: Added GET /api/prices?tickers= with on-demand fetch for uncached symbols,\n  GET /api/prices/pipeline for status, throttled SSE at /api/price-stream with 100ms batching,\n  per-IP connection limits, heartbeat, proper cleanup\n- T004: Installed ws + @types/ws packages, added ws to esbuild externals in build.mjs\n- Code review fixes: guarded WS close handler against shutdown lifecycle leak,\n  watchdog now forces WS reconnect on stale detection, unsubscribe cleans up WS subscriptions,\n  version counter only increments on actual price changes","tree":{"sha":"d3164a15acb6f4346fe75313d6a38e561585a8bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/d3164a15acb6f4346fe75313d6a38e561585a8bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/304a3301a1eef9d0b3b06643d8d882540b736fc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/304a3301a1eef9d0b3b06643d8d882540b736fc1","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDMwNGEzMzAxYTFlZWY5ZDBiM2IwNjY0M2Q4ZDg4MjU0MGI3MzZmYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/8a5ba84ad84ebd6a2191c17e9a3ee4d8cc4a1ce5","sha":"8a5ba84ad84ebd6a2191c17e9a3ee4d8cc4a1ce5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/8a5ba84ad84ebd6a2191c17e9a3ee4d8cc4a1ce5"}],"sha":"304a3301a1eef9d0b3b06643d8d882540b736fc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/304a3301a1eef9d0b3b06643d8d882540b736fc1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/8a5ba84ad84ebd6a2191c17e9a3ee4d8cc4a1ce5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:41:26Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:41:26Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Add images for application assets\n\nAdd new image files to the attached assets directory.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: cd480234-abcc-437b-a54c-ea8475501a52\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/7RtCrde\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"dc6d15b3a1019e1031fbdf107b70edf9201fd43f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/dc6d15b3a1019e1031fbdf107b70edf9201fd43f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/8a5ba84ad84ebd6a2191c17e9a3ee4d8cc4a1ce5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/8a5ba84ad84ebd6a2191c17e9a3ee4d8cc4a1ce5","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDhhNWJhODRhZDg0ZWJkNmEyMTkxYzE3ZTlhM2VlNGQ4Y2M0YTFjZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/a2fb5fa45d3e82ff5ebf0c1e89de2a203077d59e","sha":"a2fb5fa45d3e82ff5ebf0c1e89de2a203077d59e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/a2fb5fa45d3e82ff5ebf0c1e89de2a203077d59e"}],"sha":"8a5ba84ad84ebd6a2191c17e9a3ee4d8cc4a1ce5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/8a5ba84ad84ebd6a2191c17e9a3ee4d8cc4a1ce5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/a2fb5fa45d3e82ff5ebf0c1e89de2a203077d59e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:35:47Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:35:47Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Build production-grade event-sourced trading architecture\n\n## Database Schema\n- Rebuilt strategy_events table: user_id, portfolio_id, event_type, payload (jsonb),\n  market_price (locked at execution), timestamp, idempotency_key (partial unique index)\n- New portfolio_snapshots table: portfolio_id, last_event_id, state (jsonb), created_at\n- Proper indexes: (portfolio_id, id), (user_id, timestamp), (event_type)\n\n## Event Sourcing Engine (api-server/src/lib/eventSourcing/)\n- types.ts: 13 event types (account, trading, portfolio mutations), typed payloads\n- replayEngine.ts: Deterministic replay from snapshot + delta events, time-travel\n  support, event stream gap detection, avg_price recalculation\n- snapshotEngine.ts: Auto-snapshot every 50 events or 30s, rebuild from scratch,\n  invalidation on corruption\n- eventEmitter.ts: Idempotency-safe event emission, trade event batching\n  (ORDER_PLACED → CASH_DEBITED/CREDITED → ORDER_FILLED)\n\n## Paper Trading Integration\n- executeMarketOrder() emits trade events atomically within DB transaction\n- ensurePortfolio() emits USER_CREATED event on first portfolio creation\n- All market prices locked server-side at execution time\n\n## API Routes (GET /api/events/*)\n- /events/portfolio: Paginated event log with type filtering\n- /events/replay: Current portfolio state via deterministic replay\n- /events/time-travel?timestamp=ISO: Historical state reconstruction\n- /events/snapshots: List snapshots\n- /events/snapshots/rebuild: Full snapshot rebuild","tree":{"sha":"bd168832cb72e16d4f9cc87e7bffaf19a59fa646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/bd168832cb72e16d4f9cc87e7bffaf19a59fa646"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/a2fb5fa45d3e82ff5ebf0c1e89de2a203077d59e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/a2fb5fa45d3e82ff5ebf0c1e89de2a203077d59e","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGEyZmI1ZmE0NWQzZTgyZmY1ZWJmMGMxZTg5ZGUyYTIwMzA3N2Q1OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/c41a01232a63f5167045c836ca72c050421da691","sha":"c41a01232a63f5167045c836ca72c050421da691","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/c41a01232a63f5167045c836ca72c050421da691"}],"sha":"a2fb5fa45d3e82ff5ebf0c1e89de2a203077d59e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/a2fb5fa45d3e82ff5ebf0c1e89de2a203077d59e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/c41a01232a63f5167045c836ca72c050421da691/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:26:56Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:26:56Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Add event sourcing and snapshotting capabilities for trading strategies\n\nAdd `strategy_events` and `strategy_snapshots` tables to support event-sourced architecture for trading strategies, along with associated API endpoints for managing events and snapshots.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: f8620384-b34d-438f-a292-d1932c8820fc\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/7RtCrde\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"fac002c4da284d69234f93912c05e52bbe617ae4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/fac002c4da284d69234f93912c05e52bbe617ae4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/c41a01232a63f5167045c836ca72c050421da691","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/c41a01232a63f5167045c836ca72c050421da691","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGM0MWEwMTIzMmE2M2Y1MTY3MDQ1YzgzNmNhNzJjMDUwNDIxZGE2OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/33ef7f358cbec20d2fba1a59bec5938be5a6271e","sha":"33ef7f358cbec20d2fba1a59bec5938be5a6271e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/33ef7f358cbec20d2fba1a59bec5938be5a6271e"}],"sha":"c41a01232a63f5167045c836ca72c050421da691","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/c41a01232a63f5167045c836ca72c050421da691"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/33ef7f358cbec20d2fba1a59bec5938be5a6271e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:24:38Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:24:38Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Add strategy event sourcing tables (strategy_events, strategy_snapshots)\n\n- New Drizzle schema: lib/db/src/schema/strategyEvents.ts with both tables,\n  FK relationships, and composite indexes\n- strategy_events: append-only event log with strategy_id, event_type, payload (jsonb), timestamp\n- strategy_snapshots: point-in-time state capture with version, state (jsonb), last_event_id FK\n- 5 API routes in artifacts/api-server/src/routes/strategyEvents.ts:\n  GET/POST /strategies/:strategyId/events (paginated, type-filterable)\n  GET/POST /strategies/:strategyId/snapshots\n  GET /strategies/:strategyId/snapshots/:version (with events-since-snapshot)\n- All routes auth-gated with ownership verification\n- Fixed pre-existing missing options_value column on daily_portfolio_snapshots\n- Updated replit.md with event sourcing documentation","tree":{"sha":"ae051e08e2ddcc4994fe01ceded32ee5c807be29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/ae051e08e2ddcc4994fe01ceded32ee5c807be29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/33ef7f358cbec20d2fba1a59bec5938be5a6271e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/33ef7f358cbec20d2fba1a59bec5938be5a6271e","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDMzZWY3ZjM1OGNiZWMyMGQyZmJhMWE1OWJlYzU5MzhiZTVhNjI3MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/a6b8a6c712033b3c518a712bd4afa60b81b1c78f","sha":"a6b8a6c712033b3c518a712bd4afa60b81b1c78f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/a6b8a6c712033b3c518a712bd4afa60b81b1c78f"}],"sha":"33ef7f358cbec20d2fba1a59bec5938be5a6271e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/33ef7f358cbec20d2fba1a59bec5938be5a6271e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/a6b8a6c712033b3c518a712bd4afa60b81b1c78f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:19:08Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:19:08Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #155: Multi-Model Strategy Evaluation Pipeline\n\nImplemented a full institutional-grade quant evaluation pipeline that upgrades\nthe existing single-score strategy engine into a 6-stage multi-model system.\n\n## What was built\n\n### Backend (artifacts/api-server/src/lib/quant/)\n- types.ts: Shared types for raw/normalized strategies, model scores, stress/refinement results\n- ingest.ts: Ingest Service — validates, normalizes, and tags raw strategies with UUID\n- models.ts: 6 independent scoring models (M1–M6), all run in parallel per strategy\n- stressEngine.ts: 5 stress scenarios (flash crash, sustained drawdown, liquidity drought,\n  volatility spike, sector rotation)\n- refinement.ts: Iterative refinement loop (up to 3 iterations, floor=50, ceiling=70)\n- ranking.ts: Aggregates M1–M6 scores with weights, stress penalties, refinement bonuses\n- pipeline.ts: Orchestration layer running all stages end-to-end with parallel evaluation\n\n### API Routes (artifacts/api-server/src/routes/quantSignals.ts)\n- POST /api/quant/evaluate/batch, POST /api/quant/evaluate/single\n- GET /api/quant/signals, GET /api/quant/signals/:id, GET /api/quant/demo\n\n### Database schema\n- quant_evaluation_runs, quant_model_scores, quant_stress_results, quant_refinement_history\n\n### Frontend (artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/pages/QuantSignals.tsx)\n- Unified tabbed page at /quant-signals serving both Task #154 and Task #155 features\n\n## Rebase conflict resolution\n\nConflicts with Task #154 (Strategy Signals engine) on 5 files:\n\n- artifacts/api-server/src/routes/index.ts [standard]: Kept all three routers —\n  quantRouter (Task #154), priceStreamRouter (Task #154), and quantSignalsRouter (Task #155).\n\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/public/opengraph.jpg [standard]: Kept incoming (Task #155) version.\n\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/App.tsx [standard]: Retained all Task #154 lazy imports\n  (WealthSim, TimeMachine, etc.). Both /quant and /quant-signals routes now point to the\n  unified QuantSignalsPage component.\n\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/components/layout/Navbar.tsx [standard]: Used /quant-signals\n  as the canonical nav path (Task #155 path, more descriptive).\n\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/pages/QuantSignals.tsx [difficult]: Merged both implementations\n  into a single tabbed interface — \"Strategy Signals\" tab (Task #154''s real-time signal table\n  with sorting/filtering/engine status) and \"Evaluation Pipeline\" tab (Task #155''s multi-model\n  radar charts, stress test badges, refinement history). Both features fully preserved.\n\nReplit-Task-Id: cdcf0311-037b-4b46-832e-a8d990d2471a","tree":{"sha":"53fc9964d6881b0b45e4db0f4c69a2cece910f7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/53fc9964d6881b0b45e4db0f4c69a2cece910f7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/a6b8a6c712033b3c518a712bd4afa60b81b1c78f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/a6b8a6c712033b3c518a712bd4afa60b81b1c78f","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGE2YjhhNmM3MTIwMzNiM2M1MThhNzEyYmQ0YWZhNjBiODFiMWM3OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/3066f3ab8ac54bda7e4d195cd84b2bddb3416216","sha":"3066f3ab8ac54bda7e4d195cd84b2bddb3416216","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/3066f3ab8ac54bda7e4d195cd84b2bddb3416216"}],"sha":"a6b8a6c712033b3c518a712bd4afa60b81b1c78f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/a6b8a6c712033b3c518a712bd4afa60b81b1c78f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/3066f3ab8ac54bda7e4d195cd84b2bddb3416216/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:14:18Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:14:18Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: Strategy Version History & Comparison system\n\nBackend:\n- New strategy_versions table with Drizzle schema + unique\n  constraint on (strategy_id, version)\n- GET /api/evaluate/:strategyId/versions - list version timeline\n- POST /api/evaluate/:strategyId/versions - create manual version\n- GET /api/evaluate/:strategyId/versions/compare?a=X&b=Y -\n  side-by-side comparison with score deltas, parameter diffs,\n  stress delta comparison\n- Auto-versioning on refinement: creates baseline snapshot + new\n  version with parent linkage, change tracking, stress deltas\n- Version progression derived from latest persisted version (not\n  stale metadata) to prevent collision on repeated refinements\n- Null-safe comparison logic for missing scores/confidence\n\nFrontend (EvalPipeline.tsx):\n- New \"versions\" view mode with visual timeline showing version\n  lineage, origin badges, parameter changes, stress deltas\n- Version comparison selector with side-by-side diff panel\n  showing score totals, confidence, per-model deltas, and\n  parameter changes\n- Null-safe display for unavailable comparison data\n- Versions button in header (visible when strategy selected)","tree":{"sha":"00c5e69ec626b304ad5880a18ff64af100b8d096","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/00c5e69ec626b304ad5880a18ff64af100b8d096"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/3066f3ab8ac54bda7e4d195cd84b2bddb3416216","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/3066f3ab8ac54bda7e4d195cd84b2bddb3416216","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDMwNjZmM2FiOGFjNTRiZGE3ZTRkMTk1Y2Q4NGIyYmRkYjM0MTYyMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/f70daf38aababe8c167b41af93247b52231daa0c","sha":"f70daf38aababe8c167b41af93247b52231daa0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/f70daf38aababe8c167b41af93247b52231daa0c"}],"sha":"3066f3ab8ac54bda7e4d195cd84b2bddb3416216","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/3066f3ab8ac54bda7e4d195cd84b2bddb3416216"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/f70daf38aababe8c167b41af93247b52231daa0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:03:57Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T03:03:57Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Improve error handling when submitting evaluation jobs\n\nImprove error handling in the evaluation pipeline submission by adding a catch block to log potential JSON parsing errors.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: f02844db-7d7e-4fe1-9047-61c944a2d3bb\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/3bzojMa\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"b643736d18780a536590b5f4ffde2a75a55a50ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/b643736d18780a536590b5f4ffde2a75a55a50ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/f70daf38aababe8c167b41af93247b52231daa0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/f70daf38aababe8c167b41af93247b52231daa0c","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGY3MGRhZjM4YWFiYWJlOGMxNjdiNDFhZjkzMjQ3YjUyMjMxZGFhMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/69e7056513c2da8740100547272cb503dcc54db5","sha":"69e7056513c2da8740100547272cb503dcc54db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/69e7056513c2da8740100547272cb503dcc54db5"}],"sha":"f70daf38aababe8c167b41af93247b52231daa0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/f70daf38aababe8c167b41af93247b52231daa0c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/69e7056513c2da8740100547272cb503dcc54db5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T02:58:18Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T02:58:18Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: Multi-Model Strategy Evaluation Pipeline (Task #155)\n\nBackend:\n- New strategy_evaluations DB table with Drizzle schema\n- Evaluation pipeline engine with 6 scoring models (M1-M6):\n  M1=Trend Alignment, M2=Mean Reversion, M3=Momentum,\n  M4=Volatility, M5=Volume, M6=Signal Consistency\n- Stress testing with synthetic scenarios (high_volatility,\n  low_liquidity, range_bound, flash_crash, trend_reversal)\n- Parameter refinement with constraint optimization\n- Narrative summary generation\n\nAPI routes:\n- POST /api/evaluate - submit async evaluation job\n- GET /api/evaluate/:jobId - poll job status/results\n- POST /api/evaluate/:strategyId/stress - targeted stress test\n- POST /api/evaluate/:strategyId/refine - parameter refinement\n- GET /api/evaluate/rankings - ranked strategies with filters\n- GET /api/evaluate/:strategyId/summary - narrative summary\n\nFrontend:\n- New /eval-pipeline page with score gauge, radar chart,\n  stress bar chart, refinement suggestions, rankings view\n- Added to navbar and App.tsx routing\n- Added evaluation link button in StrategyBuilder\n\nAlso fixed: missing paper_orders, daily_portfolio_snapshots,\ncustom_strategies, strategy_backtest_runs DB tables.\n\nCode review fixes: Map vs object access, Zod safeParse for\n400 errors, scenario whitelist (max 6), rankings filter logic,\nlimit clamping (1-50).","tree":{"sha":"1f0dd414f02472f0bc3672b264059a2b74640ba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/1f0dd414f02472f0bc3672b264059a2b74640ba3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/69e7056513c2da8740100547272cb503dcc54db5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/69e7056513c2da8740100547272cb503dcc54db5","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDY5ZTcwNTY1MTNjMmRhODc0MDEwMDU0NzI3MmNiNTAzZGNjNTRkYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/2403bbf1b7cbac4360becd2a89c39499e184d04a","sha":"2403bbf1b7cbac4360becd2a89c39499e184d04a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/2403bbf1b7cbac4360becd2a89c39499e184d04a"}],"sha":"69e7056513c2da8740100547272cb503dcc54db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/69e7056513c2da8740100547272cb503dcc54db5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/2403bbf1b7cbac4360becd2a89c39499e184d04a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T02:41:30Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T02:41:30Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: Add Strategy Evaluator UI (Task #157)\n\nNew page: artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/pages/StrategyEvaluator.tsx\n\nEvaluation mode drives actual endpoint:\n- Fast mode → POST /api/stocks/:symbol/quick-analyze with empty body {}\n  (backend strict validation requires no extra fields)\n- Deep mode → GET /api/stocks/:symbol/analyze-stream (SSE, 7-agent pipeline)\n  timeframe/market_state passed as query params (contextual context for display)\n  No HEAD preflight used (would trigger full analysis via Express GET handler fallback)\n  Instead uses 8s connection timeout + SSE error events for failure detection\n\nError handling by category:\n- 429 rate limit: yellow panel with daily limit info and retryAfter\n- 401/403 auth: purple panel with sign-in link\n- 503 capacity: dedicated capacity panel\n- SSE error events: classified by message content\n- Connection timeout: generic \"check network/sign-in\" message\n\nResults dashboard:\n- Fast mode: confidence gauge, signal badge, risk level, key price level, latency, summary\n- Deep mode: separate aggregate agent score gauge + consensus confidence gauge,\n  overall signal/consensus status, recharts RadarChart, M1-M6 per-model bars,\n  price targets (bear/base/bull), risk factors, catalysts, Flash Council summary,\n  latency/horizon/agent count metrics card\n- Live SSE agent-by-agent progress during streaming with animated progress bar\n\nNavigation:\n- App.tsx: lazy StrategyEvaluatorPage at /evaluate\n- Navbar.tsx: \"Evaluator\" in CORE_LINKS and MOBILE_SECTIONS (desktop + mobile)\n\nSymbol input: allows A-Z, 0-9, hyphen, dot (e.g. BTC-USD, BRK.B)\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 52abecdc-3684-4684-b4fe-0f0ab3618f6f","tree":{"sha":"3a3e8fd9bc6f7dd5f1ab3eab4dca0b85bb86f136","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/3a3e8fd9bc6f7dd5f1ab3eab4dca0b85bb86f136"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/2403bbf1b7cbac4360becd2a89c39499e184d04a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/2403bbf1b7cbac4360becd2a89c39499e184d04a","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDI0MDNiYmYxYjdjYmFjNDM2MGJlY2QyYTg5YzM5NDk5ZTE4NGQwNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/97697ac3c92514403d81092d75aec709b2f75753","sha":"97697ac3c92514403d81092d75aec709b2f75753","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/97697ac3c92514403d81092d75aec709b2f75753"}],"sha":"2403bbf1b7cbac4360becd2a89c39499e184d04a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/2403bbf1b7cbac4360becd2a89c39499e184d04a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/97697ac3c92514403d81092d75aec709b2f75753/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T02:36:19Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T02:36:19Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: Custom Strategy Builder (Task #158) — complete\n\n## Final targeted fixes\n\n1. UI copy clarified: \"A signal fires when ANY selected condition is met (OR logic)\"\n   removes ambiguity about multi-condition evaluation semantics (was \"together\")\n\n2. Cache invalidation now covers all mutations:\n   - POST /strategies/:id/duplicate (new inactive strategy)\n   - POST /strategies/:id/backtest (updates backtestResults affecting scoring)\n   Previously only covered: create, update, delete, activate, deactivate\n\n3. Backtest update query hardened with user-scoped predicate:\n   WHERE id = ? AND userId = ? (was WHERE id = ? only)\n   Adds defense-in-depth after ownership check earlier in the route\n\n## All bugs fixed across review cycles\n- resolveUserId(req.userId, req) — correct Clerk ID + cache carrier\n- Route order: /strategies/signals before /:id\n- Confidence normalized to 0-100 range (65 for active signals)\n- Backtest scoring uses backtest-derived winRate/avgReturn/maxDrawdown\n- Fail-closed for unknown/misspelled condition keys\n- hold_bars_reached removed (requires stateful tracking not available)\n- 4Hour timeframe removed (Alpaca reliability)\n- Single timeframe selection in UI (aligned with backend timeframes[0])\n- equityCurveSymbol field in backtest response\n\n## Feature\n- DB: custom_strategies + strategy_backtest_runs + migration\n- API: full CRUD, duplicate, backtest, activate/deactivate, signals, history\n- Bridge: 50+ condition evaluators reusing executeStrategy, backtest, signals\n- Quant: authenticated users get active custom signals in /quant/signals\n- UI: builder, list, backtest chart, 5 templates, Navbar + routing\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 24e11db3-a55d-48d0-84bd-71019f7eb14e","tree":{"sha":"1fc7f08c57d8a70492a1ebe28472744a4b82191a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/1fc7f08c57d8a70492a1ebe28472744a4b82191a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/97697ac3c92514403d81092d75aec709b2f75753","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/97697ac3c92514403d81092d75aec709b2f75753","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDk3Njk3YWMzYzkyNTE0NDAzZDgxMDkyZDc1YWVjNzA5YjJmNzU3NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/d794092bc2f33690b341fd550a09924664e18a2a","sha":"d794092bc2f33690b341fd550a09924664e18a2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/d794092bc2f33690b341fd550a09924664e18a2a"}],"sha":"97697ac3c92514403d81092d75aec709b2f75753","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/97697ac3c92514403d81092d75aec709b2f75753"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/d794092bc2f33690b341fd550a09924664e18a2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:31:18Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:31:18Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: Real-Time Data Pipeline — Live Prices, Instant Alerts & Trade Integrity (Task #151)\n\n## Summary\nReplaced 30-second polling with SSE-based live price stream. Prices update within 2s\nof market changes, alerts trigger on every price tick, and market orders execute at\nguaranteed-fresh prices.\n\n## Backend\n\n### livePriceBroadcaster.ts\n- Added `registerGlobalPriceHandler` — lets any backend module subscribe to every price tick\n- Added `ensureSymbolsWatched` — non-SSE modules (alert evaluator) pin symbols for polling\n- `permanentSymbols` + `getWatchedSymbolsAll()` — broadcaster watches both SSE-subscribed\n  and permanently-pinned symbols so alert symbols are always polled\n\n### alerts.ts\n- Added `evaluateInstantAlerts(symbol, price, changePercent)` — evaluates price_above,\n  price_below, and pct_change alerts on every broadcaster tick (not just every 60s)\n- Added `createInstantAlertHandler()` — factory that returns a global price handler;\n  complex technical alerts (RSI, MACD, Bollinger) still use the 60s periodic cycle\n\n### priceService.ts\n- Added `getFreshPrice(symbol)` — bypasses all caches, fetches directly from Alpaca with\n  4s timeout; falls back to `getLivePrice` on error\n\n### paperTrading.ts\n- Market orders now call `getFreshPrice` (guaranteed fresh quote, not from cache)\n- `executeMarketOrder` now returns `{ executedPrice, executedAt }` alongside success/message\n\n### priceStream.ts (security)\n- Added per-IP connection limit (max 5 SSE connections per IP, HTTP 429 on excess)\n- Tracks connections in `connectionsByIp` map; cleans up on disconnect\n- Global cap of 2000 concurrent connections remains\n\n### index.ts\n- Registers `createInstantAlertHandler()` with broadcaster on startup\n- Syncs active alert symbols to broadcaster''s permanent watch list on startup and every 60s\n  (`alertSymbolSyncInterval.unref()` so it never blocks shutdown)\n\n## Frontend (from previous session)\n- LivePriceProvider + useSymbolPrices hook — single SSE connection per tab\n- MarketTicker, WatchlistPanel — stream-driven live prices\n- Terminal — ConnectionStatusBadge (LIVE/RECONNECTING/OFFLINE)\n- Dashboard — 5s portfolio stale time; optimistic trade execution with rollback\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 1b645820-8cff-4f21-8b5e-fa24b8680a50","tree":{"sha":"bff39b1a0745f2cc0462bd33d1a3a39efe017408","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/bff39b1a0745f2cc0462bd33d1a3a39efe017408"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/d794092bc2f33690b341fd550a09924664e18a2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/d794092bc2f33690b341fd550a09924664e18a2a","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGQ3OTQwOTJiYzJmMzM2OTBiMzQxZmQ1NTBhMDk5MjQ2NjRlMThhMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/65ac26d6bafa1a77588ee719e7d1b229f0e2b8b1","sha":"65ac26d6bafa1a77588ee719e7d1b229f0e2b8b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/65ac26d6bafa1a77588ee719e7d1b229f0e2b8b1"}],"sha":"d794092bc2f33690b341fd550a09924664e18a2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/d794092bc2f33690b341fd550a09924664e18a2a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/65ac26d6bafa1a77588ee719e7d1b229f0e2b8b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:27:02Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:27:02Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Fix all broken navigation links (Task #156)\n\nAdded lazy imports and route definitions in App.tsx for 27 page components\nthat existed as files but had no registered routes.\n\nNew routes added:\n- /wealth-sim → WealthSim (LazyProtected - financial simulation)\n- /time-machine → TimeMachine (LazyPage - public tool)\n- /alternate-timeline → AlternateTimeline (LazyPage - public tool)\n- /ai-coach → AICoach (LazyProtected - personalized coaching)\n- /habits → HabitsDashboard (LazyProtected - user habit tracking)\n- /life-outcomes → LifeOutcomes (LazyPage - public projection tool)\n- /integrations → Integrations (LazyProtected - user account connections)\n- /giveaway → Giveaway (LazyPage - public with auth-gated features)\n- /resume → Resume (LazyPage - public)\n- /rewards → RewardHistory (LazyProtected - user-specific)\n- /marketplace → TravelMarketplace (LazyPage - public)\n- /tax-summary → TaxYearSummary (LazyProtected - user tax data)\n- /blog → BlogIndex (LazyPage - public)\n- /blog/:slug → BlogPost (LazyPage - public)\n- /research → Research (LazyPage - public informational)\n- /command-center → CommandCenter (LazyProtected - financial trading)\n- /travel → Travel (LazyPage - public)\n- /trophy-case → TrophyCase (LazyProtected - user achievements)\n- /community → Community (LazyPage - public)\n- /earn → Earn (LazyProtected - user earning features)\n- /volatility-lab → VolatilityLab (LazyPage - public market tool)\n- /market-overview → MarketOverview (LazyPage - public market data)\n- /sector-flow → SectorFlow (LazyPage - public market data)\n- /osint → OpenSourceIntel (LazyPage - public informational)\n- /gigs → Gigs (LazyPage - public)\n- /jobs → Jobs (LazyPage - public)\n- /case-study/:slug and /case-study → CaseStudy (LazyPage - public)\n\nAuth protection follows existing pattern: pages with user-specific financial\ndata, portfolios, or personalized content use LazyProtected; public or\ninformational pages use LazyPage. No new page components were created and\nno page content was modified.\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 49c6fe4a-90be-4544-9561-de3b44a44d91","tree":{"sha":"350ac0edacd0cd17b2ef414e93bbbd81b4b412e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/350ac0edacd0cd17b2ef414e93bbbd81b4b412e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/65ac26d6bafa1a77588ee719e7d1b229f0e2b8b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/65ac26d6bafa1a77588ee719e7d1b229f0e2b8b1","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDY1YWMyNmQ2YmFmYTFhNzc1ODhlZTcxOWU3ZDFiMjI5ZjBlMmI4YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/78cc4f5b1223c0b49bcd41543f40a8a61216935b","sha":"78cc4f5b1223c0b49bcd41543f40a8a61216935b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/78cc4f5b1223c0b49bcd41543f40a8a61216935b"}],"sha":"65ac26d6bafa1a77588ee719e7d1b229f0e2b8b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/65ac26d6bafa1a77588ee719e7d1b229f0e2b8b1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/78cc4f5b1223c0b49bcd41543f40a8a61216935b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:25:13Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:25:13Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: Quant Strategy Simulation Engine (Task #154)\n\nComplete end-to-end Quant Signals feature for Entangle Wealth:\n\nBackend (artifacts/api-server):\n- indicators.ts: Pure math library for RSI, EMA, SMA, MACD, Bollinger Bands, Stochastic, Williams %R, CCI, ROC, CMF, OBV, ADX\n- strategyGenerator.ts: 513 strategy descriptors across 20 strategy types with backtesting logic\n- scorer.ts: Weighted ranking (expectedReturn 30%, winRate 25%, confidence 20%, maxDrawdown 15%, riskScore 10%) + deduplication\n- executionEngine.ts: Alpaca batch OHLCV fetcher (10 symbols/batch) + 4 worker threads for parallel strategy execution\n- strategyWorker.ts: Dedicated worker thread entry point compiled to dist/lib/quantEngine/strategyWorker.mjs\n- index.ts: Orchestrator with 30-min market-hours scheduler\n- routes/quant.ts: GET /quant/signals, GET /quant/status, POST /quant/run\n- build.mjs: Updated with strategyWorker as second esbuild entry point\n\nFrontend (artifacts/entangle-wealth):\n- pages/QuantSignals.tsx: Dashboard with sortable/filterable signals table, engine status panel, BUY/SELL/risk filters, empty/error/loading states, link to technical analysis per stock\n- App.tsx: Lazy import + /quant route registered\n- Navbar.tsx: \"Quant Signals\" link added to both desktop and mobile nav\n\nRebase conflict resolution:\n- artifacts/api-server/src/index.ts: Kept the agent orchestration framework (HEAD) and added startScheduler()/stopScheduler() calls alongside it\n- artifacts/api-server/src/routes/index.ts: Kept agentsRouter and added quantRouter registration\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 654e6db9-0b15-42be-9092-7c6f3a2ad7ee","tree":{"sha":"69815ff45082144410f76689a5cba1af7327bf38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/69815ff45082144410f76689a5cba1af7327bf38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/78cc4f5b1223c0b49bcd41543f40a8a61216935b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/78cc4f5b1223c0b49bcd41543f40a8a61216935b","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDc4Y2M0ZjViMTIyM2MwYjQ5YmNkNDE1NDNmNDBhOGE2MTIxNjkzNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/a8ff9bef33a92e4ab6fa482ebec485a1c90bdf10","sha":"a8ff9bef33a92e4ab6fa482ebec485a1c90bdf10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/a8ff9bef33a92e4ab6fa482ebec485a1c90bdf10"}],"sha":"78cc4f5b1223c0b49bcd41543f40a8a61216935b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/78cc4f5b1223c0b49bcd41543f40a8a61216935b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/a8ff9bef33a92e4ab6fa482ebec485a1c90bdf10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:24:29Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:24:29Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #150: Complete Trading Features — Shorts, Order Types, Options Pricing\n\n## Summary\nImplemented remaining trading features for the EntangleWealth paper trading simulator.\n\n## What was already implemented (verified working)\n- Short selling (short_sell, short_cover) in executeMarketOrder\n- Limit, stop-loss, and time-based orders via paperOrdersTable + evaluatePendingOrders\n- Pending orders management UI in StockTradePanel \"orders\" tab with cancel support\n- Short position display in portfolio positions\n\n## New work completed\n\n### 1. Black-Scholes Options Pricing (backend + frontend)\n- Replaced flat formula `strike * 0.05 + price * 0.005` with full Black-Scholes implementation\n- Added normalCDF(), blackScholesPremium(), parseExpirationToYears(), estimateImpliedVolatility()\n- IV estimates by ticker category: tech-growth (55%), mid-vol (35%), low-vol (20%)\n- Risk-free rate r=0.05, proper call/put formulas with time decay\n- Frontend premium estimate also updated to use simplified BS for better UX consistency\n\n### 2. Daily Portfolio Snapshot Job\n- Added dailyPortfolioSnapshotsTable to lib/db/src/schema/paperTrading.ts\n- takePortfolioSnapshots(): reads all portfolios, fetches live prices, stores daily totals\n- startSnapshotScheduler()/stopSnapshotScheduler() with 1h interval\n- Wired into artifacts/api-server/src/index.ts startup + graceful shutdown\n- Added /paper-trading/portfolio-history endpoint returning up to 365 days of snapshots\n\n### 3. Portfolio Chart from Real History\n- Dashboard.tsx now fetches portfolio-history endpoint\n- When >=2 days of snapshot data exists, chart uses real dates and values\n- Falls back to trade-based estimate for new users with <2 days of history\n- Shows \"Daily portfolio history · N days\" label when real data is active\n\n### 4. Missing Tables Created via SQL\n- paper_orders table (was missing from DB despite being in schema)\n- balance_transactions table (was missing from DB despite being in schema)\n- daily_portfolio_snapshots table (new)\n\n## Files changed\n- lib/db/src/schema/paperTrading.ts (added dailyPortfolioSnapshotsTable)\n- artifacts/api-server/src/routes/paperTrading.ts (BS pricing, snapshot job, history endpoint)\n- artifacts/api-server/src/index.ts (import + start/stop snapshot scheduler)\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/pages/Dashboard.tsx (portfolio history query + chart)\n- artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/components/StockTradePanel.tsx (BS premium estimate)\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 1c921ec5-2a01-49bf-9ff7-b38346add18d","tree":{"sha":"f105cf8927948ffb0554c57969d5f2debfb7a69b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/f105cf8927948ffb0554c57969d5f2debfb7a69b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/a8ff9bef33a92e4ab6fa482ebec485a1c90bdf10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/a8ff9bef33a92e4ab6fa482ebec485a1c90bdf10","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGE4ZmY5YmVmMzNhOTJlNGFiNmZhNDgyZWJlYzQ4NWExYzkwYmRmMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/e37da7006aa5ef58deb6a197b75ddc65dfd17577","sha":"e37da7006aa5ef58deb6a197b75ddc65dfd17577","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/e37da7006aa5ef58deb6a197b75ddc65dfd17577"}],"sha":"a8ff9bef33a92e4ab6fa482ebec485a1c90bdf10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/a8ff9bef33a92e4ab6fa482ebec485a1c90bdf10"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/e37da7006aa5ef58deb6a197b75ddc65dfd17577/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:13:28Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:13:28Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Remove all mock/hardcoded data from EntangleWealth frontend\n\nAll 16 files that previously imported from mock-data.ts have been updated:\n\nComponents wired to real Alpaca data:\n- MarketTicker: fetches /api/alpaca/movers for ticker tape\n- TerminalAuthShell: same movers endpoint for the login-page tape\n- WatchlistPanel: fetches Alpaca snapshots for live prices/change%\n- SectorHeatmap: fetches Alpaca snapshots for 10 sector ETFs (XLK-XLC)\n- TradeFlowPanel: prefetches snapshots for all popular tickers; on\n  stock selection, fetches real daily bars from /api/alpaca/bars/:symbol\n  instead of generating fake candlestick data\n- QuantumViz: node labels inlined as static constants, no mock import\n\nEmpty states (no real data endpoints exist):\n- MirofishTerminal: order flow initialised to [] instead of mock list;\n  system log panel shows \"No system events\"; QUOTE command goes straight\n  to live API (no mock fast-path)\n- CommandCenter: order flow and system log panels show empty state;\n  council messages replaced with static educational strings (COUNCIL_INSIGHTS)\n- Dashboard: stock-signals tab, options-flow tab, unusual-options section\n  all show proper empty states; optionsIncomeData usage removed (todayOptionsIncome=0)\n- Options: unusualOptionsActivity replaced with []; table shows 0 results\n- Earn: incomeOpportunities and optionsIncomeData replaced with empty arrays\n- EdgePulseCard: \"EXAMPLE SIGNAL — LIVE WHEN YOU CONNECT YOUR ACCOUNT:\"\n  prefix removed from all four insight texts\n- FlashCouncil, SignalHistory, RiskRadar, FearGreedGauge: empty/unavailable\n  states (completed in prior session)\n\nmock-data.ts is still present but no component imports from it.\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 92f3fefa-fd41-47b9-a2e5-bf916a94bea7","tree":{"sha":"5d163048edad06479ddd76abeb715e51c329b1f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/5d163048edad06479ddd76abeb715e51c329b1f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/e37da7006aa5ef58deb6a197b75ddc65dfd17577","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/e37da7006aa5ef58deb6a197b75ddc65dfd17577","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGUzN2RhNzAwNmFhNWVmNThkZWI2YTE5N2I3NWRkYzY1ZGZkMTc1Nzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/297dd3ec0615c4bb35ac82547607b69257a68cdd","sha":"297dd3ec0615c4bb35ac82547607b69257a68cdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/297dd3ec0615c4bb35ac82547607b69257a68cdd"}],"sha":"e37da7006aa5ef58deb6a197b75ddc65dfd17577","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/e37da7006aa5ef58deb6a197b75ddc65dfd17577"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/297dd3ec0615c4bb35ac82547607b69257a68cdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:13:28Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:13:28Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Git commit prior to merge","tree":{"sha":"71716922829836d743e6c76c40cf957cbac092df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/71716922829836d743e6c76c40cf957cbac092df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/297dd3ec0615c4bb35ac82547607b69257a68cdd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/297dd3ec0615c4bb35ac82547607b69257a68cdd","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDI5N2RkM2VjMDYxNWM0YmIzNWFjODI1NDc2MDdiNjkyNTdhNjhjZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/21d36141f7d4dd4c053facff5a58e7c2396738e5","sha":"21d36141f7d4dd4c053facff5a58e7c2396738e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/21d36141f7d4dd4c053facff5a58e7c2396738e5"}],"sha":"297dd3ec0615c4bb35ac82547607b69257a68cdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/297dd3ec0615c4bb35ac82547607b69257a68cdd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/21d36141f7d4dd4c053facff5a58e7c2396738e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:11:49Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:11:49Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat(task-153): Multi-Agent Orchestration Framework\n\nBuilt a complete agent orchestration framework for the API server that unifies\nall background workers and domain logic into a coordinated multi-agent system.\n\n## Core Infrastructure\n- BaseAgent: Abstract class with init/start/stop/handleEvent lifecycle hooks,\n  heartbeat tracking, error counting, and DB-backed audit logging\n- EventBus: In-process typed pub/sub with full persistence to agent_events table\n- AgentRegistry: Manages 14 agents - registration, start/stop all, heartbeat\n  health checks, auto-restart failed agents (up to 3 attempts)\n\n## Database\n- agent_logs table: Every agent action/decision/error with metadata and timing\n- agent_events table: Every published event with source agent and subscribers\n- Both tables auto-created via ensureAgentTables() on startup\n- paper_orders table: Created for pending limit/stop orders (from HEAD)\n\n## Agents (14 total)\nWorker wrappers: AlertEvaluator, OrderEvaluator, EmailDigest, DailyContent,\nDripEmail, ApiHealth, CrawlScheduler\nDomain agents: Portfolio (trade_executed → portfolio_updated), Risk\n(portfolio_updated → risk_assessed), Tax (trade_executed → tax_assessed),\nStrategy (price_update → strategy_signal), UserProfile (user_session →\ndashboard_configured), Sync (consistency checks after trades), Recovery\n(monitors heartbeats every 2 min)\n\n## Event Chain Wiring\nPaper trading route publishes trade_executed events with userId, symbol, side,\nqty, and live price. Full chain: trade_executed → Portfolio + Tax + Sync →\nportfolio_updated → Risk → risk_assessed\n\n## API & Frontend\n- GET /api/agents/status (admin) - live health with green/yellow/red per agent\n- GET /api/agents/logs and /api/agents/events (admin) - audit trail access\n- SystemStatus component in Navbar (admin-only): colored dot + tooltip\n- Polls every 60s via authFetch, shows unhealthy count with error annotations\n\n## Rebase Resolution\n- HEAD added startOrderEvaluator/stopOrderEvaluator (pending limit/stop order\n  evaluator, 15s interval) — resolved by wrapping it as OrderEvaluatorAgent,\n  registering it with the agent registry for full health monitoring and\n  auto-restart support. Graceful shutdown uses agentRegistry.stopAll() which\n  handles all 14 agents in sequence.\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 91906beb-cb14-4b38-a037-d52f7ed59cc0","tree":{"sha":"9199ebf2e1242e550f28cb619515f8c10d0a3d89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/9199ebf2e1242e550f28cb619515f8c10d0a3d89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/21d36141f7d4dd4c053facff5a58e7c2396738e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/21d36141f7d4dd4c053facff5a58e7c2396738e5","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDIxZDM2MTQxZjdkNGRkNGMwNTNmYWNmZjVhNThlN2MyMzk2NzM4ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/4fc6e8f53a2975a454f8ed711eefe293912fdbb3","sha":"4fc6e8f53a2975a454f8ed711eefe293912fdbb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/4fc6e8f53a2975a454f8ed711eefe293912fdbb3"}],"sha":"21d36141f7d4dd4c053facff5a58e7c2396738e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/21d36141f7d4dd4c053facff5a58e7c2396738e5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/4fc6e8f53a2975a454f8ed711eefe293912fdbb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:07:38Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:07:38Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #152: Resilient Bloomberg-Terminal Error & UI System\n\n## Original Task\nReplaced the blocking orange \"Signal Interrupted\" error overlay with a resilient,\nnon-intrusive error system and migrated the color palette from orange to Bloomberg\nterminal cyan/blue throughout the UI.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### Frontend (entangle-wealth)\n1. **Global Connection State Manager** - ConnectionContext.tsx with connected/degraded/disconnected tracking\n2. **Resilient API Layer** - fetchWithRetry with exponential backoff (1s→2s→5s→10s), stale cache fallback, 15s timeouts\n3. **Non-Blocking Error Fallback** - Compact inline ErrorFallback.tsx replacing full-screen \"Signal Interrupted\" overlay\n4. **Per-Module Error Boundaries** - PageErrorBoundary & AuditErrorBoundary show inline errors, not full-screen blocks\n5. **System Status Bar** - Slim 18px LIVE/DELAYED/DISCONNECTED indicator in Layout.tsx (hidden when healthy)\n6. **Bloomberg Color Palette** - #FF8C00 → #00B4D8 (cyan), rgba(255,140,0,...) → rgba(0,180,216,...) across all CSS/tsx files\n7. **Stale Data Wrapper** - StaleDataWrapper.tsx for frozen data visual indicators\n8. **Accessibility** - Updated skip-link focus color to match new cyan palette\n\n### Backend (api-server)\n- Enhanced errorHandler.ts with logApiRetry/logApiRecovery/logApiFailure utilities\n- Added 502/503 upstream failure logging in track4xxMiddleware\n\n## Rebase Resolution (Task #148 conflicts)\n- StockTradePanel.tsx: Kept Task #148''s tabs (stocks/options/orders), Limit/Stop order types, Short/Cover sides, StockSearchDropdown, marketDataUnavailable state; applied cyan color\n- GettingStartedChecklist.tsx: Kept Task #148''s Chapter 1/Discover milestone naming; applied cyan color\n- Alerts.tsx: Kept Task #148''s pct_change/volume_spike alert types, StockSearchDropdown integration, marketDataUnavailable handling; applied cyan color\n- opengraph.jpg: Accepted upstream (Task #148) binary version\n\nNo major divergence from the original task intent.\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 8b5ba783-40b2-4654-ba4c-3631a08383c1","tree":{"sha":"18e37675642baed5dd647b8190f99afb11ca1bd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/18e37675642baed5dd647b8190f99afb11ca1bd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/4fc6e8f53a2975a454f8ed711eefe293912fdbb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/4fc6e8f53a2975a454f8ed711eefe293912fdbb3","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDRmYzZlOGY1M2EyOTc1YTQ1NGY4ZWQ3MTFlZWZlMjkzOTEyZmRiYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/cc98cc4ae22b46c3d1520bb1cbd01c68e8bf6ee7","sha":"cc98cc4ae22b46c3d1520bb1cbd01c68e8bf6ee7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/cc98cc4ae22b46c3d1520bb1cbd01c68e8bf6ee7"}],"sha":"4fc6e8f53a2975a454f8ed711eefe293912fdbb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/4fc6e8f53a2975a454f8ed711eefe293912fdbb3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/cc98cc4ae22b46c3d1520bb1cbd01c68e8bf6ee7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:01:03Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T01:01:03Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: Rebuild trading system, alert system, and stock search into unified real-time platform\n\nTask #148: Unified real-time trading platform\n\nChanges:\n- DB: Added `paper_orders` table (id, userId, symbol, side, orderType, qty, limitPrice,\n  stopPrice, expiresAt, status, reservedCash) and `orderType`/`orderId` cols to\n  `paper_trades`; applied via direct SQL migration\n- API paper-trading route: added buy/sell/short_sell/short_cover sides; market/limit/stop/\n  time_based order types; placePendingOrder flow with reservedCash; startOrderEvaluator\n  background job (15s interval) that fills/expires pending orders against live Alpaca prices;\n  GET/DELETE /paper-trading/orders order management endpoints\n- API alerts route: added pct_change (compares current vs. previous close) and volume_spike\n  (current vol vs. 20-day avg) alert types; live price validation on alert creation\n- API stocks route: added GET /api/stocks/search?q= returning top 20 matches with live Alpaca\n  price and % change for the searchable dropdown\n- Frontend StockSearchDropdown.tsx: debounced (≤300ms) search with keyboard navigation, live\n  price/% change display, and Market Data Unavailable state\n- Frontend StockTradePanel.tsx: Buy/Sell/Short/Cover tabs, order type selector with conditional\n  limit/stop/expiry inputs, Open Orders tab with cancel capability, market data banner\n- Frontend Alerts.tsx: integrated StockSearchDropdown, added pct_change and volume_spike\n  alert type options with appropriate threshold inputs\n\nReplit-Task-Id: e4b610a7-3b6c-4379-91cd-80f428ea48c6","tree":{"sha":"2a133414b1eb90cb84938b6725ca475eb4fe04e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/2a133414b1eb90cb84938b6725ca475eb4fe04e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/cc98cc4ae22b46c3d1520bb1cbd01c68e8bf6ee7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/cc98cc4ae22b46c3d1520bb1cbd01c68e8bf6ee7","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGNjOThjYzRhZTIyYjQ2YzNkMTUyMGJiMWNiZDAxYzY4ZThiZjZlZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/cf351288b8646774d494944ef834bbfe834408bf","sha":"cf351288b8646774d494944ef834bbfe834408bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/cf351288b8646774d494944ef834bbfe834408bf"}],"sha":"cc98cc4ae22b46c3d1520bb1cbd01c68e8bf6ee7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/cc98cc4ae22b46c3d1520bb1cbd01c68e8bf6ee7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/cf351288b8646774d494944ef834bbfe834408bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:59:45Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:59:45Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Git commit prior to merge","tree":{"sha":"8ed603b5250ca818159ffc86cb4e12bc3a4f17ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/8ed603b5250ca818159ffc86cb4e12bc3a4f17ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/cf351288b8646774d494944ef834bbfe834408bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/cf351288b8646774d494944ef834bbfe834408bf","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGNmMzUxMjg4Yjg2NDY3NzRkNDk0OTQ0ZWY4MzRiYmZlODM0NDA4YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/c62edaa5413733f4f5373f45f2e531d0c7bf38e0","sha":"c62edaa5413733f4f5373f45f2e531d0c7bf38e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/c62edaa5413733f4f5373f45f2e531d0c7bf38e0"}],"sha":"cf351288b8646774d494944ef834bbfe834408bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/cf351288b8646774d494944ef834bbfe834408bf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/c62edaa5413733f4f5373f45f2e531d0c7bf38e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:56:13Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:56:13Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Update system architecture documentation for multi-agent financial planning\n\nAdd SYSTEM MODE document detailing a multi-agent orchestration architecture for Entangle Wealth, including agent roles, communication protocols, backend structure, real-time data handling, trading engine, UI/UX guidelines, failure handling, user personalization, and performance optimizations.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: 4681a6b3-58b1-4595-b7e9-6d1613faa713\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/8fb544cf-00db-4ce8-bd72-c3e376dab46b/2e87065b-47ca-4ca4-97ea-febd7b875ad8/pw1t1af\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"441966ea8cdd25c884b35a234d4f7a4ee5da8d5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/441966ea8cdd25c884b35a234d4f7a4ee5da8d5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/c62edaa5413733f4f5373f45f2e531d0c7bf38e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/c62edaa5413733f4f5373f45f2e531d0c7bf38e0","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGM2MmVkYWE1NDEzNzMzZjRmNTM3M2Y0NWYyZTUzMWQwYzdiZjM4ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/34c76d4d9c3741fa5e7075969d81e93ea336a95a","sha":"34c76d4d9c3741fa5e7075969d81e93ea336a95a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/34c76d4d9c3741fa5e7075969d81e93ea336a95a"}],"sha":"c62edaa5413733f4f5373f45f2e531d0c7bf38e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/c62edaa5413733f4f5373f45f2e531d0c7bf38e0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/34c76d4d9c3741fa5e7075969d81e93ea336a95a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:55:42Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:55:42Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: Cohesive Financial Journey Arc — complete implementation\n\n## Summary\nImplements a persistent 4-phase journey map (Discover → Analyze → Optimize → Grow)\nconnecting Dashboard, WealthSim, TaxFlow, TimeMachine, and AlternateTimeline into a\ncohesive narrative with shared context, milestone tracking, XP rewards, and\nidentity progression.\n\n## DB & Migration\n- `journey_state` jsonb column on users table (direct SQL + migration 0003_journey_state.sql)\n- JourneyState schema includes: completedMilestones, completedPhases, phaseCompletedAt, currentPhaseId\n- Phase timestamps (phaseCompletedAt) stamped server-side and client-side on completion\n\n## Backend — API Routes (artifacts/api-server/src/routes/journey.ts)\n- GET /journey: loads state, backfills from existing onboarding_checklist column for continuity\n- POST /journey/milestone: marks complete, stamps phaseCompletedAt, advances phase, awards XP\n- Idempotent: skips already-completed milestones\n\n## Frontend — Shared Journey Context (single source of truth)\n- src/contexts/JourneyContext.tsx: React context provider wrapping entire app\n- JourneyProvider placed inside ClerkProvider + QueryClientProvider in App.tsx\n- useJourney() re-exported from src/hooks/useJourney.ts for backward compatibility\n- All components share the same state — no stale independent hook instances\n\n## Frontend — GettingStartedChecklist (Phase 1 unified)\n- Derives items from JOURNEY_PHASES[0].milestones (Discover phase, 4 milestones)\n- Completion state from shared JourneyContext — single source of truth\n- 14-day visibility limit restored (fetches daysSinceSignup from /onboarding)\n- Milestone marking happens through actual tool interactions (onEvent in tool pages)\n  NOT on checklist link click — preserves journey milestone fidelity\n\n## Frontend — IdentityLabel (journey-phase driven)\n- Rewritten: identity stage derived from current journey phase, not activity counts\n- Explorer (Discover) → Analyst (Analyze) → Strategist (Optimize) → Builder (Grow)\n- Badge, nudge, and card variants show phase-based identity with progress bar\n\n## Frontend — Tool Integration (bridge cards + events)\n- Dashboard: view_signal on mount; trade_executed on trade success;\n  bridge card after portfolio trades → Time Machine\n- Tax: run_tax_scan + taxflow_setup when profile ready; bridge card → WealthSim\n- TimeMachine: backtest_run on run; bridge card → WealthSim\n- AlternateTimeline: alternate_timeline_run on simulation; bridge card → Dashboard\n- WealthSim: simulation_run event (from prior session)\n\n## Journey Map\n- JourneyMap.tsx: floating bottom-left collapsible panel, phase progress, XP celebration\n- JourneyBridgeCard.tsx: contextual phase-colored bridge cards connecting all tools\n- Mounted in OnboardingProvider; coexists with checklist (bottom-right)\n\nReplit-Task-Id: 282fad72-a36f-4708-ad5d-433ea91439f2","tree":{"sha":"4ba960d3eb6637d7a11db7c3e875f4e1c062294c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/4ba960d3eb6637d7a11db7c3e875f4e1c062294c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/34c76d4d9c3741fa5e7075969d81e93ea336a95a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/34c76d4d9c3741fa5e7075969d81e93ea336a95a","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDM0Yzc2ZDRkOWMzNzQxZmE1ZTcwNzU5NjlkODFlOTNlYTMzNmE5NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/9b1ea3f71dd5c78726eb0f494553a446602cf560","sha":"9b1ea3f71dd5c78726eb0f494553a446602cf560","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/9b1ea3f71dd5c78726eb0f494553a446602cf560"}],"sha":"34c76d4d9c3741fa5e7075969d81e93ea336a95a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/34c76d4d9c3741fa5e7075969d81e93ea336a95a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/9b1ea3f71dd5c78726eb0f494553a446602cf560/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:53:42Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:53:42Z","ema