te IP ranges\n  - Fail-closed: returns false if no valid public addresses found\nT003: XP cooldown persistence via DB-backed fallback\n  - Duplicate check inside transaction after advisory lock (race-safe)\n  - Returns 429 if same user+reason XP awarded within cooldown window\nT004: Empty catch blocks now log in critical backend paths\n  - autoHeal.ts: both circuit breaker audit log catches\n  - authEventTracker.ts: auth event tracking catch\n  - apiHealthMonitor.ts: news cache refresh catch\n  - audit.ts: crawl run failure update + logger import added\nT005: Removed no-op ensurePaperTradingTables from index.ts\nT006: Accessibility pass\n  - Skip-to-content link in Layout.tsx (sr-only, visible on focus)\n  - Main content landmark with id=\"main-content\" role=\"main\"\n  - Dashboard already had aria-labels, combobox roles, dialog roles\n  - Navbar/BottomNav already had aria-label=\"Main navigation\"\n\nUpdated replit.md with security documentation.","tree":{"sha":"b726595c2e43c3493ecfc0564834bfb8e7d4ea2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/b726595c2e43c3493ecfc0564834bfb8e7d4ea2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/5090990ada4c38d7b94a2725e9b8212136899d7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/5090990ada4c38d7b94a2725e9b8212136899d7f","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDUwOTA5OTBhZGE0YzM4ZDdiOTRhMjcyNWU5YjgyMTIxMzY4OTlkN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/310b668efdf1100c3e5e1ff0ab77131c4da7a995","sha":"310b668efdf1100c3e5e1ff0ab77131c4da7a995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/310b668efdf1100c3e5e1ff0ab77131c4da7a995"}],"sha":"5090990ada4c38d7b94a2725e9b8212136899d7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/5090990ada4c38d7b94a2725e9b8212136899d7f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/310b668efdf1100c3e5e1ff0ab77131c4da7a995/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:15:56Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:15:56Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"feat: Occupation Rules Engine & Dynamic Dashboard for EntangleWealth (Task #147)\n\nComplete implementation with all code-review fixes applied:\n\nRules Engine (lib/occupations/src/index.ts):\n- 8 DashboardModuleId types, DASHBOARD_MODULES registry, AssignedModule interface\n- getModulesForOccupation() maps taxCategory + occupation category to priority-ranked modules\n- Business owners always receive business-deductions + expense-tracking as guaranteed bonus\n  modules (beyond top-4), ensuring 5-6 modules for business owners deterministically\n\nDatabase (lib/db/src/schema/, lib/db/migrations/):\n- users table: dashboard_modules (jsonb) + dashboard_modules_assigned_at (timestamptz)\n- NEW: dashboard_module_events table — durable audit record for every module assignment\n  and re-evaluation event (clerkId, occupationId, isBusinessOwner, moduleIds,\n  previousModuleIds, changed, trigger)\n- Migration 0003_dashboard_modules.sql covers both sets of columns + audit table\n\nBackend (artifacts/api-server/src/routes/dashboardModules.ts):\n- GET /dashboard-modules/my-modules — auto-assigns on first fetch + writes durable audit event\n- POST /dashboard-modules/evaluate — re-evaluates, persists, writes durable audit event with\n  changed flag and trigger=profile-save; registered in routes/index.ts\n\nModule Components (artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/components/dashboard/modules/):\n- 8 self-contained modules with real IRS 2026 limits/rates (no placeholder data)\n- Per-module PageErrorBoundary (existing component) catches render errors with retry\n\nDynamicModuleGrid (artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/components/dashboard/DynamicModuleGrid.tsx):\n- Uses existing PageErrorBoundary (not custom boundary) per module card\n- ModuleDataUnavailable shown for grid-level fetch failures with queryClient.invalidate + retry\n- ProfileIncompleteGate gates module section when occupationId is missing\n\nDashboard.tsx (artifacts/entangle-wealth/src/pages/Dashboard.tsx):\n- \"Your Financial Plan\" section moved ABOVE behavioral nudges (now primary view position)\n- Original market/trading/watchlist panels preserved below the financial plan\n\nProfile.tsx + ProfileCompletionGate.tsx:\n- useQueryClient imported; invalidateQueries([\"dashboard-modules\"]) fires on evaluate 200 OK\n- Non-blocking fire-and-trigger pattern that feeds cache refresh\n\nReplit-Task-Id: d439d722-2692-4a43-966d-99bc43624300","tree":{"sha":"57bd232e89d08f969e0f31ea9ad518a67163fe5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/57bd232e89d08f969e0f31ea9ad518a67163fe5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/310b668efdf1100c3e5e1ff0ab77131c4da7a995","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/310b668efdf1100c3e5e1ff0ab77131c4da7a995","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKDMxMGI2NjhlZmRmMTEwMGMzZTVlMWZmMGFiNzcxMzFjNGRhN2E5OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/b907be771aff0400ff3354286400c5cd480dd23e","sha":"b907be771aff0400ff3354286400c5cd480dd23e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/b907be771aff0400ff3354286400c5cd480dd23e"}],"sha":"310b668efdf1100c3e5e1ff0ab77131c4da7a995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/310b668efdf1100c3e5e1ff0ab77131c4da7a995"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/b907be771aff0400ff3354286400c5cd480dd23e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:15:53Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T00:15:53Z","email":"57135803-mlkejones@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"mlkejones"},"message":"Task #146: Financial Engine Stabilization\n\n- Consolidated spin wheel to single backend-driven DailySpinWheel component\n  (removed SpinWheel.tsx, Terminal.tsx uses modal pattern, segments loaded from /gamification/spin/status)\n\n- Removed all fake/seeded prices from financial engine:\n  - Screener.tsx: removed mockPrice + generateMockOHLCV fallback, returns NO_DATA signal on failure\n  - Dashboard.tsx: removed MULTI_ASSET_DATA hardcoded prices, runQuickAnalysis uses live Alpaca fetchBars\n\n- Standardized starting balances:\n  - normalizePortfolioBalances() runs on API boot, resets balances above $100k to DEFAULT_STARTING_CASH\n  - reset script updated to apply uniform $100k policy for all portfolios\n\n- Added financial audit trail:\n  - Spin rewards logged to balanceTransactionsTable with spin_reward type, rewardType/rewardValue/XP/cash snapshot\n\n- Fail-safe for unavailable market data:\n  - Portfolio endpoint returns portfolioValue: null when Alpaca data unavailable\n  - Trade endpoints return 503 when market data unavailable\n  - PaperTradingWidget shows warning banner in floating and inline variants\n\n- Server-side portfolio calculation from live prices:\n  - Dashboard.tsx, StockTradePanel.tsx map null portfolioValue/totalValue with ?? fallbacks\n  - portfolioValue computed from live Alpaca snapshots, never from avgCost as fallback\n\n- Type safety improvements:\n  - PositionWithLiveData interface replaces (pos as any) casts\n  - execute<{ cash_balance: number }> typed SQL replaces (portfolio as any) in gamification.ts\n\nReplit-Task-Id: a97a4ad9-cfea-4c7e-9ea4-01bb75570449","tree":{"sha":"59cfd5df74bac9baa83854319631fc4c1ea0f3b3","u