on,\n  ProfileCompletionGate, PopupQueueProvider, MilestoneCelebrationModal,\n  OnboardingProvider, InstallPrompt, NotificationPrompt, SonnerToaster\n- Only 2 non-blocking overlays remain: Toaster + CookieConsentBanner\n- Single /admin/:rest* catch-all route → AdminHub tabbed panel\n\nAdminHub converted to tabbed single-page panel:\n- State-based tab switching (no nested routes)\n- 10 admin tools as tabs with back button\n- Lazy loads each admin panel on demand\n\nNavigation simplified to core-only:\n- Navbar desktop: 5 flat links (Dashboard, Stocks, Tax, Leaderboard, Pricing)\n  + Admin tab for admin users only\n- Navbar mobile: same core-only links, no \"More\" section\n- BottomNav: same 5 core items only, no more tray\n\nAPI routes commented out (not deleted):\n- marketing, dailyContent, viral, onboarding, launchChecks, giveaway,\n  simulation, timeline, habits, lifeOutcomes, coaching, businessDocs,\n  resumes, jobs, gigs","tree":{"sha":"5f0ef5a7871769ea7f5975c9dfa8cbcb915e9086","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/trees/5f0ef5a7871769ea7f5975c9dfa8cbcb915e9086"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/git/commits/db477b4116ee77f12d064bdb5bebd75f9a57d4aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/db477b4116ee77f12d064bdb5bebd75f9a57d4aa","node_id":"C_kwDOSETmFtoAKGRiNDc3YjQxMTZlZTc3ZjEyZDA2NGJkYjViZWJkNzVmOWE1N2Q0YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commit/64e2f6acbe24733bdad32f24e1658ac30a82496c","sha":"64e2f6acbe24733bdad32f24e1658ac30a82496c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/64e2f6acbe24733bdad32f24e1658ac30a82496c"}],"sha":"db477b4116ee77f12d064bdb5bebd75f9a57d4aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chiragit2002/Entangle-Wealth/commits/db477b4116ee77f12d064bdb5bebd75f9a57d4aa"},