"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/03045a8e58aa7be5236ae826e3133057183f22c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T14:03:10Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T14:03:10Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"ci: install only Chromium and cache Playwright browsers\n\n- Changed ''playwright install --with-deps'' to install only chromium\n  since that''s the only browser configured in playwright.config.ts\n- Added actions/cache for ~/.cache/ms-playwright to skip downloads\n  on subsequent runs\n- Removed unnecessary if: always() from npm ci step\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"f646d9a6acf6817c59bed7a9937272a858055f35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/trees/f646d9a6acf6817c59bed7a9937272a858055f35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/commits/03045a8e58aa7be5236ae826e3133057183f22c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/03045a8e58aa7be5236ae826e3133057183f22c9","node_id":"C_kwDOSEeKGtoAKDAzMDQ1YThlNThhYTdiZTUyMzZhZTgyNmUzMTMzMDU3MTgzZjIyYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/79c5d5e881753f8513b548abdb131eb8b35de07b","sha":"79c5d5e881753f8513b548abdb131eb8b35de07b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/79c5d5e881753f8513b548abdb131eb8b35de07b"}],"sha":"03045a8e58aa7be5236ae826e3133057183f22c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/03045a8e58aa7be5236ae826e3133057183f22c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/79c5d5e881753f8513b548abdb131eb8b35de07b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:33:16Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:33:16Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"fix: ensure npm ci runs even when prior steps fail\n\nAdded ''if: always()'' to the ''Install Playwright deps'' step in the\ne2e-tests job across all 4 repos.\n\nRoot cause: when any step before ''Install Playwright deps'' fails\n(e.g. services fail to start, build error, health-check timeout),\nGitHub Actions skips all subsequent steps that have no ''if:'' condition\n— including the npm ci step. However, steps with ''if: failure()'' or\n''if: always()'' (the AI analysis steps) still execute. With node_modules\nnever populated, npx cannot find tsx locally and downloads it from the\nregistry, then fails with ''Cannot find module @anthropic-ai/sdk''.\n\nFix: marking ''Install Playwright deps'' with ''if: always()'' guarantees\nit runs regardless of what happened upstream, so the AI post-test steps\nalways have their dependencies available.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"7baf5dcdfbdc009c783884a5277be23cc7c6a063","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/trees/7baf5dcdfbdc009c783884a5277be23cc7c6a063"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/commits/79c5d5e881753f8513b548abdb131eb8b35de07b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/79c5d5e881753f8513b548abdb131eb8b35de07b","node_id":"C_kwDOSEeKGtoAKDc5YzVkNWU4ODE3NTNmODUxM2I1NDhhYmRiMTMxZWI4YjM1ZGUwN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/1fa3e16b13b115abbc31f2c748774ac5849516eb","sha":"1fa3e16b13b115abbc31f2c748774ac5849516eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/1fa3e16b13b115abbc31f2c748774ac5849516eb"}],"sha":"79c5d5e881753f8513b548abdb131eb8b35de07b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/79c5d5e881753f8513b548abdb131eb8b35de07b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/1fa3e16b13b115abbc31f2c748774ac5849516eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:42:44Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:42:44Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"ci: upgrade actions to Node 24-native versions, remove FORCE workaround\n\nReplace all GitHub Actions with their Node.js 24-native releases:\n  actions/checkout          v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Aug 2025)\n  actions/setup-node        v4 → v6  (Node 24 since Sep 2025, v6 latest)\n  actions/setup-java        v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Aug 2025)\n  actions/cache             v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Dec 2025)\n  actions/cache/save        v4 → v5\n  actions/cache/restore     v4 → v5\n  actions/upload-artifact   v4 → v6  (Node 24 since Dec 2025)\n  actions/download-artifact v4 → v5  (Node 24 since Dec 2025)\n\nRemove FORCE_JAVASCRIPT_ACTIONS_TO_NODE24: true — this env var was a\ntemporary workaround that explicitly forced Node 20 actions to run on\nNode 24 and was itself the source of the ''being forced to run on\nNode.js 24'' warning text. With native Node 24 action versions, the\nworkaround and its warnings are no longer needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"8a47d1597c4cd87ffb2d76b3b5d16f776212f1c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/trees/8a47d1597c4cd87ffb2d76b3b5d16f776212f1c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/commits/1fa3e16b13b115abbc31f2c748774ac5849516eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/1fa3e16b13b115abbc31f2c748774ac5849516eb","node_id":"C_kwDOSEeKGtoAKDFmYTNlMTZiMTNiMTE1YWJiYzMxZjJjNzQ4Nzc0YWM1ODQ5NTE2ZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/1c0c0723b585171d704c6f359bbb1bebc7025907","sha":"1c0c0723b585171d704c6f359bbb1bebc7025907","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/1c0c0723b585171d704c6f359bbb1bebc7025907"}],"sha":"1fa3e16b13b115abbc31f2c748774ac5849516eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/1fa3e16b13b115abbc31f2c748774ac5849516eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/1c0c0723b585171d704c6f359bbb1bebc7025907/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:29:52Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:29:52Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"ci: standardize Node 24 across all workflow steps and set FORCE_JAVASCRIPT_ACTIONS_TO_NODE24\n\n- Rename all ''Setup Node 20'' step labels to ''Setup Node 24'' to match the\n  actual node-version: 24 value (cosmetic but eliminates confusion)\n- Fix order-service and product-service pact-contract-tests steps which\n  were still on node-version: 22 and the e2e steps on node-version: 20;\n  align everything to 24 for consistency with micro-frontend engine\n  requirement (>=24.0.0)\n- Add FORCE_JAVASCRIPT_ACTIONS_TO_NODE24: true env at workflow level to\n  ensure the GitHub Actions runner itself also uses Node 24 instead of\n  the default Actions-bundled Node version\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"c193f999c3a96e730186a6b6b75254cafe9ad18e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/trees/c193f999c3a96e730186a6b6b75254cafe9ad18e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/commits/1c0c0723b585171d704c6f359bbb1bebc7025907","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/1c0c0723b585171d704c6f359bbb1bebc7025907","node_id":"C_kwDOSEeKGtoAKDFjMGMwNzIzYjU4NTE3MWQ3MDRjNmYzNTliYmIxYmViYzcwMjU5MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/a9cdeec7cf18168a580fe18c871101f6c0ae724b","sha":"a9cdeec7cf18168a580fe18c871101f6c0ae724b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/a9cdeec7cf18168a580fe18c871101f6c0ae724b"}],"sha":"1c0c0723b585171d704c6f359bbb1bebc7025907","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/1c0c0723b585171d704c6f359bbb1bebc7025907"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/a9cdeec7cf18168a580fe18c871101f6c0ae724b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:11:45Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:11:45Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"feat: complete AI-driven testing feature integration\n\n1. API Contract Validation — fully operational\n   - Update all 4 E2E test specs (navigation, dashboard, products, orders)\n     to import {test, expect} from the AI monitor fixture instead of\n     @playwright/test. API calls to /products and /orders are now captured\n     automatically on every test run without any manual opt-in.\n\n2. Flaky Test Detection — now accumulates history across CI runs\n   - Add actions/cache restore/save steps to all 4 CI workflows to persist\n     ai/history/ and ai/contracts/ between runs, keyed by branch name.\n   - api-captures.json is deleted after each run (per-run data) while\n     test-history.json and contracts/ accumulate (cross-run data).\n   - Fallback restore-key ai-data-main- ensures PR branches inherit\n     the main branch history baseline.\n\n3. Scheduled AI Analysis workflow (ui-playwright-automation only)\n   - New .github/workflows/ai-analysis.yml runs every Monday at 07:00 UTC\n     and on workflow_dispatch.\n   - Restores latest cached history/contracts for AI context.\n   - Runs: coverage gap analysis, CI/CD optimisation, flaky re-evaluation.\n   - Auto-generates test stubs for up to 3 high-priority coverage gaps.\n   - Opens a deduplicated weekly GitHub issue summarising coverage gaps.\n   - All outputs bundled in ai-analysis-report artifact (30-day retention).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"9beb2f306e0239b7a309f58a344ad9ecd00d6d7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/trees/9beb2f306e0239b7a309f58a344ad9ecd00d6d7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/commits/a9cdeec7cf18168a580fe18c871101f6c0ae724b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/a9cdeec7cf18168a580fe18c871101f6c0ae724b","node_id":"C_kwDOSEeKGtoAKGE5Y2RlZWM3Y2YxODE2OGE1ODBmZTE4Yzg3MTEwMWY2YzBhZTcyNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/719c292c0a19bddd79c60ec8b31b8aba1d952d85","sha":"719c292c0a19bddd79c60ec8b31b8aba1d952d85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/719c292c0a19bddd79c60ec8b31b8aba1d952d85"}],"sha":"a9cdeec7cf18168a580fe18c871101f6c0ae724b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/a9cdeec7cf18168a580fe18c871101f6c0ae724b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/719c292c0a19bddd79c60ec8b31b8aba1d952d85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:04:45Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T15:04:45Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"fix: resolve two bugs in AI platform\n\n1. select-regression.ts: stdout pollution in --output-args mode\n   Status messages printed to stdout before the --output-args check were\n   captured by the CI shell substitution (GREP_ARGS=$(...)), polluting\n   the Playwright --grep argument and causing ''No tests found'' errors.\n   Fix: route all human-readable output through a stderr-bound logger\n   when --output-args is active; use process.stdout.write for the clean\n   machine-readable output only.\n\n2. client.test.ts: flaky ''throws when ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is not set'' test\n   In vitest v3, hoisting a file-level vi.mock(''@anthropic-ai/sdk'') causes\n   all modules importing the mocked module (like client.ts) to also be\n   auto-mocked, making getClient a no-op vi.fn(). Switched to per-test\n   vi.doMock() via a setupSdkMock() helper so ../client is never auto-\n   mocked. Also added vi.stubEnv-safe env cleanup and _resetClientForTesting\n   export on client.ts for reliable singleton state management.\n   Pool changed to ''forks'' for stronger inter-file module isolation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"1584fdd6362c20b948e7f2105913e0ec5dd66dff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/trees/1584fdd6362c20b948e7f2105913e0ec5dd66dff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/commits/719c292c0a19bddd79c60ec8b31b8aba1d952d85","verification":{"payload":null,"reaso