s://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/608d28434f31434d8c6650535297135d4e785c38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:03:24Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:03:24Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"ci: integrate AI unit tests as pipeline gate and document usage workflow\n\n- Add ''ai-unit-tests'' job as a fast gate before the E2E job (~15s)\n- E2E job now depends on ai-unit-tests passing first\n- Upload ai/history/ and ai/contracts/ as ''ai-analysis-reports'' artifact\n- Document CI pipeline architecture (3-job flow diagram)\n- Document CI artifacts (4 types with retention)\n- Add usage workflow guides for developers, QA engineers, and\n  common tasks (test generation, failure investigation)\n- Document unit test suite (56 tests, 12 files) with coverage table\n- Add guide for writing new module tests\n- Update project structure tree with __tests__/ directory\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"6625fdc920dbc6f02273a3cddd8e969c0a4493c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/trees/6625fdc920dbc6f02273a3cddd8e969c0a4493c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/commits/608d28434f31434d8c6650535297135d4e785c38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id"