://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/99f9d3060554629b031aabe26e7e87675c6cdd45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T12:57:19Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T12:57:19Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"feat: add AI-powered test intelligence platform with 9 capabilities\n\nAdd a complete AI test intelligence platform built on the Anthropic Claude\nAPI, integrated into the existing Playwright E2E suite and GitHub Actions\nCI/CD pipeline.\n\nCapabilities:\n1. Requirement-to-test generation (npm run ai:generate)\n2. Smart regression selection (npm run ai:select-regression)\n3. Autonomous execution with retry (npm run ai:run)\n4. Failure root cause analysis (npm run ai:rca)\n5. Flaky test detection (npm run ai:flaky)\n6. CI/CD optimization (npm run ai:optimize-cicd)\n7. Defect auto-creation (npm run ai:create-defects)\n8. Test coverage gap analysis (npm run ai:coverage-gaps)\n9. API contract validation (npm run ai:validate-contracts)\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Shared Claude API client with prompt caching (ai/client.ts)\n- Custom Playwright reporter for history/failure capture\n- API monitor fixture for contract validation\n- 56 unit tests across 12 test files (vitest)\n- CI workflow integration with pre/post-test AI steps\n- All features gated behind ANTHROPIC_API_KEY secret\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"b22100400a033f544fbb6ffaf4467a017b467c29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/trees/b22100400a033f544fbb6ffaf4467a017b467c29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/commits/99f9d3060554629b031aabe26e7e87675c6cdd45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","s