b.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/20b02c64d3cd76771d6280ea05551850c373ca52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T16:34:33Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T16:34:33Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"docs: add one-page portfolio site\n\nAdds a self-contained static landing page under docs/portfolio/ that\nties every project artefact together for client-facing demos:\n\n- Hero with headline, CTAs and four KPI tiles\n- Inline Mermaid C4 context diagram (rendered via CDN — zero build)\n- Cards for all four repos with tech tags and deep links\n  (GitHub, live Render health endpoints, Playwright report)\n- Quality-gates grid covering the 5 CI stages\n- Inline Mermaid CI pipeline diagram\n- Recorded-demo placeholder with Loom / YouTube / self-hosted\n  swap-in examples\n- Contact section and footer\n\nThe page is fully responsive, auto-switches between dark and light\nthemes via prefers-color-scheme, and ships as a single HTML file that\ncan be deployed to GitHub Pages (main/docs), Netlify, Vercel, Render,\nor any static host. Deployment instructions live in\ndocs/portfolio/README.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"b0c530f86a7c241bc9d6c37918e8efec81d63695","url"