tps://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/bc1870ece1e58cec2112edabe6e7675162c81b5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:57:58Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:57:58Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"ci: build service images from source in CI (no GHCR dependency)\n\nThe GHCR images ghcr.io/boschtech/product-service and .../order-service\nare not published (their own CIs only run Maven tests), so docker compose\nfails with ''manifest unknown'' on :latest.\n\n- Add docker-compose.ci.override.yml that redirects product-service,\n  order-service, and micro-frontend to local build contexts under\n  services/*, with pull_policy: never to stop Compose from trying to\n  pull the missing GHCR images first.\n- Update the workflow to check out boschtech/{product-service,\n  order-service,micro-frontend} into services/* (using CROSS_REPO_TOKEN\n  when available, falling back to GITHUB_TOKEN for public / same-org\n  access) before running docker compose.\n- Set COMPOSE_FILE to the base+override pair so docker compose picks\n  both up automatically, and drop the now-unneeded GHCR login step\n  and packages: read permission.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sha":"8d57f9922157b41ecbad0f020b66ceb9ba1b1c04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/trees/8d57f9922157b41ecbad0f020b66ceb9ba1b1c04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/git/commits/bc1870ece1e58cec2112edabe6e7675162c81b5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/bc1870ece1e58cec2112edabe6e7675162c81b5e","node_id":"C_kwDOSEeKGtoAKGJjMTg3MGVjZTFlNThjZWMyMTEyZWRhYmU2ZTc2NzUxNjJjODFiNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commit/57c4d034eb7a25b722534c8cef3cb1ad0cece06f","sha":"57c4d034eb7a25b722534c8cef3cb1ad0cece06f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/57c4d034eb7a25b722534c8cef3cb1ad0cece06f"}],"sha":"bc1870ece1e58cec2112edabe6e7675162c81b5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/bc1870ece1e58cec2112edabe6e7675162c81b5e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198587710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boschtech","id":198587710,"login":"boschtech","node_id":"U_kgDOC9Y1Pg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boschtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boschtech/ui-playwright-automation/commits/57c4d034eb7a25b722534c8cef3cb1ad0cece06f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:52:06Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T16:52:06Z","email":"admin@boschtechnologies.com","name":"boschtech"},"message":"ci: replace Uffizzi preview with local Docker Compose stack\n\nThe managed Uffizzi cloud (app.uffizzi.com) is no longer reachable, so\nthe preview-action jobs can''t authenticate or schedule a preview.\n\n- Collapse the three Uffizzi jobs into a single e2e-tests job.\n- Log in to GHCR with GITHUB_TOKEN (permissions.packages: read) so the\n  runner can pull the private service images.\n- Bring the stack up with docker compose using the existing compose\n  file (plain Docker Compose ignores the x-uffizzi extension).\n- Poll http://localhost until the frontend responds, then run Playwright\n  with E2E_BASE_URL=http://localhost.\n- Dump compose logs on failure and always run docker compose down -v\n  --remove-orphans to tear the stack down.\n- Keep the preview_url workflow_dispatch input so tests can still be\n  pointed at an externally deployed environment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Oz <oz-agent@warp.dev>","tree":{"sh