adable architecture summary) and\n  chapter-mapping.md (single source of truth for the renumbering)\n- Update every chapter''s cross-references via\n  tools/rewrite-chapter-refs.mjs\n- Refresh docs/chapter-coverage.md and financial-app.zip\n- Bump financial-app submodule pointer to include the new shared libs\n  (auth, architecture-notes, di-patterns, util-error), new CI\n  workflows, and the rewriter/audit tooling\n- Gitignore local pre-reorganization backup snapshots (v1/, v1.zip)\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"0abff7069171d894296a60fba294d0b58c98d671","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hikumealan/modern-angular-book/git/trees/0abff7069171d894296a60fba294d0b58c98d671"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hikumealan/modern-angular-book/git/commits/4261ff38c35a754c55b8598e8987c4b096c9114e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92485648?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/US015945600_EYGS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/US015945600_EYGS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/US015945600_EYGS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/US015945600_EYGS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/US015945600_EYGS","id":92485648,"login":"US015945600_EYGS","node_id":"U_kgDOBYM4EA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/US015945600_EYGS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/US015945600_EYGS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/US015945600_EYGS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/US015945600_EYGS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/US015945600_EYGS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/US015945600_EYGS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hikumealan/modern-ang