ssage":"Add Ch 00 ecosystem reference and Part VI-IX (20 new chapters)\n\nIntroduction:\n- Ch 00: The Angular Ecosystem -- reference catalog of all @angular/*,\n  @ngrx/*, @nx/*, @angular-eslint/*, and Sheriff packages; Nx monorepo\n  vs microfrontend decision framework and side-by-side configs\n\nPart VI -- Advanced Data & Real-Time:\n- Ch 32: RxJS Deep Dive\n- Ch 33: WebSockets & Real-Time Data\n- Ch 34: File Handling (upload, CSV, PDF)\n- Ch 35: Charts & Data Visualization\n\nPart VII -- Platform Features & Mobile:\n- Ch 36: Drag and Drop\n- Ch 37: Angular Animations Deep Dive\n- Ch 38: Web Workers\n- Ch 39: Angular Elements\n- Ch 40: Capacitor & Mobile\n\nPart VIII -- Operations & Enterprise:\n- Ch 41: CI/CD & Deployment\n- Ch 42: Observability & Production Monitoring\n- Ch 43: Feature Flags\n- Ch 44: Optimistic UI & Offline Sync\n- Ch 45: Multi-Step Forms & Wizards\n- Ch 46: Compliance for Financial Apps\n\nPart IX -- Advanced Angular Mechanics:\n- Ch 47: Dependency Injection Deep Dive\n- Ch 48: Debugging Angular Applications\n- Ch 49: Screen Reader Testing & Advanced A11y\n- Ch 50: Command Palette & Keyboard Shortcuts\n- Ch 51: Migration Guides\n\nAlso:\n- Ch 27: new section on Angular Material theme generator\n  (ng generate @angular/material:m3-theme) and FinancialApp integration\n- README.md: chapter index extended with Introduction + Parts VI-IX;\n  Appendices renumbered to Part X; stale \"not covered\" entries updated\n- financial-app submodule pointer updated (see financial-app commit\n  for companion libraries, apps, and CI/CD infrastructure)\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"42879925e703113f6a709cc315ccf1114311837b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hikumealan/modern-angular-book/git/trees/42879925e703113f6a709cc315ccf1114311837b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hikumealan/modern-angular-book/git/commits/0ce995a349e1a51d8ba423c0e1c327c421398be4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at"