mail":"dv270992@gmail.com","name":"Diego Villanueva"},"message":"feat(lit): add Principal Web Components Architect agent with 16 skills\n\nLit-specific skills (16):\n- lit-core: LitElement, tagged templates, reactive properties, lifecycle\n- lit-components-shadow-dom: Shadow DOM, slots, :host, ::slotted, ::part\n- lit-reactive-controllers: Composition over inheritance, lifecycle hooks\n- lit-directives: repeat, classMap, styleMap, when, choose, guard, cache, ref\n- lit-context: @lit/context providers, consumers, subscribe, service locator\n- lit-task: @lit/task async data, abort signals, debouncing\n- lit-forms: Form-associated custom elements, ElementInternals, validation\n- lit-routing: @lit-labs/router, route guards, custom hash/history routers\n- lit-state-management: Reactive stores, signals, event bus, controllers\n- lit-styling-theming: Constructable stylesheets, CSS custom property API\n- lit-animations: WAAPI, @lit-labs/motion, CSS transitions, staggered entrances\n- lit-testing: @open-wc/testing, web-test-runner, Shadow DOM queries\n- lit-ssr-hydration: @lit-labs/ssr, Declarative Shadow DOM, streaming\n- lit-performance: Virtualizer, lazy loading, CSS containment, guard\n- lit-accessibility: ARIA, focus delegation, keyboard nav, live regions\n- lit-i18n: @lit/localize, msg(), str, XLIFF, locale switching\n\nAGENTS.md: 38 total skills (16 Lit + 22 shared)","tree":{"sha":"4b471f0be195f8836fd404f9d386dd89f167dccf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DiegoVilla27/agents-ai-store/git/trees/4b471f0be195f8836fd404f9d386dd89f167dccf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DiegoVilla27/agents-ai-store/git/commits/78e85ba78f3711d4da8255109cf688832e4a2498","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43555467?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiegoVilla27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiegoVilla2