ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Josekpapa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Josekpapa/herdia-lyra/commits/0a99ca2cf2a80ee0683b44a99aeee846a0245414/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T17:27:59Z","email":"josemenagg@gmail.com","name":"Jose"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T17:27:59Z","email":"josemenagg@gmail.com","name":"Jose"},"message":"feat(atlas): LYRA Atlas — 8 holdings, flagship + sub-agent pages, core routes\n\nFoundation for the LYRA marketplace:\n\nData:\n- src/data/atlas.ts — single source of truth (HOLDINGS, BUNDLES,\n  TIER_GRAMMAR, CORE, PERSONAS, helpers)\n\nLayouts & components:\n- src/layouts/AtlasLayout.astro — shared chrome for all Atlas pages\n- src/components/atlas/AgentTile.astro, HoldingShell.astro\n\nPages:\n- /atlas · /pricing · /agency · /passport · /join\n  · /field-notes · /founders-day\n- 8 holding indexes (tide, lore, fidelis, helios, alder, mortar, lex, seal)\n- Dynamic fallback [holding]/[agent].astro\n- 6 flagship deep-dives: /tide/marea, /fidelis/ledger, /lex/docket,\n  /helios/crest, /mortar/raft, /seal/attest, /alder/kairos, /lore/muse\n- 4 sub-agent deep-dives: /lex/matter, /tide/concierge,\n  /fidelis/vault, /mortar/blueprint\n- index.astro rebuilt as Atlas landing\n\nInfra:\n- .claude/launch.json — preview harness wired to Astro dev on 4321\n- .gitignore — scope runtime /data/ to root, ignore local claude prefs\n\nVoice per holding carried via voice.palette accent color-mix and\ninline radial-gradient backgrounds; tone consistent with the flagship.\nEvery page reads from atlas.ts — add a holding there and every route\npicks it up.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff348f92f8d1bc64233dfe035c4a8254ac1677fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Josekpapa/herdia-lyra/git/trees/ff348f92f8d1bc64233dfe035c4a8254ac1677fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Josekpapa/herdia-lyra/git/commits/0a99ca2cf2a80ee0683b44a99aeee