,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoseTrades","id":28400549,"login":"JoseTrades","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDAwNTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Josekpapa/herdia-lyra/commits/0761e56d1ddf375d1f5617520ff1e2e11dc7ba58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T05:41:06Z","email":"josetrades@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jose"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T05:41:06Z","email":"josetrades@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jose"},"message":"Initial commit: Fidelis — Tax AI for the advisor''s chair\n\nA base tax copilot for financial advisors built on Astro + React + Tailwind.\n\nProduct surfaces\n- /            editorial scroll-driven landing (6 chapters)\n- /agent       per-client chat workspace: tools, citations, usage, drafts\n- /scenarios   side-by-side tax scenarios (Roth, state move, entity)\n- /intake      vision document intake with diff/merge into client profile\n- /tracker     residency day tracker (183-rule, SPT, state domicile)\n- /memo/[id]   print-ready PDF memo of a conversation\n- /audit       firm-scoped compliance log (tokens, latency, cost)\n- /login, /signup, /team  opt-in multi-tenant auth (FIDELIS_AUTH=1)\n\nAgent internals\n- Groq-first LLM provider (llama-3.3-70b-versatile) with OpenAI fallback\n  (gpt-4o-mini). Unified via src/lib/advisor/llm.ts.\n- 10 deterministic tools: federal + state tax, AMT, NIIT, QBI, SE, residency,\n  LTCG, Roth ladder, entity comparison. Zod-validated args.\n- RAG with OpenAI embeddings (text-embedding-3-small); keyword fallback on\n  Groq (no embeddings endpoint) or when no key is set.\n- Streaming NDJSON protocol; up to five tool rounds per turn; usage chips.\n\nDeployment\n- Dual adapter: @astrojs/node locally, @astrojs/vercel on Vercel (auto-\n  detected via process.env.VERCEL).\n- better-sqlite3 lazy-loaded via createRequire so auth-disabled deploys\n  never touch the native module.\n- Audit log writes to /tmp on Vercel, ./data locally. Fails gracefully.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"f2a3a9791fa429ba9db5e7f1dddc2e915292c398","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Josekpapa/herdia-lyra/git/trees/f2a3a9791fa429ba9db5e7f1dddc2e915292c398"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Josekpapa/herdia-lyra/git/commits/0761e56d1ddf375d1f5617520ff1e2e11dc7ba58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28400549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoseTrades","id":28400549,"login":"JoseTrades","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDAwNTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoseTrades","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Josekpapa/herdia-lyra/commit/0761e56d1ddf375d1f5617520ff1e2e11dc7ba58","node_id":"C_kwDOSE1Mz9oAKDA3NjFlNTZkMWRkZjM3NWQxZjU2MTc1MjBmZjFlMmUxMWRjN2JhNTg","parents":[],"sha":"0761e56d1ddf375d1f5617520ff1e2e11dc7ba58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Josekpapa/herdia-lyra/commits/0761e56d1ddf375d1f5617520ff1e2e11dc7ba58"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/Josekpapa/herdia-lyra/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=0a99ca2cf2a80ee0683b44a99aeee846a0245414&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A59%3A24.837Z"}');
