ntry. Respects the existing\nordering rules (P0 -> P1 -> P2, then chronological) and never touches\nother sections of the daily. Bumps plugin to 0.4.0 (additive feature).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e672a0a3fb276cb76399afd2909cdb02b2e504fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh363/MySkills/git/trees/e672a0a3fb276cb76399afd2909cdb02b2e504fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh363/MySkills/git/commits/c65e32ea9decd9d4c6fb90b5add612a2d6f3b57e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153909591?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rh363","id":153909591,"login":"rh363","node_id":"U_kgDOCSx5Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh363/MySkills/commit/c65e32ea9decd9d4c6fb90b5add612a2d6f3b57e","node_id":"C_kwDOSFBMm9oAKGM2NWUzMmVhOWRlY2Q5ZDRjNmZiOTBiNWFkZDYxMmEyZDZmM2I1N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rh363/MySkills/commit/630f4909a80bb9f450efa55533a23f6717285715","sha":"630f4909a80bb9f450efa55533a23f6717285715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh363/MySkills/commits/630f4909a80bb9f450efa55533a23f6717285715"}],"sha":"c65e32ea9decd9d4c6fb90b5add612a2d6f3b57e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh363/MySkills/commits/c65e32ea9decd9d4c6fb90b5add612a2d6f3b57e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153909591?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rh363","id":153909591,"login":"rh363","node_id":"U_kgDOCSx5Vw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rh363","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh363/MySkills/commits/630f4909a80bb9f450efa55533a23f6717285715/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T10:42:28Z","email":"alex.m@seeweb.it","name":"alex massaroni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T10:42:28Z","email":"alex.m@seeweb.it","name":"alex massaroni"},"message":"fix(secondbrain): Done today is union of completed Schedule + ad-hoc work\n\nRefines the previous patch: completed Schedule lines stay in ## Schedule\nwith their box checked in place AND are also copied into ## Done today.\nAd-hoc work that was not in the Schedule goes only into ## Done today.\n## Done today is therefore the flat consolidated list of everything\ncompleted during the day. Strikethrough remains banned everywhere.\n\nBumps daily-standup, daily-teardown, vault-structure and plugin to 0.3.2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf33ec323d03b6d14eda740aea1503c61a69c584","url":"