ithub.com","name":"Nat"},"message":"Add explanations and new puzzles to the codebase\n\nAdded an `Explanation` property to the `IPuzzle` interface and\nupdated existing puzzles (`GroupAnagrams`, `PairSum`, `TopKFrequent`,\n`TwoSum`) to include detailed explanations of their approaches.\n\nIntroduced five new puzzles: `ThreeOfAKind`, `FizzBuzz`,\n`ReverseString`, `Palindrome`, and `FirstUniqueChar`, each with\nan `Explanation` property describing their solutions.\n\nUpdated the `puzzles` list in `Program.cs` to include the new\npuzzles and modified the main loop to display puzzle explanations\nbefore execution.","tree":{"sha":"08ec48c5d2c0eb08759862381ea5018d303a9e49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzolotar/nzolotar/git/trees/08ec48c5d2c0eb08759862381ea5018d303a9e49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzolotar/nzolotar/git/commits/43d981da27bbc13040e84fb38c89a8912310e464","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5272390?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nzolotar","id":5272390,"login":"nzolotar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzIzOTA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nzolotar/nzolotar/commit/43d