ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzolotar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzolotar/nzolotar/commits/be9d359daa6f9de755ce0540cc921078abc72964/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T20:25:24Z","email":"nzolotar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T20:25:24Z","email":"nzolotar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nat"},"message":"Refactor Synapse project for modularity and production\n\nRefactored the Synapse project to follow SOLID principles, introducing a modular, testable, and maintainable architecture. Key changes include:\n\n- Added multi-stage Dockerfile for efficient builds and secure runtime.\n- Introduced interfaces and dependency injection for core components.\n- Added unit tests for `AlertService`, `OrderProcessor`, and `OrderRepository`.\n- Centralized logging with NLog and added environment-specific configs.\n- Updated solution structure with separate projects for app and tests.\n- Enhanced documentation with architecture, testing, and deployment details.\n- Added Docker Compose for container orchestration.\n- Replaced monolithic code with modular components (`HttpClientWrapper`, `OrderProcessor`, etc.).\n- Introduced `record` types for immutability and clarity.\n- Improved `.gitignore` to exclude build artifacts and IDE files.","tree":{"sha":"6d7eba420d2160082e8b2bb3c88c6474c22e1f55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzolotar/nzolotar/git/trees/6d7eba420d2160082e8b2bb3c88c6474c22e1f55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nzolotar/nzolotar/git/commits/be9d359daa6f9de755ce0540cc921078abc72964","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"