tps://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/c7693178193d48e84bfd461c9ae338f1bdb004b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:11:24Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:11:24Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"message":"Use native table and simple pagination\n\nReplace the UTable/UPagination components with a plain HTML table and custom prev/next pagination. Updated table markup (Spanish headers), simplified download link markup (uses ic_download span), and show pagination only when totalResults > pageSize. Add styles for table, rows, headers, hover state and pagination buttons. Keeps existing data/handlers (documentTypeToString, formatDateFull, downloadDocument, onPageChanged) while removing the dependency on the U* components.","tree":{"sha":"f71eb593f7233a128f771f2b8206158e70454875","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/trees/f71eb593f7233a128f771f2b8206158e70454875"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/commits/c7693178193d48e84bfd461c9ae338f1bdb004b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/c7693178193d48e84bfd461c9ae338f1bdb004b8","node_id":"C_kwDOSFkbCtoAKGM3NjkzMTc4MTkzZDQ4ZTg0YmZkNDYxYzlhZTMzOGYxYmRiMDA0Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/98da45bbdd9c6bb3c040e8b21c4719bb4d6e42fe","sha":"98da45bbdd9c6bb3c040e8b21c4719bb4d6e42fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/98da45bbdd9c6bb3c040e8b21c4719bb4d6e42fe"}],"sha":"c7693178193d48e84bfd461c9ae338f1bdb004b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/c7693178193d48e84bfd461c9ae338f1bdb004b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/98da45bbdd9c6bb3c040e8b21c4719bb4d6e42fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:10:28Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:10:28Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"message":"Redesign home balance section and styles\n\nRevamp the home page balance area and related styles. Replaces the old three-card balance layout with a new \"Tu dinero en Wompi\" balance module (including date display, refined card structure, and credit/in-progress UI), adds a payouts banner CTA, and tweaks merchant header (logo class, loading placeholder). JS: add formattedToday, simplify balance computed props, update formatBalance output, remove loadingBalance, and tighten API fetch error logs. CSS: reorganized and compressed rules, introduced styles for balance-module, payouts banner, and responsive adjustments, plus minor markup cleanups for quick-access cards.","tree":{"sha":"5c64abd8428e26415b003caa61adce48664bd830","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/trees/5c64abd8428e26415b003caa61adce48664bd830"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/commits/98da45bbdd9c6bb3c040e8b21c4719bb4d6e42fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/98da45bbdd9c6bb3c040e8b21c4719bb4d6e42fe","node_id":"C_kwDOSFkbCtoAKDk4ZGE0NWJiZGQ5YzZiYjNjMDQwZThiMjFjNDcxOWJiNGQ2ZTQyZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/a2492503a2c80065ebbc9d6161a46eece95d84fe","sha":"a2492503a2c80065ebbc9d6161a46eece95d84fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/a2492503a2c80065ebbc9d6161a46eece95d84fe"}],"sha":"98da45bbdd9c6bb3c040e8b21c4719bb4d6e42fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/98da45bbdd9c6bb3c040e8b21c4719bb4d6e42fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/a2492503a2c80065ebbc9d6161a46eece95d84fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:08:20Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:08:20Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"message":"Use native table and simple pagination\n\nReplace the UTable component with a native HTML table to render disbursements (keeping amount, status badge, bank account and created date). Swap the calendar icon component for a simple span with icon classes and use row.id || row.created_at as the v-for key. Remove the UPagination component and add a minimal previous/next pagination UI that only appears when totalResults > pageSize. Add accompanying CSS for table layout, row hover, and pagination button styling to match the UI.","tree":{"sha":"7a66f02df230aca9897dc70ea66b6cb5e495d944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/trees/7a66f02df230aca9897dc70ea66b6cb5e495d944"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/commits/a2492503a2c80065ebbc9d6161a46eece95d84fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/a2492503a2c80065ebbc9d6161a46eece95d84fe","node_id":"C_kwDOSFkbCtoAKGEyNDkyNTAzYTJjODAwNjVlYmJjOWQ2MTYxYTQ2ZWVjZTk1ZDg0ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/f1a388d80fdb667e67d6908a68ff082df56e421e","sha":"f1a388d80fdb667e67d6908a68ff082df56e421e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/f1a388d80fdb667e67d6908a68ff082df56e421e"}],"sha":"a2492503a2c80065ebbc9d6161a46eece95d84fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/a2492503a2c80065ebbc9d6161a46eece95d84fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/f1a388d80fdb667e67d6908a68ff082df56e421e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:04:56Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:04:56Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"message":"Add home page and update routing/merchant storage\n\nAdd a new home page (apps/shell/app/pages/home.vue) that shows merchant info, balances and quick access cards with styling and API fetching. Adjust routing and flows: index now redirects to /disbursements, and login now navigates to /home after successful auth. Improve merchant selection in login: prefer numeric merchant ID for User-Principal-Id (stored in session/localStorage) and store UUID separately as merchantUUID when available. Small UI/data fixes: add id fields to disbursements table columns and remove a v-loading binding from the payment-links links box.","tree":{"sha":"2c1bafc1b6755d95f0c024d7a8b9399e1546c1ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/trees/2c1bafc1b6755d95f0c024d7a8b9399e1546c1ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/commits/f1a388d80fdb667e67d6908a68ff082df56e421e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/f1a388d80fdb667e67d6908a68ff082df56e421e","node_id":"C_kwDOSFkbCtoAKGYxYTM4OGQ4MGZkYjY2N2U2N2Q2OTA4YTY4ZmYwODJkZjU2ZTQyMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/4540cb709141f81d8c1c818bc7410ff1748f9f33","sha":"4540cb709141f81d8c1c818bc7410ff1748f9f33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/4540cb709141f81d8c1c818bc7410ff1748f9f33"}],"sha":"f1a388d80fdb667e67d6908a68ff082df56e421e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/f1a388d80fdb667e67d6908a68ff082df56e421e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/4540cb709141f81d8c1c818bc7410ff1748f9f33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T05:47:25Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T05:47:25Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"message":"Add session-based login with envelope encryption\n\nIntroduce a session-based login flow that performs client-side envelope encryption and posts to /sessions/login instead of direct Cognito auth. Adds utils: performEnvelopeEncryption (crypto) and sessionApi (public key fetch, login, redirect exchange), and integrates them into useAuth: fetch public key, encrypt credentials, call session API, exchange redirect token, attempt Cognito refresh, and fall back to storing the refresh token as the access token. Update login page to use the new login flow and a dedicated fetchAndSetMerchant helper to populate userPrincipalID; middleware now respects refreshToken and restores userPrincipalID using userEmail. Also add VITE_API_GW_BASE_URL env type and ofetch dependency.","tree":{"sha":"e243bbe18d92f45a2c64cdca60c584796cf42cdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/trees/e243bbe18d92f45a2c64cdca60c584796cf42cdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/commits/4540cb709141f81d8c1c818bc7410ff1748f9f33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/4540cb709141f81d8c1c818bc7410ff1748f9f33","node_id":"C_kwDOSFkbCtoAKDQ1NDBjYjcwOTE0MWY4MWQ4YzFjODE4YmM3NDEwZmYxNzQ4ZjlmMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/379e51ecb5b445b7c7ff02a9fcdbcd8543cfd6d1","sha":"379e51ecb5b445b7c7ff02a9fcdbcd8543cfd6d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/379e51ecb5b445b7c7ff02a9fcdbcd8543cfd6d1"}],"sha":"4540cb709141f81d8c1c818bc7410ff1748f9f33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/4540cb709141f81d8c1c818bc7410ff1748f9f33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/379e51ecb5b445b7c7ff02a9fcdbcd8543cfd6d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T03:58:05Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T03:58:05Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"message":"Refactor payment link create UI and logic\n\nRedesign the payment link creation page: replace legacy layout/components with a new view title bar, structured form sections, success card, and scoped styles. Add new form fields and options (single_use, collect_shipping, collect_customer_legal_id, redirect_url, sku), support open-amount links, and allow up to 2 customer reference fields. Build the API request body conditionally from the new fields and references, improve validation and error messaging, and reset form state accordingly. Also update the payment-links index create button to a native button with updated styling.","tree":{"sha":"469e92067bf5811bd0be7a3ae8f659c26ee3d1c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/trees/469e92067bf5811bd0be7a3ae8f659c26ee3d1c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/commits/379e51ecb5b445b7c7ff02a9fcdbcd8543cfd6d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/379e51ecb5b445b7c7ff02a9fcdbcd8543cfd6d1","node_id":"C_kwDOSFkbCtoAKDM3OWU1MWVjYjViNDQ1YjdjN2ZmMDJhOWZjZGJjZDg1NDNjZmQ2ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/e536d3b796038c82f617dde41ca007446e25f9f6","sha":"e536d3b796038c82f617dde41ca007446e25f9f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/e536d3b796038c82f617dde41ca007446e25f9f6"}],"sha":"379e51ecb5b445b7c7ff02a9fcdbcd8543cfd6d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/379e51ecb5b445b7c7ff02a9fcdbcd8543cfd6d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/e536d3b796038c82f617dde41ca007446e25f9f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T03:43:02Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T03:43:02Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"message":"Add debugger & procedures pages; revamp account UI\n\nAdd two new pages: a debugging UI (apps/shell/app/pages/debugger.vue) to inspect webhook events with date filters, pagination and expandable event details; and a procedures list page (apps/shell/app/pages/procedures/list.vue) to start and view account procedures. Rewrite apps/shell/app/pages/my-account.vue to a read-first merchant summary: loads merchant, balance and billing plan data, shows payment methods, disbursement account and warnings, and replaces the previous editable profile/password form. Also make small UI tweaks to transactions page (apps/shell/app/pages/transactions/index.vue): replace Material Icons with UIcon for filter and action icons and adjust icon sizing.","tree":{"sha":"e832f1ead035753d35d35b6e61ec71357db85e46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/trees/e832f1ead035753d35d35b6e61ec71357db85e46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/commits/e536d3b796038c82f617dde41ca007446e25f9f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/e536d3b796038c82f617dde41ca007446e25f9f6","node_id":"C_kwDOSFkbCtoAKGU1MzZkM2I3OTYwMzhjODJmNjE3ZGRlNDFjYTAwNzQ0NmUyNWY5ZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commit/e07f045c3464adec200ea26fc5ebdda4d17e1b2a","sha":"e07f045c3464adec200ea26fc5ebdda4d17e1b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/e07f045c3464adec200ea26fc5ebdda4d17e1b2a"}],"sha":"e536d3b796038c82f617dde41ca007446e25f9f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/e536d3b796038c82f617dde41ca007446e25f9f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/e07f045c3464adec200ea26fc5ebdda4d17e1b2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T03:26:06Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T03:26:06Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"message":"Refactor developers page; add payouts pages\n\nRework developers.vue into a redesigned developer console: new two-column layout, merchant loading, events URL editing with save/unsaved state, public/private key display toggles, secrets visibility, sandbox toggle persisted to localStorage, and key rotation endpoint integration; extensive styling and loading/error handling added. Also add new payouts pages: approvals.vue (pending approvals list with approve/reject actions), consultTransactions.vue (transaction search with date/status filters, table and pagination), favorites.vue (CRUD UI for favorite recipients), and limits.vue (limits UI scaffold). API client usage and basic UX behaviors are implemented for each page.","tree":{"sha":"e28de62831c1511e5478b9b4a5c50b0591b6826e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/trees/e28de62831c1511e5478b9b4a5c50b0591b6826e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/commits/e07f045c3464adec200ea26fc5ebdda4d17e1b2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108434232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech","id":108434232,"login":"Hadech","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaTOA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-m