rl":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hadech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/commits/08b2bde25f7a7a136ad54f2bf2d9bbe675084252/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T03:11:25Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T03:11:25Z","email":"carlos.rendon@wompi.com","name":"Hadech"},"message":"Add payouts pages, documents UI and API\n\nAdd new documents and payouts UI plus a documents API composable.\n\n- apps/shell/app/composables/useDocumentsApi.ts: new composable that wraps legacy /documents endpoints (list with filters and fetch document URL by id).\n- apps/shell/app/pages/documents.vue: new reports page with date filters, type filters, shortcuts, table listing, pagination and download behavior; auto-loads last 30 days on mount and maps legacy report types/icons.\n- apps/shell/app/pages/payouts/balances.vue: new balances page showing available/pending/disbursed amounts, auto-payment toggle, and transaction limits (uses balances store, fetches balance and limits on mount).\n- apps/shell/app/pages/payouts/createPayment.vue: new create-payment form with validation, payload mapping to CreatePayoutRequest, submit via payments store and success/approval UI.\n\nThese additions restore legacy reporting endpoints and introduce screens for managing payouts and creating payments.","tree":{"sha":"48911f3a4ab70fcba0aef33a440e66276c60eab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hadech/merchants-dashboard-mfe-car/git/trees/48911f3a4ab70fcba0aef33a440e66276c60eab0"},"url":"https://api.github.