c/commits/8d501b24db54a53d38a92227f4a97b253e43493e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/22e985fedddf798f88e310de69454176911345db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:42:25Z","email":"Ed.Barnes937@gmail.com","name":"Ed Barnes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:42:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(scope): narrow Scope to filter dims, add QueryFilter for query inputs (#45)\n\n- Drop `recordingId` from `Scope` (lens-framework). Scope is now workspace-\n  level filter only: `{ courseTag?, timeframe? }`.\n- Introduce `QueryFilter extends Scope` for substrate hooks that need to\n  filter by a recording (tags / annotations / confidence / weekly-overview /\n  recordings). Lenses spread their scope + add `recordingId` from config.\n- Add `manifest.filters?: ScopeDim[]` so each lens declares which filter\n  dimensions it consumes; declare `[''courseTag'',''timeframe'']` on test-me\n  and weekly-overview. The shell will use this in Phase 3 to render only\n  the relevant pickers.\n- Tools (audio-capture / transcript / connections) drop the\n  `scope.recordingId ??` fallback and read their target from `config.recordingId`\n  only. Per-panel target replaces the workspace-level recording knob.\n- Remove the now-meaningless \"scope priority\" component tests in audio-capture.\n- Update `scopesFromDb` to stop populating `scope.recordingId` from DB rows;\n  the obsolete `workspace_scopes` row will be cleaned up in a follow-up PR.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"929806c0e7b2be5372f92af4ee20148c00f75f28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/929806c0e7b2be5372f92af4ee20148c00f75f28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/22e985fedddf798f88e310de69454176911345db","verification":{"payload":"tree 929806c0e7b2be5372f92af4ee20148c00f75f28\nparent 36fc41452a2f22c41e4cb315426c7fed265ab8f9\nauthor Ed Barnes <Ed.Barnes937@gmail.com> 1780177345 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780177345 +0100\n\nrefactor(scope): narrow Scope to filter dims, add QueryFilter for query inputs (#45)\n\n- Drop `recordingId` from `Scope` (lens-framework). Scope is now workspace-\n  level filter only: `{ courseTag?, timeframe? }`.\n- Introduce `QueryFilter extends Scope` for substrate hooks that need to\n  filter by a recording (tags / annotations / confidence / weekly-overview /\n  recordings). Lenses spread their scope + add `recordingId` from config.\n- Add `manifest.filters?: ScopeDim[]` so each lens declares which filter\n  dimensions it consumes; declare `[''courseTag'',''timeframe'']` on test-me\n  and weekly-overview. The shell will use this in Phase 3 to render only\n  the relevant pickers.\n- Tools (audio-capture / transcript / connections) drop the\n  `scope.recordingId ??` fallback and read their target from `config.recordingId`\n  only. Per-panel target replaces the workspace-level recording knob.\n- Remove the now-meaningless \"scope priority\" component tests in audio-capture.\n- Update `scopesFromDb` to stop populating `scope.recordingId` from DB rows;\n  the obsolete `workspace_scopes` row will be cleaned up in a follow-up PR.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqG1nBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA15MQAF8M5nvS61055eWpFmgOyiNb\nFtuOaglLGm7BGALvcWbg6ORLZkIlj+eT9C24dMkykhJv7erYE4ew1jgDjtTozDqz\nuK46FbQUizEMpKfMTvNypPArf/9/vZLaL+LWV8G4KoW7J32N0iHtTMl0p72ZCeJA\n8QQovH6veD3mOBeTwSZlZaWvOY6biikwJFXEY1v5TGpF+fKhLJk8Q7GRFcES56gr\nOXf9sWsy+ZCJf9pcR32+V7OGMAbN/pLGLHUG5Q1qm3fZQMw+RQMTYfm5APpwygrK\nvfjxCdPo93ph+XHz78DPoQAlmJXqHsM5Q7gpRiLXc78YD686VZkoIEOUP67PrdIs\n6mqKsv34xt4GXciip0r6xOIY077joXXBm3xv+fftu8voGLA7XaBViIuDFeQMmlZC\ntP1AP+dNmI2wQcDgWXlUIsARhkWs/DjvpODa8x+I/zVQX56JozurgRzBfDK6Fv8f\nukgCbiS/pVOkoVR7MqQ48WG/HZbSrTDgWg186nyCWV7npaGGTe3X73gVOK+KBMQx\nZQkQjM6gkN870MSdMi2KwkGtOfwkc2mKgQODLLKNCLNATSvBy0qfF+q/SinmYg3q\neAE+piYKd2sd66bnOXxVRimvtDG/w+XTyht03oIypnxUIBRGjtltC/P9e0o9EGLu\nqCrlQDndMddUWCOSaNjI\n=8rDx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T21:42:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commit/22e985fedddf798f88e310de69454176911345db","node_id":"C_kwDOSFtkOtoAKDIyZTk4NWZlZGRkZjc5OGY4OGUzMTBkZTY5NDU0MTc2OTExMzQ1ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commit/36fc41452a2f22c41e4cb315426c7fed265ab8f9","sha":"36fc41452a2f22c41e4cb315426c7fed265ab8f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/36fc41452a2f22c41e4cb315426c7fed265ab8f9"}],"sha":"22e985fedddf798f88e310de69454176911345db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/22e985fedddf798f88e310de69454176911345db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/72ee9eefca09b66994b4d2b7aa601c87fdc3b4c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:22:37Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:22:37Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"message":"feat: declare lens-emitted trigger events on PanelManifest\n\nAdd an optional `emits?: string[]` field to PanelManifest and populate\nit on the three tool lenses (audio-capture, transcript, test-me) with\nthe events each one fires through the server. Also adds a pure\n`getTriggerEventsForLens(emits)` helper that filters the global trigger\nlist by a lens''s declared emits.\n\nPurely additive — no consumer reads the field yet. Foundation for moving\nworkflow editing into per-lens config.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5fc9bc216d36972a154c6090ff59b7fcf305280d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/5fc9bc216d36972a154c6090ff59b7fcf305280d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/72ee9eefca09b66994b4d2b7aa601c87fdc3b4c3","verification":{"payload":"tree 5fc9bc216d36972a154c6090ff59b7fcf305280d\nparent 36fc41452a2f22c41e4cb315426c7fed265ab8f9\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780176157 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780176157 +0100\n\nfeat: declare lens-emitted trigger events on PanelManifest\n\nAdd an optional `emits?: string[]` field to PanelManifest and populate\nit on the three tool lenses (audio-capture, transcript, test-me) with\nthe events each one fires through the server. Also adds a pure\n`getTriggerEventsForLens(emits)` helper that filters the global trigger\nlist by a lens''s declared emits.\n\nPurely additive — no consumer reads the field yet. Foundation for moving\nworkflow editing into per-lens config.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAA