h an \"Add lenses\" button\nthat opens the drawer. The overlay is pointer-events-none except the\nbutton, so dropping a lens onto the empty canvas still works.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2afd4efa994a2a1c90ca95b118099173113404fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/2afd4efa994a2a1c90ca95b118099173113404fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/06ce3d9ba126884fcf71b91ca9a7a583b7dfd6b5","verification":{"payload":"tree 2afd4efa994a2a1c90ca95b118099173113404fd\nparent 3b845a0d5ac6f041577b6bc720c589bdd53eaadc\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780155653 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780155653 +0100\n\nfeat: show an empty state when a workspace has no lenses\n\nAn empty workspace previously rendered a blank canvas with no guidance.\nAdd a centered empty state (icon + message) with an \"Add lenses\" button\nthat opens the drawer. The overlay is pointer-events-none except the\nbutton, so dropping a lens onto the empty canvas still works.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJmMnMo+g5uW8W5iOsW47KBYBav\nV7aHCuW21+sEK//6YAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKzlrMmem3C6FtwHCVFPxEX4ukQ92RGORZWM/84l8ZWa8SXisRX29SK1scE7yxvp0H\nSjfVeb3L9DGDGeYOUPVwY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T15:40:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https: