om/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/48c16b884fafc5efb27ec31f7f34cd6214f40cd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T14:42:15Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T14:42:15Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"message":"Merge origin/main into chore/workflow-engine-migration\n\nBrings main (incl. the merged #35 and the workflow-UI / sidebar / panel-drag /\nbetter-defaults PRs) into the consumer-migration branch.\n\nConflicts resolved:\n- packages/substrate/src/index.ts & workflows/index.ts — main added a\n  getAvailableTriggerEvents export; kept it, while keeping #36''s removal of the\n  now-deleted engine''s dispatchWorkflows and the legacy executeJob (superseded\n  by the shared registry). Added createSqlJsAdapter / createSubstrateExecutorRegistry\n  / AFFECTED_QUERY_KEYS exports.\n- apps/server/src/workflows/job-runner.ts — main inlined a job:started emit into\n  the old loop; #36 replaced the loop with the core runner. Kept #36''s per-tx\n  runner and moved job:started into bridgeRunnerEvent so all three runner events\n  (started/completed/failed) forward to the EventBus for the workflow UI.\n- packages/substrate/src/workflows/executors.ts auto-merged cleanly (main''s\n  getAvailableTriggerEvents alongside #36''s shared-registry rewrite).\n\nVerified on the merge: pnpm test 275 passing; substrate/server/workflows tsc\nclean; web typecheck shows only the 4 pre-existing main errors.","t