l":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/4f59ec3c761e43fed90112557559355baeb9eeb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T21:52:44Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T21:52:44Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"message":"test: add unit tests for the sql.js and postgres workflow adapters\n\nCloses the coverage gap on the backend workflow paths (neither substrate nor\nserver had any tests). Both adapters are tested at their natural unit boundary\nwithout a real database:\n\n- sql-js-adapter: mock queries/workflows + db; assert the mapping the adapter\n  owns — enabled number->boolean, params JSON decode (+ {} default), input/\n  output JSON decode, retry_count=0 default, arg threading (retryCount dropped),\n  (jobType, target_id) dedup, and commit -> persistDb.\n- pg-adapter: pure logic over an injected tagged-template `sql` (its only\n  runtime-relevant deps are type-only). Assert exponential backoff (capped 60s),\n  _userId injection into persisted input, userId/scopeId threading, the\n  status->statement branch, and that commit/isDuplicate are omitted.\n\n16 new tests; full suite 274 passing; substrate + server tsc clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9a5eb3990f1bdef6ccb614c554f92a3f592b49d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/b9a5eb3990f1bdef6ccb614c554f92a3f592b49d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/4f59ec3c761e43fed90112557559355baeb9eeb8","verification":{"payload":"tree b9a5eb3990f1bdef6ccb614c554f92a3f592b49d\nparent b0a8c284cb281ba5dee0e2fd03998284ae858e08\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780091564 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780091564 +0100\n\ntest: add unit tests for the sql.js and postgres workflow adapters\n\nCloses the coverage gap on the backend workflow paths (neither substrate nor\nserver had any tests). Both adapters are tested at their natural unit boundary\nwithout a real database:\n\n- sql-js-adapter: mock queries/workflows + db; assert the mapping the adapter\n  owns — enabled number->boolean, params JSON decode (+ {} default), input/\n  output JSON decode, retry_count=0 default, arg threading (retryCount dropped),\n  (jobType, target_id) dedup, and commit -> persistDb.\n- pg-adapter: pure logic over an injected tagged-template `sql` (its only\n  runtime-relevant deps are type-only). Assert exponential backoff (capped 60s),\n  _userId injection into persisted input, userId/scopeId threading, the\n  status->statement branch, and that commit/isDuplicate are omitted.\n\n16 new tests; full suite 274 passing; substrate + server tsc clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJmMnMo+g5uW8W5iOsW47KBYBav\nV7aHCuW21+sEK//6YAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHRBZ8MJmgf4qURRbk6SSrcyzesCpS/GQUXUtrhBWLQWFrpD8tA/6HFg95XJq4BlA1\nXBkCpK+EcEzNWOz+OzaQY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T21:52:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commit/4f59ec3c761e43fed90112557559355baeb9eeb8","node_id":"C_kwDOSFtkOtoAKDRmNTllYzNjNzYxZTQzZmVkOTAxMTI1NTc1NTkzNTViYWViOWVlYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commit/b0a8c284cb281ba5dee0e2fd03998284ae858e08","sha":"b0a8c284cb281ba5dee0e2fd03998284ae858e08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/b0a8c284cb281ba5dee0e2fd03998284ae858e08"}],"sha":"4f59ec3c761e43fed90112557559355baeb9eeb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/4f59ec3c761e43fed90112557559355baeb9eeb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/b0a8c284cb281ba5dee0e2fd03998284ae858e08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T21:32:53Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T21:32:53Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"message":"feat: migrate substrate + server workflow runtimes onto @pls/workflows\n\nRewire both consumers onto the shared storage-agnostic core via thin adapters.\n\nSubstrate (sql.js, browser):\n- Add createSqlJsAdapter() implementing StorageAdapter (sync returns satisfy\n  Awaitable<T>); commit() -> persistDb(); claimPendingJobRuns -> plain SELECT\n- Rewrite useJobRunner to build engine + runner from @pls/workflows and drive\n  processOnce on the 1s interval; query invalidation via runner.onEvent\n- Executors adapted to the shared (input, ctx) => JobResult signature and\n  return events[] instead of an eventType string\n- Delete local workflows/engine.ts (dispatchWorkflows/matchesCondition); set\n  maxRetries=0 (no backoff column)\n\nServer (postgres, node):\n- Add createPgAdapter({ sql, userId }) implementing StorageAdapter; SQL ported\n  verbatim from pg-store.ts (now deleted); backoff stays in enqueueJobRun, the\n  retry DECISION moves to the core (maxRetries=3); commit omitted (tx auto-commits)\n- job-runner builds engine + runner per-tx inside the existing sql.begin loop;\n  runner.onEvent bridges to emitEvent (EventBus unchanged)\n- dispatch.ts becomes a thin wrapper preserving the dispatchWorkflows(tx,\n  userId, ...) signature -> zero churn at the 4 call sites\n\nFlagged behaviour changes (see MIGRATION.md):\n- Cascade depth standardized (cascade at job.depth, engine adds +1) — fixes the\n  prior cross-backend divergence\n- Substrate: coarse query invalidation (per job_type), replacing per-run\n  affectedQueryKeys — slightly more refetching (TODO for fine-grained)\n- Server: persists _userId into job input at enqueue so executors recover RLS\n  context on claim; unknown job types now take the standard failed path\n\nVerification: substrate + server tsc clean (0 errors); pnpm test 258 passing.\nNo automated coverage for the backend workflow paths — runtime verification\nchecklist provided in the PR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d08a0b053272991c5e5f514aa46cead4fe0ad26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/9d08a0b053272991c5e5f514aa46cead4fe0ad26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/b0a8c284cb281ba5dee0e2fd03998284ae858e08","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d08a0b053272991c5e5f514aa46cead4fe0ad26\nparent d6b232ad109915aa873ed75692ed2937aa9f7256\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780090373 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780090373 +0100\n\nfeat: migrate substrate + server workflow runtimes onto @pls/workflows\n\nRewire both consumers onto the shared storage-agnostic core via thin adapters.\n\nSubstrate (sql.js, browser):\n- Add createSqlJsAdapter() implementing StorageAdapter (sync returns satisfy\n  Awaitable<T>); commit() -> persistDb(); claimPendingJobRuns -> plain SELECT\n- Rewrite useJobRunner to build engine + runner from @pls/workflows and drive\n  processOnce on the 1s interval; query invalidation via runner.onEvent\n- Executors adapted to the shared (input, ctx) => JobResult signature and\n  return events[] instead of an eventType string\n- Delete local workflows/engine.ts (dispatchWorkflows/matchesCondition); set\n  maxRetries=0 (no backoff column)\n\nServer (postgres, node):\n- Add createPgAdapter({ sql, userId }) implementing StorageAdapter; SQL ported\n  verbatim from pg-store.ts (now deleted); backoff stays in enqueueJobRun, the\n  retry DECISION moves to the core (maxRetries=3); commit omitted (tx auto-commits)\n- job-runner builds engine + runner per-tx inside the existing sql.begin loop;\n  runner.onEvent bridges to emitEvent (EventBus unchanged)\n- dispatch.ts becomes a thin wrapper preserving the dispatchWorkflows(tx,\n  userId, ...) signature -> zero churn at the 4 call sites\n\nFlagged behaviour changes (see MIGRATION.md):\n- Cascade depth standardized (cascade at job.depth, engine adds +1) — fixes the\n  prior cross-backend divergence\n- Substrate: coarse query invalidation (per job_type), replacing per-run\n  affectedQueryKeys — slightly more refetching (TODO for fine-grained)\n- Server: persists _userId into job input at enqueue so executors recover RLS\n  context on claim; unknown job types now take the standard failed path\n\nVerification: substrate + server tsc clean (0 errors); pnpm test 258 passing.\nNo automated coverage for the backend workflow paths — runtime verification\nchecklist provided in the PR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJmMnMo+g5uW8W5iOsW47KBYBav\nV7aHCuW21+sEK//6YAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIOADfn6Cd03WcouappNrT4DRQIETINIj9d37VzvyfprywGH3CLfv8ZBLd2oJPJl+Y\n3usQVi1/ThaPTNK52hiAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T21:33:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commit/b0a8c284cb281ba5dee0e2fd03998284ae858e08","node_id":"C_kwDOSFtkOtoAKGIwYThjMjg0Y2IyODFiYTVkZWUwZTJmZDAzOTk4Mjg0YWU4NThlMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commit/d6b232ad109915aa873ed75692ed2937aa9f7256","sha":"d6b232ad109915aa873ed75692ed2937aa9f7256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/d6b232ad109915aa873ed75692ed2937aa9f7256"}],"sha":"b0a8c284cb281ba5dee0e2fd03998284ae858e08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/b0a8c284cb281ba5dee0e2fd03998284ae858e08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/d6b232ad109915aa873ed75692ed2937aa9f7256/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T21:23:17Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T21:23:17Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"message":"chore: tidy workspace packages + scaffold shared workflow engine\n\nPost canvas-engine refactor cleanup:\n- Remove apps/web-v1 (stale pre-Phase-2 backup; resolves duplicate @pls/web name)\n- Remove packages/substrate-core (orphaned, zero importers)\n- Remove apps/canvas-poc (POC superseded by @pls/panel-system); drop dev:poc script\n- Port CanvasEngine/PanelChrome/BackgroundPicker/WorkspaceBackground tests from\n  the POC into @pls/panel-system, adapted to the diverged package components\n  (no coverage lost)\n\nRepurpose orphaned @pls/workflows into a storage-agnostic workflow engine:\n- Pure TS core (engine, executor registry, job runner) behind a StorageAdapter\n  interface; no sql.js / postgres / @pls/db / react deps\n- Awaitable<T> adapter methods so sync (sql.js) and async (postgres) backends\n  share one interface; optional isDuplicate/commit hooks feature-detected\n- Standardize cascade depth handling (fixes latent cross-backend divergence)\n- MIGRATION.md documents adapter steps + risks for substrate and server\n\nConsumers (substrate, server) not yet rewired.\n\npnpm test: 258 passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"231cd8568c82fe8128af606bf369f0ee3a8042fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/231cd8568c82fe8128af606bf369f0ee3a8042fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/d6b232ad109915aa873ed75692ed2937aa9f7256","verification":{"payload":"tree 231cd8568c82fe8128af606bf369f0ee3a8042fd\nparent 8e11b5cf6812a3b4507523fd1e2f0bc6d2751d62\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780089797 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780089797 +0100\n\nchore: tidy workspace packages + scaffold shared workflow engine\n\nPost canvas-engine refactor cleanup:\n- Remove apps/web-v1 (stale pre-Phase-2 backup; resolves duplicate @pls/web name)\n- Remove packages/substrate-core (orphaned, zero importers)\n- Remove apps/canvas-poc (POC superseded by @pls/panel-system); drop dev:poc script\n- Port CanvasEngine/PanelChrome/BackgroundPicker/WorkspaceBackground tests from\n  the POC into @pls/panel-system, adapted to the diverged package components\n  (no coverage lost)\n\nRepurpose orphaned @pls/workflows into a storage-agnostic workflow engine:\n- Pure TS core (engine, executor registry, job runner) behind a StorageAdapter\n  interface; no sql.js / postgres / @pls/db / react deps\n- Awaitable<T> adapter methods so sync (sql.js) and async (postgres) backends\n  share one interface; optional isDuplicate/commit hooks feature-detected\n- Standardize cascade depth handling (fixes latent cross-backend divergence)\n- MIGRATION.md documents adapter steps + risks for substrate and server\n\nConsumers (substrate, server) not yet rewired.\n\npnpm test: 258 passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJmMnMo+g5uW8W5iOsW47KBYBav\nV7aHCuW21+sEK//6YAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEjaNQS7fRUEJuVVqwZIo