:"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/45f728d56bff313ea848aae0b826aad110b262fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T14:05:38Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T14:05:38Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"message":"feat: surface workflow system in the UI\n\nExpose the workflow engine to users with job monitoring, workspace-level\nworkflow configuration, and full workflow CRUD from the UI.\n\nServer (tRPC):\n- workflows.forWorkspace / create / update / delete procedures\n- jobs.forWorkflow for per-workflow run history\n- emit job:started event from the job runner\n\nClient:\n- useWorkflowsForWorkspace, useCreateWorkflow, useUpdateWorkflow,\n  useDeleteWorkflow hooks\n- useServerEvents accepts job lifecycle handlers; invalidates running\n  count on job:started\n\nUI (workspace-shell):\n- JobStatusIndicator becomes a slide-out activity drawer with status\n  grouping and live elapsed time; mounted into the TopBar\n- toast notifications on job completion/failure\n- WorkflowSettingsPanel + WorkflowEditor in the drawer sidebar for\n  workspace-level view and CRUD\n\nShared:\n- getAvailableTriggerEvents() in substrate as the single source of truth\n  for trigger labels\n- matching handlers added to the Playwright backend simulator\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fdeb56ba92de39b4843a21adafe624fb55255712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/fdeb56ba92de39b4843a21adafe624fb55255712"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/45f728d56bff313ea848aae0b826aad110b262fd","verification":{"payload":"tree fdeb56ba92de39b4843a21adafe624fb55255712\nparent 8e11b5cf6812a3b4507523fd1e2f0bc6d2751d62\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780063538 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780063538 +0100\n\nfeat: surface workflow system in the UI\n\nExpose the workflow engine to users with job monitoring, workspace-level\nworkflow configuration, and full workflow CRUD from the UI.\n\nServer (tRPC):\n- workflows.forWorkspace / create / update / delete procedures\n- jobs.forWorkflow for per-workflow run history\n- emit job:started event from the job runner\n\nClient:\n- useWorkflowsForWorkspace, useCreateWorkflow, useUpdateWorkflow,\n  useDeleteWorkflow hooks\n- useServerEvents accepts job lifecycle handlers; invalidates running\n  count on job:started\n\nUI (workspace-shell):\n- JobStatusIndicator becomes a slide-out activity drawer with status\n  grouping and live elapsed time; mounted into the TopBar\n- toast notifications on job completion/failure\n- WorkflowSettingsPanel + WorkflowEditor in the drawer sidebar for\n  workspace-level view and CRUD\n\nShared:\n- getAvailableTriggerEvents() in substrate as the single source of truth\n  for trigger labels\n- matching handlers added to the Playwright backend simulator\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJmMnMo+g5uW8W5iOsW47KBYBav\nV7aHCuW21+sEK//6YAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEagXBmmqnuUaV4e6h30/io4o2P5hkeQSakED9ANdeajWAzQCKgN7KtudQTlasYL3d\nC0/6iiHeqNT