d bottom border + subtle background tint to the header\n  so the drag handle is discoverable (border-b border-border-subtle\n  bg-surface-overlay/50)\n- CanvasEngine: add an accent-colored ring via boxShadow and a subtle\n  1.5% scale lift while isGesturing (drag or resize), reverting on release\n\nApplied to both the live app (apps/canvas-poc/src) and the extractable\npackage (packages/panel-system/src) to keep them in sync.\n\nAdds a test asserting the header carries the divider/tint classes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5cae0709793a161cb421f4a58eee24ea39ea9ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/b5cae0709793a161cb421f4a58eee24ea39ea9ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/ec62ca293553affe4d8ba366c2b214423818a38c","verification":{"payload":"tree b5cae0709793a161cb421f4a58eee24ea39ea9ed\nparent 8e11b5cf6812a3b4507523fd1e2f0bc6d2751d62\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780062527 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1780062527 +0100\n\nfeat(canvas): improve panel drag UX with header distinction and drag feedback\n\nMake the panel header visually distinct from content and add clear\nvisual feedback while a panel is being dragged or resized.\n\n- PanelChrome: add bottom border + subtle background tint to the header\n  so the drag handle is discoverable (border-b border-border-subtle\n  bg-surface-overlay/50)\n- CanvasEngine: add an accent-colored ring via boxShadow and a subtle\n  1.5% scale lift while isGesturing (drag or resize), reverting on release\n\nApplied to both the live app (apps/canvas-poc/src) and the extractable\npackage (packages/panel-system/src) to keep them in sync.\n\nAdds a test asserting the header carries the divider/tint classes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAA