r","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/7d147671a58f57386edcaed412e4267b28ef74c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T13:33:01Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T13:33:01Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"message":"fix: stabilize workspace tab order and prevent panel position overwrites\n\nWorkspace tabs reordered non-deterministically because all seeded\nworkspaces share the same created_at timestamp. Added id as a\ntiebreaker to ORDER BY in both server and substrate queries.\n\nReworked the DB-to-canvas sync effect so it only does a full setPanels\non workspace switch. After initial hydration, it handles structural\nchanges (panel add/remove) incrementally — preventing drag positions\nfrom being overwritten by stale query data. Also coerces DB values\nwith Number() defaults so missing migration columns degrade gracefully\ninstead of producing NaN.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca50ee925479610c26a68547e97c239ca91309d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/ca50ee925479610c26a68547e97c239ca91309d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/7d147671a58f57386edcaed412e4267b28ef74c6","verification":{"payload":"tree ca50ee925479610c26a68547e97c239ca91309d7\nparent 37f8f76579e3b18b9f29b7003167f4594fef2dc5\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779543181 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779543181 +0100\n\nfix: stabilize workspace tab order and prevent panel position overwrites\n\nWorkspace tabs reordered non-deterministically because all seeded\nworkspaces share the same created_at timestamp. Added id as a\ntiebreaker to ORDER BY in both server and substrate queries.\n\nReworked the DB-to-canvas sync effect so it only does a full setPanels\non workspace switch. After initial hydration, it handles structural\nchanges (panel add/remove) incrementally — preventing drag positions\nfrom being overwritten by stale query data. Also coerces DB values\nwith Number() defaults so missing migration columns degrade gracefully\ninstead of producing NaN.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJmMnMo+g5uW8W5iOsW47KBYBav\nV7aHCuW21+sEK//6YAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMH8EeI/wWIlusP1fNWYyJCKb6FLAkRLvZTtwAILb+MovOdomZrtIMwhgxWXbq8G/M\n1bmcCBR0gVgcfjJ+H5JQ8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-23T13:33:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commit/7d147671a58f57386edcaed412e4267b28ef74c6","node_id":"C_kwDOSFtkOtoAKDdkMTQ3NjcxYTU4ZjU3Mzg2ZWRjYWVkNDEyZTQyNjdiMjhlZjc0YzY","parents":[