button, and add-panel button (opens drawer).\nDrawerSidebar preserves all sidebar functionality: workspace CRUD,\nscope editor, manifest-driven lens palette with drag-to-canvas,\nand background picker. Drawer overlays the canvas with backdrop,\ncloses on Escape/backdrop-click/drag-start, and manages focus.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4c328875b1c71b935fde53c7817b46171d976a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/f4c328875b1c71b935fde53c7817b46171d976a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/bb6c449a092c8151cdd8a579bd5b6262467774f6","verification":{"payload":"tree f4c328875b1c71b935fde53c7817b46171d976a7\nparent 2fb56df6121eebdcdd9c153f7684ad7a336ac029\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779464635 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779464635 +0100\n\nfeat: replace fixed sidebar with TopBar + DrawerSidebar\n\nReplace the 240px fixed sidebar with a persistent top bar and a\nslide-over drawer. The layout changes from 2-column (sidebar + content)\nto single-column (top bar above full-width canvas).\n\nTopBar shows workspace name, scope summary chip, theme toggle,\nauto-organize button, and add-panel button (opens drawer).\nDrawerSidebar preserves all sidebar functionality: workspace CRUD,\nscope editor, manifest-driven lens palette with drag-to-canvas,\nand background picker. Drawer overlays the canvas with backdrop,\ncloses on Escape/backdrop-click/drag-start, and manages focus.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJmMnMo+g5uW8W5iOsW47KBYBav\nV7aHCuW21+sEK//6YAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBimIQQn/kRv+t89R4jcBFGU2RlPbcuBDW3Eulcqj8pCk88kZz6dxfpN771lBe+09L\nm09dUXeu0WWqAFwCkQlwQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T15:44:02