orkspace background per workspace with debounced mutation\n\nAdd useWorkspaceBackground hook that reads background config from the\nworkspace query and provides a debounced setter via the existing\nupdateBackground tRPC mutation. Port WorkspaceBackground and\nBackgroundPicker components from the canvas POC into workspace-shell,\nwired to the new hook. Each workspace independently maintains its own\nbackground, with optimistic UI updates via a lightweight zustand store.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a522bd83f7c0076943114ad23630693855aeb30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/4a522bd83f7c0076943114ad23630693855aeb30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/65ea87b0ea369128bfb64e0c09af23ac398e0b1c","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a522bd83f7c0076943114ad23630693855aeb30\nparent 5c77fe5e57e3e8f7d0870ac99b89feb61d8c04cd\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779457593 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779457593 +0100\n\nfeat: persist workspace background per workspace with debounced mutation\n\nAdd useWorkspaceBackground hook that reads background config from the\nworkspace query and provides a debounced setter via the existing\nupdateBackground tRPC mutation. Port WorkspaceBackground and\nBackgroundPicker components from the canvas POC into workspace-shell,\nwired to the new hook. Each workspace independently maintains its own\nbackground, with optimistic UI updates via a lightweight zustand store.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJmMnMo+g5uW8W5iOsW47KBYBav\nV7aHCuW21+sEK//6YAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCbYYPotXkaf9KsT0t3bhC9rgCRDOLar/oKTJczLMRf/vztdaHPnmTpMf8iD1aT4xV\nP0wgk17ochVgja4tHXcQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"20