d694345ea49446408de50e7d5c2b72d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T13:57:01Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T13:57:01Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"message":"feat: add focus mode and fullscreen to canvas engine\n\nAdd focus mode (F key or programmatic) that dims non-focused panels to\n30% opacity, and fullscreen mode that smoothly transitions a panel to\nfill the canvas area. Both states live in the Zustand store with CSS\ntransitions (200ms ease-out). Escape exits fullscreen first, then focus\nmode. F key is suppressed when typing in inputs/textareas/contenteditable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ef10e86093623026431bc7cadb6b1b04adfdce0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/0ef10e86093623026431bc7cadb6b1b04adfdce0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/7b83ad353d694345ea49446408de50e7d5c2b72d","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ef10e86093623026431bc7cadb6b1b04adfdce0\nparent 1a2e09676a01dcde3d9d72927fe32b43bd1c997e\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779371821 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779371821 +0100\n\nfeat: add focus mode and fullscreen to canvas engine\n\nAdd focus mode (F key or programmatic) that dims non-focused panels to\n30% opacity, and fullscreen mode that smoothly transitions a panel to\nfill the canvas area. Both states live in the Zustand store with CSS\ntransitions (200ms ease-out). Escape exits fullscreen first, then focus\nmode. F key is suppressed when typing in inputs/textareas/contenteditable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJmMnMo+g5uW8W5iOsW47KBYBav\nV7aHCuW21+sEK//6YAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMLf/kO