://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/9c964884560dc1293f14d05c6fc62b9f13a3eebe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T13:00:28Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T13:00:28Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"message":"feat: add panel chrome with header, close button, entrance animation\n\nReplace coloured rectangle stand-ins with real panel chrome:\n- PanelChrome component with slim header bar (icon, title, close button)\n- Drag restricted to header only using Motion dragControls + dragListener={false}\n- Focused shadow (var(--shadow-panel-focused)) applied to top z-index panel\n- Entrance animation (scale 0.95 -> 1, opacity 0 -> 1, 200ms)\n- Scrollable placeholder content per panel type (document, audio, tags, etc.)\n- PanelItem type extended with optional title and type fields\n- Sample panels updated with meaningful titles and types\n- 11 new PanelChrome tests + updated CanvasEngine tests (82 total passing)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8644d66da8081a8374c5bbb68f7b0c5a8839e9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/8644d66da8081a8374c5bbb68f7b0c5a8839e9af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/9c964884560dc1293f14d05c6fc62b9f13a3eebe","verification":{"payload":"tree 8644d66da8081a8374c5bbb68f7b0c5a8839e9af\nparent f1773e2ba67d91c9a4cf14f2b6bdb8