oc/commits/826d7cb34798e72d733e1a7c0a7f1aa1cdfdbf93"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/da16001d5adc29b90871fe21a04cc219d123dbd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T11:25:00Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T11:25:00Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"message":"fix: address review feedback for resize handles and snap logic\n\nMust-fix #1: Transitions now disabled during resize gestures. ResizeHandle\nsignals gesture start/end to DraggablePanel via onGestureChange callback,\nwhich toggles the same isGesturing state used by drag.\n\nMust-fix #2: Leading-edge shift-snap no longer overwrites position. During\nresize, dimensions are snapped and clamped first, then leading-edge position\nis derived from original origin + original size - final size. Position is\nnever snapped independently.\n\nShould-fix #3: clampDimensions now guards against min > max by raising the\neffective max to equal min. Minimum always wins.\n\nShould-fix #5: useShiftKey resets to false on window blur, preventing stuck\nshift state when user alt-tabs while holding Shift.\n\nKnown limitations documented: mid-gesture shift toggle jitter (item 4) and\n6px dead zone between edge/corner handles (item 6).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95ea86f63d043da5eb81386d58974ab1eeb715ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/95ea86f63d043da5eb81386d58974ab1eeb715ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/da16001d5adc29b90871fe21a04cc219d123dbd2","verification":{"payload":"tree 95ea86f63d043da5eb81386d58974ab1eeb715ad\nparent 7045d70042ead84c8b4d4a1293a3d80a41ef6065\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779362700 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779362700 +0100\n\nfix: address review feedback for resize handles and snap logic\n\nMust-fix #1: Transitions now disabled during resize gestures. ResizeHandle\nsignals gesture start/end to DraggablePanel via onGestureChange callback,\nwhich toggles the same isGesturing state used by drag.\n\nMust-fix #2: Leading-edge shift-snap no longer overwrites position. During\nresize, dimensions are snapped and clamped first, then leading-edge position\nis derived from original origin + original size - final size. Position is\nnever snapped independently.\n\nShould-fix #3: clampDimensions now guards against min > max by raising the\neffective max to equal min. Minimum always wins.\n\nShould-fix #5: useShiftKey resets to false on window blur, preventing stuck\nshift state when user alt-tabs while holding Shift.\n\nKnown limitations documented: mid-gesture shift toggle jitter (item 4) and\n6px dead zone between edge/corner handles (item 6).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJmMnMo+g5uW8W5iOsW47KBYBav\nV7aHCuW21+sEK//6YAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCa8rh8akr4pEIqmB4P8iR5ZR2YqpxEhBXq9Zau4UAZ27CFm1b960Dvdh+16AGGXNu\nzeB1yxrroUI3kogL7R3gc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-21T11:25:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commit/da16001d5adc29b90871fe21a04cc219d123dbd2","node_id":"C_kwDOSFtkOtoAKGRhMTYwMDFkNWFkYzI5YjkwODcxZmUyMWEwNGNjMjE5ZDEyM2RiZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commit/7045d70042ead84c8b4d4a1293a3d80a41ef6065","sha":"7045d70042ead84c8b4d4a1293a3d80a41ef6065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/7045d70042ead84c8b4d4a1293a3d80a41ef6065"}],"sha":"da16001d5adc29b90871fe21a04cc219d123dbd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/da16001d5adc29b90871fe21a04cc219d123dbd2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"Ed-Barnes937","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUwODc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/commits/7045d70042ead84c8b4d4a1293a3d80a41ef6065/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T11:19:25Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T11:19:25Z","email":"ed.barnes937@gmail.com","name":"ed-barnes937"},"message":"feat: add 8-handle resize and shift-snap to canvas engine\n\nAdd resizePanel store action with SizeConstraints clamping (200x150 default\nminimum). Each panel now has 8 invisible resize handles (4 corners at 12px,\n4 edges at 8px) using raw pointer events with pointer capture. Corner handles\nadjust position and dimensions simultaneously; edge handles adjust one axis.\n\nShift-snap rounds position and dimensions to a 20px grid during both drag\nand resize gestures. Panel transitions (200ms ease-out) apply at rest but\nare disabled during active gestures to avoid lag.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"290b69e0d517a1c80d37c7f77240de71e994a7f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/trees/290b69e0d517a1c80d37c7f77240de71e994a7f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ed-Barnes937/malleable-pls-poc/git/commits/7045d70042ead84c8b4d4a1293a3d80a41ef6065","verification":{"payload":"tree 290b69e0d517a1c80d37c7f77240de71e994a7f4\nparent 240ccde65d2ece9f7bae029bbee8b92bdf8681a8\nauthor ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779362365 +0100\ncommitter ed-barnes937 <ed.barnes937@gmail.com> 1779362365 +0100\n\nfeat: add 8-handle resize and shift-snap to canvas engine\n\nAdd resizePanel store action with SizeConstraints clamping (200x150 default\nminimum). Each panel now has 8 invisible resize handles (4 corners at 12px,\n4 edges at 8px) using raw pointer events with pointer capture. Corner handles\nadjust position and dimensions simultaneously; edge handles adjust one axis.\n\nShift-snap rounds position and dimensions to a 20px grid during both drag\nand resize gestures. Panel transitions (200ms ease-out) apply at rest but\nare disabled during active gestures to avoid lag.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJmMnMo+g5uW8W5iOsW47KBYBav\nV7aHCuW21+sEK//6YAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQA883YVneMreLy2nFDHX0i8r+lS0ClVNG4a7o4lMWbOFZSN+/XgKRCNWhyrc9vE7QJ\nj3hoYIvuD6+m/BaOrpuA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-21T11:19:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31850876?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ed-Barnes937/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ed-Barnes937","id":31850876,"login":"