o/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wahyuwidharto","id":65748107,"login":"wahyuwidharto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ4MTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/0dab281c06f735e4462cbdf573d40cb7b8b407f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T01:40:58Z","email":"65748107+wahyuwidharto@users.noreply.github.com","name":"wahyuwidharto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T01:40:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(readme): restructure + prose pass for public-repo readability (#14)\n\n* docs(readme): restructure for public-repo readability\n\nPure restructuring pass — every sentence survives; only headings,\npositions, and the intro bullets change:\n\n- Add a table of contents after the intro.\n- Move the M4/M5.A/M5.B/M5.C milestone paragraphs out of Quick start\n  into a dedicated ''Feature deep-dives'' section (bold leads become\n  headings; prose verbatim).\n- Promote the golden flow to its own ''Try the full flow'' H2 so Quick\n  start ends at the smoke check.\n- Promote the admin-authorization blockquote to an ''Admin\n  authorization'' subsection under Architecture.\n- Rename ''Status'' to ''Documentation'' and move the sources-of-truth\n  table below the visitor-facing sections (Quick start, Deploy, Game\n  integration).\n- Update ''What''s in the box'' to match shipped scope: distribution\n  models two -> three (ADT), plus bullets for window enforcement,\n  auto-approve, and the admin detail-page shell + announcements, each\n  linking to its deep-dive.\n\n* docs(readme): humanize prose, bulletize dense sections, collapse deep-dives\n\n- Rewrite the em-dash-heavy telegraphic style into plain sentences\n  (37 -> 3 em-dashes in prose); expand fragments into full sentences.\n- Bulletize the dense parts: the four feature deep-dives, the admin\n  authorization block, and the golden-flow description (now a 10-step\n  list matching the 10 NDJSON output lines).\n- Wrap each deep-dive body in <details>/<summary> with the heading and\n  a one-line summary kept outside, so TOC and intro-bullet anchors\n  still land correctly (GitHub does not auto-expand closed <details>\n  on fragment navigation).\n- No facts, links, or anchors changed.\n\n* docs(readme): replace walkthrough gif with ADT + auto-approve flow\n\nNew recording: admin creates an ADT-distribution playtest with\nauto-approve enabled, player signs up, is approved instantly, and\nreceives the ADT build download link. Alt text updated to match.","tree":{"sha":"d9fda4a2c1403638394a6b60aee6b20062d203e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/d9fda4a2c1403638394a6b60aee6b20062d203e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/0dab281c06f735e4462cbdf573d40cb7b8b407f9","verification":{"payload":"tree d9fda4a2c1403638394a6b60aee6b20062d203e0\nparent 747f75b9faefa05b741ca1f61d9f81f5fae7b833\nauthor wahyuwidharto <65748107+wahyuwidharto@users.noreply.github.com> 1784079658 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784079658 +0700\n\ndocs(readme): restructure + prose pass for public-repo readability (#14)\n\n* docs(readme): restructure for public-repo readability\n\nPure restructuring pass — every sentence survives; only headings,\npositions, and the intro bullets change:\n\n- Add a table of contents after the intro.\n- Move the M4/M5.A/M5.B/M5.C milestone paragraphs out of Quick start\n  into a dedicated ''Feature deep-dives'' section (bold leads become\n  headings; prose verbatim).\n- Promote the golden flow to its own ''Try the full flow'' H2 so Quick\n  start ends at the smoke check.\n- Promote the admin-authorization blockquote to an ''Admin\n  authorization'' subsection under Architecture.\n- Rename ''Status'' to ''Documentation'' and move the sources-of-truth\n  table below the visitor-facing sections (Quick start, Deploy, Game\n  integration).\n- Update ''What''s in the box'' to match shipped scope: distribution\n  models two -> three (ADT), plus bullets for window enforcement,\n  auto-approve, and the admin detail-page shell + announcements, each\n  linking to its deep-dive.\n\n* docs(readme): humanize prose, bulletize dense sections, collapse deep-dives\n\n- Rewrite the em-dash-heavy telegraphic style into plain sentences\n  (37 -> 3 em-dashes in prose); expand fragments into full sentences.\n- Bulletize the dense parts: the four feature deep-dives, the admin\n  authorization block, and the golden-flow description (now a 10-step\n  list matching the 10 NDJSON output lines).\n- Wrap each deep-dive body in <details>/<summary> with the heading and\n  a one-line summary kept outside, so TOC and intro-bullet anchors\n  still land correctly (GitHub does not auto-expand closed <details>\n  on fragment navigation).\n- No facts, links, or anchors changed.\n\n* docs(readme): replace walkthrough gif with ADT + auto-approve flow\n\nNew recording: admin creates an ADT-distribution playtest with\nauto-approve enabled, player signs up, is approved instantly, and\nreceives the ADT build download link. Alt text updated to match.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVuUqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANo8QAG9qBGgPEHjOw1cxRqgSXCwH\neZjJg70aSjJGcmB7V4AK4mH3MwZaFa6OHerfMDZpGjEDsrbY6dF+WFo8pI5vQasw\nR1+s0Jt9DaPQvhVCxVhwIyz45LSTkALWoPDTVxa9pztz6H3kHUDqSjVjEZa2y+T7\nTa8N0z5djVu/gX3hZDD1p0oQLIu5DmAV64w1vOX08TTMdnONBIzBSGWh4f0vwWh4\nNaFvH3nEeGWI9H48QdT9AuL4FHwEl+M6oeG4hpmz0hZuonZc