o","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzQ4MTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wahyuwidharto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/9e2a80ca44803e3eb55ff45ce4deaa3f929b18cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T01:40:09Z","email":"65748107+wahyuwidharto@users.noreply.github.com","name":"wahyuwidharto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T01:40:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(admin): single-file + buildinfo guidance in ADT build picker (#10)\n\n* feat(admin): single-file build guidance in ADT build picker\n\nAdd a non-blocking info banner at the top of the shared ADTBuildPickerModal\nso it surfaces in both the create-playtest form and the distribution tab''s\nChange Build flow (both open the same picker).\n\nCollapsed it reads \"Before uploading to ADT, package your build into a\nsingle file.\" with a Learn more toggle; expanded it explains that a\nsingle-file build yields one clean download link per invite while\nmulti-file builds produce a link per file. Progressive disclosure keeps it\nout of the way. Info icon nudged to align with the title''s first line.\n\nAdds a test covering the notice + Learn more / Show less toggle.\n\n* feat(admin): note buildinfo-only support in ADT build notice\n\nExpand the ADT build-picker notice into two bullets: package as a single\nfile (one download link), and buildinfo-only (smartbuild not supported).\nThe picker already greys out non-buildinfo builds; this surfaces the\nconstraint up front. Trimmed the prose to short scannable bullets.\n\n* fix(admin): restore bullet markers on ADT notice list (preflight resets list-style)","tree":{"sha":"64a98cef28fa9165aae5fbce7e0a7a87e9f0675b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/64a98cef28fa9165aae5fbce7e0a7a87e9f0675b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/9e2a80ca44803e3eb55ff45ce4deaa3f929b18cf","verification":{"payload":"tree 64a98cef28fa9165aae5fbce7e0a7a87e9f0675b\nparent 6d779533ffc400ab55f2c692184ef3e4466b40a8\nauthor wahyuwidharto <65748107+wahyuwidharto@users.noreply.github.com> 1784079609 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784079609 +0700\n\nfeat(admin): single-file + buildinfo guidance in ADT build picker (#10)\n\n* feat(admin): single-file build guidance in ADT build picker\n\nAdd a non-blocking info banner at the top of the shared ADTBuildPickerModal\nso it surfaces in both the create-playtest form and the distribution tab''s\nChange Build flow (both open the same picker).\n\nCollapsed it reads \"Before uploading to ADT, package your build into a\nsingle file.\" with a Learn more toggle; expanded it explains that a\nsingle-file build yields one clean download link per invite while\nmulti-file builds produce a link per file. Progressive disclosure keeps it\nout of the way. Info icon nudged to align with the title''s first line.\n\nAdds a test covering the notice + Learn more / Show less toggle.\n\n* feat(admin): note buildinfo-only support in ADT build notice\n\nExpand the ADT build-picker notice into two bullets: package as a single\nfile (one download link), and buildinfo-only (smartbuild not supported).\nThe picker already greys out non-buildinfo builds; this surfaces the\nconstraint up front. Trimmed the prose to short scannable bullets.\n\n* fix(admin): restore bullet markers on ADT notice list (preflight resets list-style)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVuT5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiU8QAFtIgG5BRJwNjU0skvZ