2dd2f467634b127c0f68e561a712cee67a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T00:36:24Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T00:36:24Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(adt): ChangeADTBuild RPC + admin Change Build; drop dead per-playtest Unlink\n\nDistribution-tab ADT panel shipped two handler-less stub buttons. Per PRD the\nper-playtest Unlink is wrong (linkage is studio-scoped — unlink lives on the\nPlaytests list page), so it is removed. Change Build is now a real feature:\n\n- proto: ChangeADTBuild(playtestId, adtGameId, adtBuildId),\n  POST .../playtests/{id}/adt/build:change\n- backend (pkg/service/adt.go): verify the new (game, build) pair against the\n  linkage via the existing ListBuilds round-trip, mutate game+build, keep\n  adtNamespace immutable; audit action playtest.adt_build_change. Already-\n  approved applicants keep the URL already DM''d; future approvals + RetryDM\n  re-mint against the new build.\n- admin: remove Unlink button; wire Change Build to the build picker (extracted\n  to shared/adt-build-picker.tsx to break a federated-element→detail→tab cycle).\n- cli: pth adt build change + smoke dry-run probe.\n- docs: PRD §4.7/§4.8.6/§5.1, errors.md (6 rows), schema.md audit bullet,\n  STATUS_M5 C13.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5eca5b9b409766e59246139131902b4425f39207","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/5eca5b9b409766e59246139131902b4425f39207"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/e5d4c2dd2f467634b127c0f68e561a712cee67a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/e5d4c2dd2f467634b127c0f68e561a712cee67a6","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKGU1ZDRjMmRkMmY0Njc2MzRiMTI3YzBmNjhlNTYxYTcxMmNlZTY3YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/2ef7abe93fbfd5f28675a70c6550e9a288534f18","sha":"2ef7abe93fbfd5f28675a70c6550e9a288534f18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/2ef7abe93fbfd5f28675a70c6550e9a288534f18"}],"sha":"e5d4c2dd2f467634b127c0f68e561a712cee67a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/e5d4c2dd2f467634b127c0f68e561a712cee67a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/2ef7abe93fbfd5f28675a70c6550e9a288534f18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T06:58:45Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T06:58:45Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"fix(adt): map build-not-found errorCode + send list page limit\n\nADT''s downloadUrls endpoint returns HTTP 404 errorCode=1003303402\n(\"build not found\") when a build is deleted from ADT after a playtest\nis created. classify previously fell through to *ClientError, so\nGetADTDownloadInfo / ApproveApplicant surfaced a misleading\ncodes.Unavailable (\"ADT temporarily unavailable\") instead of an\nactionable error. Add ErrBuildNotFound (errorCode 1003303402) and map\nit to FailedPrecondition with a build-gone message; the operator\nfallback download URL still wins when set.\n\nListGames / ListBuilds sent no limit query param, so ADT''s default\npage size could silently truncate the admin game/build picker. Send an\nexplicit single-page ceiling (200) on both list calls.\n\nNew errors.md row for the build-not-found IssueDownloadURL condition.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c37c85cd095d84e58fcfb21383852d5b16254d8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/c37c85cd095d84e58fcfb21383852d5b16254d8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/2