060035b734a3d8ad56c56e063ecba2edeb0f586a","sha":"060035b734a3d8ad56c56e063ecba2edeb0f586a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/060035b734a3d8ad56c56e063ecba2edeb0f586a"}],"sha":"93c0d3f16788839a9e350e4aa35ecdb816b4b480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/93c0d3f16788839a9e350e4aa35ecdb816b4b480"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/060035b734a3d8ad56c56e063ecba2edeb0f586a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T06:32:52Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T06:32:52Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(adt): surface full ADT download URL list end-to-end\n\nADT''s downloadUrls endpoint returns one URL per build asset. Previously\nplaytesthub took URLs[0] and dropped the rest, silently losing data for\nmulti-asset builds (game binary + patcher + manifest, etc.).\n\n- pkg/adt: IssuedDownloadURL.URL -> URLs []string; HTTPClient returns\n  the full list in ADT''s original order; MemClient mints a 1-element\n  list. IssuedDownloadURLLog mirrors the new shape.\n- proto: GetADTDownloadInfoResponse.url -> repeated string urls.\n- pkg/service: resolveADTDownloadURL returns ([]string, source, err);\n  fallback wraps adtFallbackDownloadUrl in a single-element list;\n  GetADTDownloadInfo + approve + retry_dm + auto-approve all plumb the\n  list through.\n- DM body: single-URL builds keep the historical one-line copy;\n  multi-URL builds render a numbered list (1) <url> per line) so each\n  asset shows as a separate tappable link on Discord.\n- repo audit-log: applicant.approve JSONB key adtUrl -> adtUrls array.\n- player UI: AdtDownloadInfo.urls; Pending.svelte renders one <a> per\n  URL via <ol> when len>1, keeps the single-link path for len<=1.\n- Docs: PRD §4.8.3/§4.8.4, schema.md audit rows, runbooks/adt-linking,\n  STATUS_M5 B6, new dm-queue §\"DM body shape - ADT distribution\".\n- Codegen: regenerated pb stubs, swagger, admin TS bindings.\n\nTests: 1 new pkg/adt multi-URL HTTP pin, 2 new DM body pins\n(single-URL + multi-URL), 1 new player multi-URL render pin; every\nexisting test migrated to the new shape. go test ./..., golangci-lint,\nbuf lint, admin + player vitest, make smoke all green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae34b8cee4da51aae7df80cd49bade24a5311fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/ae34b8cee4da51aae7df80cd49bade24a5311fec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/060035b734a3d8ad56c56e063ecba2edeb0f586a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https: