r","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/bfc49b2c3928a45f8b2bdf9b47a91d6331bad4bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T04:29:03Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T04:29:03Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(admin): drop ADT typed-fallback inputs + fallback URL from create form\n\nThe Direct Download (ADT) flow now only exposes the linkage Select +\nSelect Game Build picker. The typed \"ADT game id\" / \"ADT build id\"\ninputs that used to render when ListADTGames returned 5xx are gone —\noperators always go through the picker modal, which sets adtGameId +\nadtBuildId via Form.setFieldValue. The Static fallback download URL\nfield is removed from the create form (DistributionTab''s read-only\nview still surfaces it on already-created playtests). adtFallbackDownloadUrl\nalso dropped from the create FormValues schema + mutate payload.\n\nRemoved the matching \"falls back to typed game id + flat build select\"\nvitest case along with the inline fallback-URL assertion in the\n\"reveals the ADT field set\" test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4ced2605a31bd3ed6b4c427a1bd5ec534b67e39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/d4ced2605a31bd3ed6b4c427a1bd5ec534b67e39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/bfc49b2c3928a45f8b2bdf9b47a91d6331bad4bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use