TE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/9a550af2b06f2523298576d386ef7ed1075e6fe3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T03:04:09Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T03:04:09Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"fix(M5.B): callback recover affordance when ADT omits adt_namespace\n\nThe 2026-05-21 recovery button on ADTLinkCallbackPage was gated on\n`result=failed && adtNamespace !== \"\"`. Live ADT failure URLs carry\nresult + reason + state but NOT adt_namespace, so the button never\nrendered and operators dead-ended at the error alert.\n\nExpose a typed-namespace recovery path when ADT omits the echo: a\n\"Recover existing linkage\" CTA opens an Input where the operator\ntypes the ADT namespace they were trying to link, and Submit calls\nRecoverADTLinkage with that value. Server-side state is not extended\nbecause StartADTLink never receives adt_namespace (ADT picks it on\nits side), so there is nothing to look up by state token.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"630b24cfd64e43399fb4266ce193885014547118","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/630b24cfd64e43399fb4266ce193885014547118"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/9a550af2b06f2523298576d386ef7ed1075e6fe3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsig