","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/b8288afd9cf3031e45561fb6a04beac2122b673f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:54:21Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:54:21Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"docs(M5.B): point ADT spec reference at live swagger + record envelope shapes\n\nAdds an Addendum 2026-05-21 block to STATUS_M5.md cataloguing the six\nbugs found by direct probing today and their resolutions, plus the\ncanonical-reference swap from the stale local\n/home/ab/Downloads/adt-spec.txt drop to the live swagger at\ndevelop.blackbox.accelbyte.io/profiling/apidocs/api.json (v1.35.0, no\nauth). pkg/adt/client.go package comment now embeds the same swagger\nURL + the verified envelope shapes (data[] for list endpoints,\nflat-urls + top-level expires_at for downloadUrls, errorCode-keyed\nerror envelope) so future readers do not have to hunt across docs.\n\ngodox lint fix in the new Bug 4 test comment (drop the bare \"Bug 4.\"\ntrailer that golangci-lint flagged as TODO/BUG/FIXME noise).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cba487aded41b590166520079e1aa618a7621e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/cba487aded41b590166520079e1aa618a7621e17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/b8288afd9cf3031e45561fb6a04beac2122b673f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/b8288afd9cf3031e45561fb6a04beac2122b673f","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKGI4Mjg4YWZkOWNmMzAzMWU0NTU2MWZiNmEwNGJlYWMyMTIyYjY3M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/ac37ada68e7d27b696e0804837fbdaa47de55869","sha":"ac37ada68e7d27b696e0804837fbdaa47de55869","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/ac37ada68e7d27b696e0804837fbdaa47de55869"}],"sha":"b8288afd9cf3031e45561fb6a04beac2122b673f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/b8288afd9cf3031e45561fb6a04beac2122b673f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/ac37ada68e7d27b696e0804837fbdaa47de55869/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:52:29Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:52:29Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"test(M5.B): canary that Authorization uses capital `Bearer ` prefix\n\nBug 6 from the 2026-05-21 probe: live ADT rejects\n`Authorization: bearer ...` (lowercase b) with HTTP 401. Production\nalready uses the correct `\"Bearer \"` prefix in HTTPClient.doJSON, but\nnothing locks the literal — a future refactor that pipes the prefix\nthrough strings.ToLower or fmt.Sprintf(\"%s %s\", ...) would silently\nbreak against live ADT and the per-call unit tests would still pass.\n\nAdd a focused canary that asserts the byte-exact `Bearer ` prefix on\nthe outgoing header. No production-code change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93870d4a9c28aadb72dc4fe5ea163aef1734b838","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/93870d4a9c28aadb72dc4fe5ea163aef1734b838"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/ac37ada68e7d27b696e0804837fbdaa47de55869","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/ac37ada68e7d27b696e0804837fbdaa47de55869","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKGFjMzdhZGE2OGU3ZDI3YjY5NmUwODA0ODM3ZmJkYWE0N2RlNTU4Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/219558bfae31900e5c6e25a7b04187a012a9bc1b","sha":"219558bfae31900e5c6e25a7b04187a012a9bc1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/219558bfae31900e5c6e25a7b04187a012a9bc1b"}],"sha":"ac37ada68e7d27b696e0804837fbdaa47de55869","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/ac37ada68e7d27b696e0804837fbdaa47de55869"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/219558bfae31900e5c6e25a7b04187a012a9bc1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:52:04Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:52:04Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"fix(M5.B): classify ADT errors by JSON errorCode, not HTTP status\n\nLive ADT v1.35.0 (verified 2026-05-21 against the public swagger)\ndispatches client-visible failure classes through a JSON envelope\n`{\"errorCode\": int, \"errorMessage\": string}` whose value is decoupled\nfrom the HTTP status. The \"401 → ErrLinkageMissing\" collapse of the\noriginal 2026-05-19 spec is now wrong: real linkage-missing is\n`HTTP 404 + errorCode=99`, 401 splits into \"bearer broken\"\n(errorCode=401) vs \"route permission missing\" (errorCode=20001), and\nRecoverADTLinkage''s probe — which relies on ErrLinkageMissing\ndiscrimination — was mis-classifying every live failure as transient.\n\nBug 4 — sentinels + classification:\n- Add ErrUnauthenticated (errorCode=401; rotate AGS_IAM_CLIENT_*) and\n  ErrPermissionDenied (errorCode=20001; ask ADT-eng for grant) alongside\n  existing ErrLinkageMissing (now triggered by errorCode=99).\n- classify() now dispatches on ADTErrorCodeCarrier FIRST, falling back\n  to HTTP status only for bodies without a usable errorCode (plaintext\n  mux-level 404/405 from unknown sub-paths).\n- IsUnauthenticated + IsPermissionDenied helpers mirror existing\n  Is{LinkageMissing,RateLimited,Unavailable}.\n\nBug 5 — content-type-aware error parsing:\n- doJSON branches on Content-Type before attempting json.Unmarshal so\n  plaintext mux-level errors do not cause spurious parse failures; raw\n  body is still preserved on httpStatusError for log readability.\n\nService-layer integration:\n- recordUnlinkADTSideFailure adds \"unauthenticated\" and\n  \"permission_denied\" reason labels so the\n  adt_unlink_adt_side_failures_total Prometheus counter surfaces the\n  new failure classes for alerting.\n- RecoverADTLinkage maps the new sentinels to distinct FailedPrecondition\n  messages so operators see the right action (credential rotate vs IAM\n  grant vs StartADTLink) instead of a generic \"ADT temporarily\n  unavailable\".\n\nTests cover all three errorCode dispatches against real envelope shapes,\nplus the plaintext-404 fallthrough (locks Bug 5 against future\ncontent-type drift).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"473d3da17a6093019f07e6fe9825486f35bd6982","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/473d3da17a6093019f07e6fe9825486f35bd6982"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/219558bfae31900e5c6e25a7b04187a012a9bc1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/219558bfae31900e5c6e25a7b04187a012a9bc1b","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDIxOTU1OGJmYWUzMTkwMGU1YzZlMjVhN2IwNDE4N2EwMTJhOWJjMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/21b06bcc17938dc623e14d21d0e43ecafe0121e5","sha":"21b06bcc17938dc623e14d21d0e43ecafe0121e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/21b06bcc17938dc623e14d21d0e43ecafe0121e5"}],"sha":"219558bfae31900e5c6e25a7b04187a012a9bc1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/219558bfae31900e5c6e25a7b04187a012a9bc1b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/21b06bcc17938dc623e14d21d0e43ecafe0121e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:47:05Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:47:05Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"fix(M5.B): decode ADT downloadUrls as flat urls[] + top-level expires_at\n\nLive ADT v1.35.0 (verified 2026-05-21 against the public swagger) returns\nthe downloadUrls payload as\n`{\"urls\": [string, ...], \"expires_at\": \"RFC3339\"}` — a flat string list\nwith a single top-level expiry. The current decoder expects a\n`{\"download_urls\": [{url, expires_at}, ...]}` shape with per-URL expiry,\nso every live IssueDownloadURL surfaced empty + ClientError 404 — Bug 3\nfrom the 2026-05-21 probe report.\n\nReshape the decode struct accordingly; the \"first URL wins\" semantic\nstays (playtest builds are a single file in practice). Tests updated to\nthe real envelope plus regression cases locking both halves: legacy\nshape must NOT decode, top-level expires_at must propagate to\nIssuedDownloadURL.ExpiresAt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c16885b8e840b22d34d80a9bbff8faaa8f6d8162","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/c16885b8e840b22d34d80a9bbff8faaa8f6d8162"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/21b06bcc17938dc623e14d21d0e43ecafe0121e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/21b06bcc17938dc623e14d21d0e43ecafe0121e5","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDIxYjA2YmNjMTc5MzhkYzYyM2UxNGQyMWQwZTQzZWNhZmUwMTIxZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/81da056affe97b649b1ddeccb1739f1a059b0114","sha":"81da056affe97b649b1ddeccb1739f1a059b0114","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/81da056affe97b649b1ddeccb1739f1a059b0114"}],"sha":"21b06bcc17938dc623e14d21d0e43ecafe0121e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/21b06bcc17938dc623e14d21d0e43ecafe0121e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/81da056affe97b649b1ddeccb1739f1a059b0114/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:46:14Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:46:14Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"fix(M5.B): decode ADT list envelopes as `data`, not `builds`/`games`\n\nLive ADT v1.35.0 (verified 2026-05-21 against the public swagger at\ndevelop.blackbox.accelbyte.io/profiling/apidocs/api.json) returns\n`{\"data\": [...]}` on both ListGames and ListBuilds. The current decode\nkeys (`builds` / `games`) silently produce zero-row results against a\nreal ADT response, hiding the bug from any caller that does not also\nassert \"at least one row\" — Bug 1 + Bug 2 from the 2026-05-21 probe\nreport.\n\nMechanical rename of the JSON tags + decode-loop variable. No behaviour\nchange against test fixtures that already used the new shape; mem.go\nunaffected (no JSON layer). Adds two regression tests that feed the\nlegacy envelope shape and assert it surfaces as zero rows so future\ndrift back to the old key is loud, not silent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"751a4a654368c875ff1d633cbced1fa9cfab4cdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/751a4a654368c875ff1d633cbced1fa9cfab4cdf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/81da056affe97b649b1ddeccb1739f1a059b0114","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/81da056affe97b649b1ddeccb1739f1a059b0114","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDgxZGEwNTZhZmZlOTdiNjQ5YjFkZGVjY2IxNzM5ZjFhMDU5YjAxMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/808f0529291441aa9bf2794bbf208e4848c77a70","sha":"808f0529291441aa9bf2794bbf208e4848c77a70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/808f0529291441aa9bf2794bbf208e4848c77a70"}],"sha":"81da056affe97b649b1ddeccb1739f1a059b0114","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/81da056affe97b649b1ddeccb1739f1a059b0114"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/808f0529291441aa9bf2794bbf208e4848c77a70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:39:56Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:39:56Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.B): admin Recover existing linkage button on adt-link-callback\n\nBug 2 of the 2026-05-21 M5.B follow-up: the recovery agent shipped the\nRecoverADTLinkage RPC + pth CLI but no UI affordance was wired, so an\noperator re-linking a namespace ADT still flagged would dead-end at\nthe error toast. The /adt-link-callback page now:\n\n- On result=failed&reason=already_linked, shows a primary \"Recover\n  existing linkage\" button that fires RecoverADTLinkage(adt_namespace)\n  with the namespace echoed by ADT on the callback URL.\n- On any other failure reason, falls back to a secondary affordance\n  (\"If you believe ADT already has this linkage, try Recover\").\n- Surfaces the recovery mutation''s own error inline so a\n  FailedPrecondition / Unavailable from RecoverADTLinkage is visible.\n- On success, navigates back to the playtests list with a toast.\n\nAdmin codegen re-run pulls in the RecoverADTLinkage + GetADTClient-\nDiagnostics + V1WhoAmIResponse outputs that drifted out of tracking.\n+3 vitest cases pin: happy already_linked recovery, fallback affordance\non unknown reason, mutation-error surface.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be5c46046827c90a4257517f28df59186ef48cc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/be5c46046827c90a4257517f28df59186ef48cc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/808f0529291441aa9bf2794bbf208e4848c77a70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/808f0529291441aa9bf2794bbf208e4848c77a70","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDgwOGYwNTI5MjkxNDQxYWE5YmYyNzk0YmJmMjA4ZTQ4NDhjNzdhNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/812c113a98c8899be036dc35c4d29a92db1e9b6b","sha":"812c113a98c8899be036dc35c4d29a92db1e9b6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/812c113a98c8899be036dc35c4d29a92db1e9b6b"}],"sha":"808f0529291441aa9bf2794bbf208e4848c77a70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/808f0529291441aa9bf2794bbf208e4848c77a70"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/812c113a98c8899be036dc35c4d29a92db1e9b6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:39:42Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:39:42Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.B): GetADTClientDiagnostics RPC + loud bootapp gate fallback\n\nThe 2026-05-21 silent-fallback bug stranded the operator because\nbootapp''s ADT-client gate requires AuthEnabled + ADT_BASE_URL +\nAGS_BASE_URL + AGS_IAM_CLIENT_ID + AGS_IAM_CLIENT_SECRET — if any one\nwas empty in production the gate fell to MemClient and UnlinkADT''s\nADT-side DELETE became a no-op with no signal. Now:\n\n- New admin-only RPC GetADTClientDiagnostics (GET /v1/admin/namespaces/\n  {namespace}/diagnostics/adt-client-kind) reports the gate decision\n  (\"http\" | \"mem\") plus a presence boolean for each env var. Secret\n  values are never returned — only booleans.\n- bootapp''s fallback branch emits a structured WARN\n  (event=adt_client_fallback) listing each gate verdict when\n  AuthEnabled+ADT_BASE_URL are set but the AGS creds are missing — so\n  the missing variable is pinpointable from the boot log alone.\n- bootapp wires the MemClient logger (commit prior) so every\n  DeleteLinkage call site also surfaces the silent no-op.\n- pth adt diagnostics wraps the new RPC; smoke + describe-golden +\n  cli.md row land in the same commit per the smoke-with-code rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b02a7f0c756ff54c3c1f5d484931eb6cf750cff5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/b02a7f0c756ff54c3c1f5d484931eb6cf750cff5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/812c113a98c8899be036dc35c4d29a92db1e9b6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/812c113a98c8899be036dc35c4d29a92db1e9b6b","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDgxMmMxMTNhOThjODg5OWJlMDM2ZGMzNWM0ZDI5YTkyZGIxZTliNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/4fc40536a24ae91f3798d17baa6d464caeea5254","sha":"4fc40536a24ae91f3798d17baa6d464caeea5254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/4fc40536a24ae91f3798d17baa6d464caeea5254"}],"sha":"812c113a98c8899be036dc35c4d29a92db1e9b6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/812c113a98c8899be036dc35c4d29a92db1e9b6b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/4fc40536a24ae91f3798d17baa6d464caeea5254/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:39:07Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T10:39:07Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.B): MemClient.DeleteLinkage logs loud Info no-op when wired\n\nThe 2026-05-21 silent-fallback bug stranded an operator with no signal\nwhen bootapp''s ADT-client gate accidentally picked MemClient — every\nUnlinkADT call''s ADT-side DELETE became a no-op without a single log\nline. MemClient now exposes WithLogger; when the bootapp wires it on\nthe fallback branch, every DeleteLinkage invocation emits a one-line\nbreadcrumb with event=adt_mem_delete_linkage_noop so the missing AGS\ncreds become visible at every call site, not just at boot.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec6b8eb44efb98336a523d8f07064cdcb0259bcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/ec6b8eb44efb98336a523d8f07064cdcb0259bcd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/4fc40536a24ae91f3798d17baa6d464caeea5254","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/4fc40536a24ae91f3798d17baa6d464caeea5254","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDRmYzQwNTM2YTI0YWU5MWYzNzk4ZDE3YmFhNmQ0NjRjYWVlYTUyNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/58775169e0c9b4147771a2d535b344b840b033cb","sha":"58775169e0c9b4147771a2d535b344b840b033cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/58775169e0c9b4147771a2d535b344b840b033cb"}],"sha":"4fc40536a24ae91f3798d17baa6d464caeea5254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/4fc40536a24ae91f3798d17baa6d464caeea5254"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/58775169e0c9b4147771a2d535b344b840b033cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T09:48:12Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T09:48:12Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"docs(M5.B): cli.md §6.5 catalogue covers games + recover; fix §6.4 → §6.5 typos\n\n- cli.md §6.5 ADT-distribution table gains rows for `pth adt games list`\n  (B12) and `pth adt linkage recover` (today''s recovery work), and the\n  intro count flips from \"five\" to \"seven\" RPCs.\n- cmd/pth/registry.go: three ADT entries (build/games/linkage list)\n  had stale `cli.md §6.4` references — §6.4 is M4, §6.5 is M5.B. The\n  B12 agent flagged this; deferred until the recover entry also\n  needed a description tightening.\n- describe.golden.json regenerated to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8696a4e3618dbf5b79b15d08766cf3a64f6b5177","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/8696a4e3618dbf5b79b15d08766cf3a64f6b5177"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/58775169e0c9b4147771a2d535b344b840b033cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.gi