.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/326c2395fa0a7e45e65e6805c5407d7dd8ee1719/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T08:36:08Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T08:36:08Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"docs(M5.B): patch B12/B13 prose for shipped behaviour + antd portal-leak note\n\n- B12 stub-regeneration sub-bullet fixes the codegen filenames: the\n  abcodegen convention is `Adt` (TitleCase) not `ADT` in TypeScript,\n  so the emitted files are V1AdtGame.ts / V1ListAdtGamesResponse.ts\n  (matching the existing V1AdtBuild.ts).\n- B13 prose drops volatile line-number references (line ~567 / 588 /\n  73 were write-time anchors that shifted post-implementation), and\n  adds a \"Shipped notes\" bullet documenting the four post-prose\n  judgment calls: explicit Alert banner in the fallback path, linkage\n  change cascades clearing adtGameId+adtBuildId, antd destroyOnClose\n  for modal reset, and the test-suite afterEach scrub for stale\n  portal nodes.\n- engineering.md §3.4 picks up the antd v6 + jsdom Modal portal-leak\n  gotcha for the next agent that wires an antd Modal into a test\n  file — drop a `.ant-modal-confirm` / `.ant-modal-mask` afterEach\n  scrub.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb51c4cd8f3296a178a4231985341a0cab4b72d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees