URL\nagainst the 2026-05-20 ADT spec endpoints, with the AGS service IAM JWT\nattached on every call. Bootapp wires it when AuthEnabled && ADT_BASE_URL\nis configured; dev / smoke / e2e boots still fall back to MemClient so\nthe full ADT code path keeps running without an outbound round-trip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4c823dd1e046498cfd87a7619b86025333a8ee6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/b4c823dd1e046498cfd87a7619b86025333a8ee6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/6270d3d31e1b32b99b4bb32b92e0d69f1f70e2ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/6270d3d31e1b32b99b4bb32b92e0d69f1f70e2ee","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDYyNzBkM2QzMWUxYjMyYjk5YjRiYjMyYjkyZTBkNjlmMWY3MGUyZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/bbaadad6caadc74e0e6f04280bfdccf939d93295","sha":"bbaadad6caadc74e0e6f04280bfdccf939d93295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/bbaadad6caadc74e0e6f04280bfdccf939d93295"}],"sha":"6270d3d31e1b32b99b4bb32b92e0d69f1f70e2ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/6270d3d31e1b32b99b4bb32b92e0d69f1f70e2ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/bbaadad6caadc74e0e6f04280bfdccf939d93295/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T04:28:06Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T04:28:06Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"refactor(backend): emit AGS dashless user ids on the wire\n\nPostgres `user_id` / `actor_user_id` columns are typed `UUID` and pgx\nserialises them in canonical 36-char dashed form, but AGS itself uses\nthe dashless 32-char hex variant (JWT `sub`, IAM API paths, AGS portal\ndisplay). Add `pkg/agsid.Format` and route every customer-visible AGS\nuser id through it: gRPC response fields (Applicant, ParticipantRow,\nSurveyResponse, NDAAcceptance, Announcement.createdBy,\nADTLinkage.linkedBy, AuditLogEntry.actorUserId, Code.reservedBy), the\ndiscord-handle fallback, the slog `userId` field, and the AGS-user-id\nslots inside audit-log JSONB payloads (`code.grant_orphaned.userId`,\n`adt_linkage.create.linkedBy`, `announcement.create.createdBy`).\nInternal entity ids (applicantId, codeId, playtestId, surveyId,\nadtLinkageId, announcementId) remain dashed everywhere. Request inputs\nkeep working — `uuid.Parse` accepts both forms.\n\nAudit JSONB rows persisted before this change retain dashed AGS user\nids in their payloads; per PRD §6 audit rows are frozen and not\nbackfilled, so the historical drift is accepted and documented in\n`docs/schema.md`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a31104194d220b42422d5256ddb0fdd99713f98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/8a31104194d220b42422d5256ddb0fdd99713f98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/bbaadad6caadc74e0e6f04280bfdccf939d93295","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"h