ub › <title>\".\n- Status pill moves to top-right next to action buttons; \"Stop Playtest\"\n  drops danger styling per design.\n- \"Copy share link\" button replaced by an inline \"Playtest Link\" link\n  button (with copy icon) beside the date range.\n- Date range uses en-dash and compresses a shared year (\"Jun 1 – Jun 15, 2026\").\n- Info tab content wrapped in a \"Playtest Information\" card with full-width\n  divider rows; Edit moved to Card.extra to keep the test selector.\n- Distribution model + approval method rendered with friendly labels;\n  dates show full month name; Banner Image row removed (not in design).\n- New Shareable Sign-Up Link section under the card with monospace input\n  and inline Copy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c825a01eb0f1a1e8eb5d0bd6236177015fd163e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/0c825a01eb0f1a1e8eb5d0bd6236177015fd163e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/d3dde119c6b2763907f3e684fecd5a7de1f3ab34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto