S_CAMPAIGN) now host the\nfull code-pool UI inline on the playtest viewer''s Distribution tab —\nstats, low-pool banner, CSV upload / top-up / sync controls, and codes\ntable. The standalone /:playtestId/codes page and its list-row button\nare gone; ADT panel is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9613d61d461450400057f461eb5ec8c46cff8c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/a9613d61d461450400057f461eb5ec8c46cff8c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/343805d8d4ef522ce3ac5a48e01605ff0e2c590e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/343805d8d4ef522ce3ac5a48e01605ff0e2c590e","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDM0MzgwNWQ4ZDRlZjUyMmNlM2FjNWE0OGUwMTYwNWZmMGUyYzU5MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/co