antStatus/DistributionModel declarations and\n  4 inline axios-typed onError handlers across federated-element +\n  PlaytestDetailPage + 3 M5.C tabs.\n- Reconcile playtest-status pill drift (\"Published\" → \"Open\" everywhere).\n- Drop trivial useMemo wrappers, dead `stats` reduce, and leaky\n  keyof-conditional type cast on AnnouncementSendToFilter.\n- Replace announcement service''s bespoke logIfPossible with the shared\n  loggerOrDefault; drop fetchAnnouncement list-and-find scan in favour\n  of a new AnnouncementStore.GetByID.\n- Dedupe applicantStatusFilterFromPb between approve.ListApplicants\n  and participants.GetPlaytestParticipants.\n- Strip phase-narration doc-block comments per CLAUDE.md \"default to\n  no comments\".\n- Repo: scanAnnouncement uses canonical pgx.Row; remove dead\n  jsonEncodeIfPresent helper and its unused-warning keep-alive.\n- Fix lint: announcementRig struct collapses dogsled 4-blank-id tuple;\n  dmStatusFailed/Sent constants reused in approve_test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a7d9d528b98ceccb80ba05a1f154fa94ff505d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/2a7d9d528b98ceccb80ba05a1f154fa94ff505d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/ce4f9f1cdc4d29fd529c9cf215295832ed0be81b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"h