ptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/a732258ac21b6e7ef7d30882fb9fffcb88f5d0e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:58:41Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:58:41Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"docs(M5.C-phase-12): README walkthrough + admin-shell-tour + announcement-broadcast runbooks\n\n- README gains an M5.C paragraph alongside M5.A and M5.B, covering the\n  list+detail-page shell, the new tab surfaces, and the announcement\n  CLI tooling.\n- docs/runbooks/admin-shell-tour.md walks the operator through the\n  per-playtest detail page tab-by-tab + the migration 0007 note that\n  the previously-framed breaking platforms drop turned out to be moot.\n- docs/runbooks/announcement-broadcast.md documents the bulk DM\n  broadcast: at-call-time recipient resolution, aggregate status\n  semantics, the PII guarantee that keeps subject + message out of\n  audit JSONB + logs, Discord rate-limit awareness, retention policy,\n  and the pth CLI mirror.\n- STATUS_M5.md: M5.C summary row flips to shipped, C12 marked done,\n  and the in-progress note on the milestone-table row updates.\n\nThis wraps M5.C — every phase landed; main is ready for the M6\ntelemetry surface follow-up.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26db1b95cb1fe1ac188d515c1274d3fdc69b5121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/26db1b95cb1fe1ac188d515c1274d3fdc69b5121"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/a732258ac21b6e7ef7d30882fb9fffcb88f5d0e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","ev