":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/fe2c91a42c640b65c2640026337a19e5dc2ddce7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:56:28Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:56:28Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"test(M5.C-phase-11): cloud.sh M5.C auth probes\n\nscripts/smoke/cloud.sh gains three M5.C RPC reachability probes\n(STATUS_M5.md C11): GetPlaytestParticipants, CreateAnnouncement,\nListAnnouncements. Each must return HTTP 401 from the unauth path —\nanything else means the route did not register or auth regressed.\n\nThe pth dry-run smoke probes shipped alongside C10\n(scripts/smoke/pth.sh) already cover the dry-run path for the\nannouncement subcommands.\n\nThe e2e golden-m5 announcement extension stays as a placeholder\nalongside the existing TestGoldenM5Flow skip — the live in-process\nfan-out plus AnnouncementSender fake lands when the ADT adapter\nsub-phase (STATUS_M5.md B3 follow-up) wires its testcontainers\nharness.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eec2d92f13a5908284bfa1627540d87e339e894f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/eec2d92f13a5908284bfa1627540d87e339e894f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/fe2c91a42c640b65c26400263