ps://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/3abdfc42e5db6ffda73765394d1e2309aee5ec89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:55:36Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:55:36Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.C-phase-10): pth announcement create/list + describe + smoke\n\nNew CLI subcommand group:\n\n  - pth announcement create --playtest-id --send-to --subject --message\n    (validates locally + dry-runs the CreateAnnouncementRequest body)\n  - pth announcement list --playtest-id\n\nCatalogue (cmd/pth/registry.go + describe.golden.json) gains the two\nM5.C entries in alphabetical order between adt and applicant.\n\nSmoke harness (scripts/smoke/pth.sh) extends with four probes:\n  - announcement create / list happy-path dry-run\n  - announcement create rejects empty subject\n  - announcement create rejects bogus --send-to enum\n\nmake smoke green.\n\nThe pth playtest create / edit Track C flags (--banner-image-url,\n--description, --platforms) live in the existing playtest.go already;\nthe M5.C-required flag set lands without code change there.\n\nThe pth flow golden-m5 announcement step extension is deferred — the\nexisting 11-step ADT golden flow stays green; lighting up an inline\nbroadcast step requires the in-process AnnouncementSender wiring on\nthe e2e harness which lands in C11.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20c8727685639e47c3ce6ecddfd9f162ba1420b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/20c8727685639e47c3ce6ecddfd9f162ba1420b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/3abdfc42e5db6ffda73765394d1e2309aee5ec89","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/3abdfc42e5db6ffda73765394d1e2309aee5ec89","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDNhYmRmYzQyZTVkYjZmZmRhNzM3NjUzOTRkMWUyMzA5YWVlNWVjODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/c760e20ac8b72c41ae51e8ec2d