xact\n    \"banner_image_url must be an https URL\" string. Empty stays\n    allowed (the field is optional per PRD §5.1).\n  - Platforms required-validator message switches to the byte-exact\n    \"platforms must include at least one platform\" string from\n    docs/errors.md.\n\nThe full sectioned-layout rewrite from STATUS_M5.md C8 is intentionally\ndeferred — every required field (description, banner, platforms,\ndistribution model, auto-approve, ADT) already lives in the form;\nsection grouping is presentational and not blocking M5.C shipping.\nA follow-up commit will land the visual grouping if needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a79d671cae221030ee753eafbb7425d771b3f3f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/a79d671cae221030ee753eafbb7425d771b3f3f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/fc382b206865aa3e9b75d874fae9ae02a23307f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","t