05-20T07:49:22Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.C-phase-7): Discord Bot Tools tab — bulk announcements\n\nDiscordBotToolsTab renders the side-by-side form + history layout:\n\n  - Create Announcement form: Send To dropdown (All / Approved only /\n    Pending only), subject (≤200 chars), message textarea (≤4000 chars\n    with antd showCount). Submit hits CreateAnnouncement; closed-\n    playtest disables the form with the documented banner.\n  - Announcement History table: date / subject / recipients (sent/total)\n    / status pill (Sent / Sending / Partial / Failed). Empty state copy\n    matches the prototype.\n  - Validators emit the byte-exact errors.md strings on the client side\n    so the antd Form surfaces them without round-tripping.\n\nVitest +3 cases pin the closed-playtest banner, the CreateAnnouncement\nsubmit payload, and the empty-history copy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"979e5f0210f0a0709ef9a0043ff1280df603357c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/979e5f0210f0a0709ef9a0043ff1280df603357c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/a158b8af0fae21fce456edbe8f36c95a4e418da4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https