er_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/d7e0da4067dce93bbee1bc059570c79b86d0e8d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:47:55Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:47:55Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.C-phase-6): Participants tab 6-column table\n\nParticipantsTab uses GetPlaytestParticipants to render:\n\n  - Discord Handle / AGS User ID / Sign-up Date / NDA Accepted /\n    Code Sent Date / Status / Action.\n  - Inline Approve / Reject buttons on PENDING rows (hits the M2\n    ApproveApplicant / RejectApplicant RPCs).\n  - \"N / ∞ enrolled\" capacity counter using autoApproveLimit when set.\n  - Status filter dropdown (Pending / Approved / Rejected).\n\nTelemetry sections (Hardware Specs, Crash Reports, Download Date,\nTotal Playtime) are deferred to M6 per docs/STATUS_M5.md Resolved §10.\n\nVitest +1 case pins the 6-column rendering, ∞-capacity counter, and\nApprove button on PENDING rows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8644c20f19d72b7abd38ab9d875cdd44947ae76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/d8644c20f19d72b7abd38ab9d875cdd44947ae76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/d7e0da4067dce93bbee1bc059570c79b86d0e8d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ang