rodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/60730409a5e5c6800f5b190d080c1f59bceee98e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:45:23Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:45:23Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.C-phase-5): Distribution tab per-model rendering\n\nDistributionTab dispatches on playtest.distributionModel:\n\n  - ADT: empty-state card when adtNamespace is unset; populated card\n    surfaces the studio-wide linkage caveat + namespace + game + build +\n    fallback URL when linked.\n  - STEAM_KEYS: GetCodes-driven empty state (Upload Codes CTA) when\n    total=0, or remaining/granted/total counts when populated.\n  - AGS_CAMPAIGN: campaign + item summary + pool counts + sync action.\n\nEach panel keeps the same scaffold shape (heading → card → CTAs) per\ndocs/STATUS_M5.md D6. The yellow tab-dot blocker indicator lands in a\nfollow-up — not load-bearing for shipping the tab.\n\nCode-pool affordances that don''t live in the detail page yet\n(CSV upload form, sync-from-AGS button) still link out to the legacy\nCodePoolPage.\n\nVitest +2 cases pin the Steam empty-state CTA + the ADT unlinked\ncopy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"caa94dfcc90df52a16ddb2e672e51edb99b80109","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/caa94dfcc90df52a16ddb2e672e51edb99b80109"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/60730409a5e5c6800f5b190d080c1f59bceee98e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.git