ttps://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/6787d46d44507920b881820c8292dde9a2a04c3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:43:30Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:43:30Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.C-phase-4): admin shell — playtest detail page + tabs scaffold\n\nNew PlaytestDetailPage at /playtest/<slug>:\n\n  - Header carries breadcrumb + title + date range + status pill\n    (Draft / Published / Closed) + Publish (DRAFT→OPEN) /\n    Stop Playtest (OPEN→CLOSED) verbs + Copy share link.\n  - 4-tab Tabs with ?tab= query-param persistence:\n    Playtest Info / Distribution / Participants / Discord Bot Tools.\n  - Info tab renders the read-only field grid + Edit button that\n    opens the existing edit page.\n\nTabs DistributionTab / ParticipantsTab / DiscordBotToolsTab ship as\nplaceholders that link back to the legacy pages — full content lands\nin C5 / C6 / C7.\n\nPublish / Stop Playtest are pure UI copy renames over M4''s existing\nTransitionPlaytestStatus RPC; no state-machine change. M4 auto-\ntransition keeps driving the worker path unchanged.\n\nList page gains a `View` button to navigate into the detail page.\n\nVitest: 9 cases pin tab rendering, Publish/Stop visibility per status,\n?tab persistence, Info tab fields, unknown-slug warning, and the\nPublish-confirm-modal transition.\n\nadmin codegen regenerated against the M5.C proto additions\n(Announcements / ParticipantRow / send-to filter + status enums).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbfb000d818588a40163a6b87b37500c7e9c0348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/cbfb000d818588a40163a6b87b37500c7e9c0348"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/6787d46d44507920b881820c8292dde9a2a04c3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/6787d46d44507920b881820c8292dde9a2a04c3d","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDY3ODdkNDZkNDQ1MDc5MjBiODgxODIwYzgyOTJkZGU5YTJhMDRjM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/8ad889ef894c5a8106ad12df11b886d0dfca7d5b","sha":"8ad889ef894c5a8106ad12df11b886d0dfca7d5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/8ad889ef894c5a8106ad12df11b886d0dfca7d5b"}],"sha":"6787d46d44507920b881820c8292dde9a2a04c3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/6787d46d44507920b881820c8292dde9a2a04c3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/8ad889ef894c5a8106ad12df11b886d0dfca7d5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:37:15Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:37:15Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.C-phase-3): backend RPCs — announcements + participants\n\nThree new admin RPCs land per docs/PRD.md §4.7 + §5.4:\n\n  - GetPlaytestParticipants: cache-only read joining applicant +\n    last_dm_attempt_at to derive code_sent_at for STEAM_KEYS /\n    AGS_CAMPAIGN. ADT rows surface NULL code_sent_at (M6 fills the\n    analogue Download Date). Four dormant ADT telemetry cache fields\n    ship in the wire shape but stay NULL/zero across M5.C.\n  - CreateAnnouncement: resolves recipients at call time (not a stored\n    snapshot), inserts announcement + announcement_recipient rows,\n    fans out inline via the bot client. Subject + message are\n    PII-sensitive and never in audit JSONB / logs.\n  - ListAnnouncements: history with aggregate status computed from\n    announcement_recipient.dm_status.\n\nWiring:\n  - pkg/service/announcement.go + participants.go + repo/announcement.go.\n  - New audit action repo.ActionAnnouncementCreate +\n    repo.AppendAnnouncementCreate helper.\n  - PRD §5.4 \"Code Sent Date — derived field\" subsection refined to\n    read off applicant.last_dm_attempt_at instead of dm.sent audit row\n    (covers the initial-approve case which doesn''t emit dm.sent).\n  - bootapp wires the new store + reuses the existing Discord bot\n    client as the AnnouncementSender.\n  - ANNOUNCEMENT_MAX_SUBJECT_LEN / ANNOUNCEMENT_MAX_MESSAGE_LEN env\n    vars per PRD §5.9.\n\nTests cover happy path (resolution-at-call-time + PII audit canary),\nthe four CreateAnnouncement validation errors with byte-exact strings,\nclosed-playtest rejection, the Send-To filter, and three\nGetPlaytestParticipants shapes (code_sent_at derivation, ADT-row\nNULL, status filter).\n\nmake smoke green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe1cad1e28b6ef167535ff0070bd0b03fd91e7ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/fe1cad1e28b6ef167535ff0070bd0b03fd91e7ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/8ad889ef894c5a8106ad12df11b886d0dfca7d5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/8ad889ef894c5a8106ad12df11b886d0dfca7d5b","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDhhZDg4OWVmODk0YzVhODEwNmFkMTJkZjExYjg4NmQwZGZjYTdkNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/c21e3ce30ccdef4ec9d3479c90a97dce7e3ecc5a","sha":"c21e3ce30ccdef4ec9d3479c90a97dce7e3ecc5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/c21e3ce30ccdef4ec9d3479c90a97dce7e3ecc5a"}],"sha":"8ad889ef894c5a8106ad12df11b886d0dfca7d5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/8ad889ef894c5a8106ad12df11b886d0dfca7d5b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/c21e3ce30ccdef4ec9d3479c90a97dce7e3ecc5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:22:51Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T07:22:51Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.C-phase-2): migration 0007 — UX revamp data layer\n\nAppend-only schema additions per docs/schema.md §\"announcement +\nannouncement_recipient tables\":\n\n  - applicant gains four nullable ADT telemetry cache columns\n    (adt_download_at, adt_total_playtime_seconds, adt_hardware_specs,\n    adt_crash_count). All ship dormant in M5.C; M6 fills them.\n  - new announcement table with four CHECK constraints (send_to_filter\n    enum, status enum, subject 1–200, message 1–4000).\n  - new announcement_recipient join with dm_status enum CHECK and\n    composite PK (announcement_id, applicant_id).\n  - dormant applicant_adt_telemetry_stale_idx partial index — cheap to\n    maintain at M5.C cardinality, ready for M6''s refresh worker.\n\nCHANGELOG v2.6 notes that the platforms column drop from earlier scoping\nis moot — 0001 already shipped platforms TEXT[]. No column drop in 0007.\n\nFive migration unit tests pin column shapes, every CHECK rejection case,\nthe composite primary key, and the partial-index predicate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f