: full Track C scoping landed; C1 flipped to shipped,\n  M5.C marked in progress.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b14e852756d5f14d54198092c537437960d5f1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/8b14e852756d5f14d54198092c537437960d5f1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/1a511e3687e7f673716540b87a149ebf8b7e6dcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/1a511e3687e7f673716540b87a149ebf8b7e6dcf","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDFhNTExZTM2ODdlN2Y2NzM3MTY1NDBiODdhMTQ5ZWJmOGI3ZTZkY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/e9d3792e8c7e36794431ce261677c7bbe72aac5e","sha":"e9d3792e8c7e36794431ce261677c7bbe72aac5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/e9d3792e8c7e36794431ce261677c7bbe72aac5e"}],"sha":"1a511e3687e7f673716540b87a149ebf8b7e6dcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/1a511e3687e7f673716540b87a149ebf8b7e6dcf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/e9d3792e8c7e36794431ce261677c7bbe72aac5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T06:09:28Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T06:09:28Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"docs(M5.B-phase-11): ADT distribution README walkthrough + adt-linking runbook\n\nREADME \"Reproduce the golden flow\" gains an \"ADT distribution (M5.B)\"\nparagraph alongside the M4 / M5.A entries — covers the per-studio\nlinkage model, the in-app linking redirect, the per-build URL with 24h\nTTL, the static-fallback knob, and the new pth surface (linkage CRUD +\nadt build list + flow golden-m5 --dry-run).\n\nNew docs/runbooks/adt-linking.md walks the operator side end-to-end:\n- env var ladder (ADT_BASE_URL, ADT_REDIRECT_BASE_URL,\n  ADT_LINKAGE_PENDING_TTL_SECONDS) including the three ADT\n  environments from the spec (develop/staging/blackbox)\n- linking redirect flow with the studio_namespace derivation callout\n- \"Why there''s no credential rotation step\" — auth is the existing AGS\n  service IAM JWT\n- ADT playtest creation (linkage picker → game id → build picker\n  + fallback URL)\n- approve flow with the per-build URL + 24h TTL + fallback semantics\n- revocation via RejectApplicant (ADT does not expose per-applicant\n  revocation; URL stays valid until TTL or fallback rotation)\n- unlink + relink recovery for linkage flag mismatches\n\nSTATUS_M5.md B11 + M5.B milestone row flipped to shipped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70ee646dd4a9d49eb796e15e6d7a0e74e77d8399","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/70ee646dd4a9d49eb796e15e6d7a0e74e77d8399"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/e9d3792e8c7e36794431ce261677c7bbe72aac5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"s