omments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T06:07:29Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T06:07:29Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"test(M5.B-phase-10): cloud.sh M5 auth probes + golden-m5 e2e placeholder\n\nSix new 401 auth probes in cloud.sh — one per M5.B RPC (ListADTLinkages,\nStartADTLink, CompleteADTLink, UnlinkADT, ListADTBuilds,\nGetADTDownloadInfo). Mirrors the M2/M3/M4 reachability gate: each route\nmust reach the auth interceptor (anything other than 401 means the\nroute never registered or auth regressed).\n\ne2e/golden_m5_test.go ships as a placeholder — TestGoldenM5Flow skips\nwith a pointer to the follow-up sub-phase (the SDK-backed ADT adapter,\nSTATUS_M5.md B3 follow-up) that wires the live flow against ADT staging\nor a fixture-pre-seeded MemClient. M5.B end-to-end coverage stays\ncovered by:\n- pkg/service/adt_create_playtest_test.go  (B5)\n- pkg/service/adt_approve_test.go          (B6)\n- admin/src/federated-element.test.tsx     (B7)\n- player/tests/Pending.test.ts             (B8)\n- cmd/pth dry-run flow golden-m5           (B9 — pinned in pth.sh)\n- scripts/smoke/cloud.sh M5.B probes       (B10 — registered-handler gate)\n\nSTATUS_M5.md B10.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fcab178b3671f877a00e7265f9c396fa8fdbecd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/fcab178b3671f877a00e7265f9c396fa8fdbecd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/611dcbcd12128ada80c3ace56dbd4fb64d6ce622","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_