url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/7ff4d8a778bbed5d25e88db973f43211cc83ffad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T06:05:15Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T06:05:15Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.B-phase-9): pth CLI adt subcommands + flow golden-m5 dry-run\n\nAdds the `pth adt` group covering every M5.B linkage RPC:\n- `adt linkage list`\n- `adt linkage start`           — mints linkUrl + state\n- `adt linkage complete --state --adt-namespace`\n- `adt linkage unlink --id`\n- `adt build list --linkage-id --game-id`\n\nEach subcommand registers in the cli-schema.v1 catalogue with the same\nshape as the M1–M4 entries; describe.golden.json regenerated.\n\n`pth playtest create` gains `--adt-namespace / --adt-game-id /\n--adt-build-id / --adt-fallback-url` plus the ADT value on\n`--distribution-model`, threaded into CreatePlaytestRequest.\n\nNew `pth flow golden-m5 --slug <s> --dry-run` emits the 11-line ADJSON\ncatalogue for the ADT path: link-start → link-complete → adt-build-list\n→ create-playtest (ADT + --auto-approve) → transition-open → signup →\nassert-applicant-auto-approved → get-adt-download-info ×2 → audit-list\n×2. Live path intentionally gated until B10 wires the MemClient harness\nend-to-end; non-dry-run invocations error with a pointer to the next\nphase. Smoke harness extended with five dry-run probes (each adt\nsubcommand) plus the eleven-line shape assertion for golden-m5.\n\nPRD §4.8 / STATUS_M5.md B9.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6e1dfdaecc20e128e77c951cebf786caab77228","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/f6e1dfdaecc20e128e77c951cebf786caab77228"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/7ff4d8a778bbed5d25e88db973f43211cc83ffad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/7ff4d8a778bbed5d25e88db973f43211cc83ffad","node_id":"C_kwDOSF0QW9oAKDdmZjRkOGE3NzhiYmVkNWQyNWU4OGRiOTczZjQzMjExY2M4M2ZmYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AccelByte/playtesthub/commit/652ac4b6b605fbbc8463a1308722607a957a7ae8","sha":"652ac4b6b605fbbc8463a1308722607a957a7ae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/652ac4b6b605fbbc8463a1308722607a957a7ae8"}],"sha":"7ff4d8a778bbed5d25e88db973f43211cc83ffad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/7ff4d8a778bbed5d25e88db973f43211cc83ffad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anggorodewanto","id":3207091,"login":"anggorodewanto","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMDcwOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/commits/652ac4b6b605fbbc8463a1308722607a957a7ae8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T05:57:08Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T05:57:08Z","email":"anggorodewanto@gmail.com","name":"anggorodewanto"},"message":"feat(M5.B-phase-8): player ADT download view + v2.5.2 ADT spec resolution\n\nPlayer Pending.svelte branches on distribution_model: STEAM_KEYS /\nAGS_CAMPAIGN keep the granted-code card; ADT renders a download card\nbacked by fetchAdtDownloadInfo (the new client wrapper for the\nGetADTDownloadInfo RPC). Card surfaces the URL + optional expiry +\nlabels the fallback source as \"Shared playtest download (operator-\nmanaged)\" so testers can tell ADT-issued URLs apart from the static\nfallback. Three new vitest cases pin the model-conditional render, the\nexpiry banner, and the fallback-source label; the existing test\nharness gains a /adtDownload route in stubFetchByUrl.\n\n2026-05-20 ADT API spec resolved (docs/STATUS_M5.md Open Questions §1\n/ §2):\n- Download URLs are per-build, NOT per-applicant. ADT-issued URL TTL\n  is a fixed 24h CDN config; per-applicant revocation goes through\n  RejectApplicant (the URL itself stays valid until TTL expires).\n- Build picker endpoint exists; field mapping into pkg/adt.Build is\n  `id`/`game_version_name`/`game_version_id`/`platform_name`/\n  `created_at`. proto ADTBuild gains `platform` (field 5).\n- Unlink endpoint exists (best-effort from UnlinkADT).\n- List-linkages endpoint NICE-TO-HAVE — playtesthub keeps its own\n  ListADTLinkages reading adt_linkage as the write-of-record.\n- 401 means linkage missing/revoked — already mapped.\n- Production base URLs: develop/staging/blackbox.accelbyte.io.\n\nDoc + code patches:\n- docs/CHANGELOG.md v2.5.2 entry records the spec resolution + every\n  prose / code patch landing alongside it.\n- docs/PRD.md §4.7 / §4.8 / §4.8.3 / §4.8.4 / §5.1 rewritten to read\n  per-build instead of per-applicant, response keys `url` / `source`,\n  source enum `{''issued'', ''fallback''}`.\n- docs/STATUS_M5.md Open Questions section retitled \"(resolved)\" with\n  the canonical endpoints + implementation-impact subsection.\n- pkg/adt: Build gains Platform; IssueDownloadURLParams keeps\n  ApplicantIdent as audit-only with updated doc; client.go doc comment\n  block lists the resolved endpoints.\n\nPRD §4.8 / STATUS_M5.md B8 + spec resolution.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0027289f731d4363202c00ceae0753adbae6bffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/0027289f731d4363202c00ceae0753adbae6bffa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/652ac4b6b605fbbc8463a1308722607a957a7ae8","verific