audit row\n(system-attributed) on success.\n\n- proto: auto_approve + auto_approve_limit on Playtest, Create/Edit\n  requests; auto_approved on Applicant\n- repo.Playtest: AutoApprove + AutoApproveLimit fields wired through\n  Insert/Update/scanPlaytest + playtestColumns\n- repo.Applicant: AutoApproved field; ApproveCAS takes autoApproved bool;\n  new CountAutoApprovedByPlaytest for the cap query (uses migration 0005\n  partial index)\n- service: validateAutoApprove (byte-exact errors.md row); EditPlaytest\n  whitelist + EditPlaytestRequest_MutableFieldWhitelist test\n- service: tryAutoApprove inside Signup — advisory lock + count + chain;\n  silent PENDING fallback per PRD §5.4\n- audit: new applicant.auto_approved action helper, system-attributed\n- tests:\n  * pkg/service/auto_approve_test.go — promotes under cap, cap hit\n    leaves PENDING + no audit, pool empty leaves PENDING + no audit,\n    auto-approve-off no-op, manual ApproveApplicant uncapped\n  * pkg/repo/auto_approve_concurrency_test.go — 100 concurrent signups\n    vs cap=10 yields exactly 10 wins + 90 cap-hit; pool-empty mid-burst\n    yields wins=pool_size with surplus surfacing ErrPoolEmpty\n- STATUS_M5.md: A3 flipped to shipped","tree":{"sha":"8af6059cf7be12208131332a79418a64f0f58d60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/trees/8af6059cf7be12208131332a79418a64f0f58d60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AccelByte/playtesthub/git/commits/7052ea50a07097e134dbc1a6f5129198e6dee58f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3207091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anggorodewanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_